0bbd50d38e766e59dbdb156ac30a03e215f78. Optional first-party correlation veto in the same research BF/AEC runner; production DSP/API/presets/version and E001 unchanged. No threshold or timeout relaxation, no new evaluator or shipping promotion.\n\nExact head25fb8b8596d09fc1c26a130ece56b5ed5691fe9d. Verify37399637658 required summary112068817515 success; actual guard job112067695871 logs reviewed:36 disclosed scenes/144 order results/324 independent score probes/502 manifest files,9 resealed negatives, Native/sanitizer/Arm controls. Native11 controls/939 assertions,6668B state;8.338 host guard CPU ms/audio-second is not DUT timing. COMMENT technical review5423123896 is assistant self-review, not independent human approval. Live base/head and empty review threads verified.\n\nRetain mixed scientific outcome: scheduled-double admission4588->1424/13680 but scheduled-far admission26784->14508/27360. ULA4/FIR33 no-event far ratio improves post14.6280->18.1880/pre15.7434->19.5054dB; path-change degrades post9.0447->4.2719/pre12.2033->7.9085dB. Not suitable for general-purpose default promotion; fixed LAG_CORRELATION_GUARD_DEVELOPMENT_NO_PROMOTION. Lower own baselines can inflate relative recovery counts. No natural DTD accuracy or independent dataset claim.\n\nPR candidate artifact11385735640 and predecessor11385490407 retained together. Source/actual CI logs/metadata were inspected; local runtime unavailable, so no independent local ZIP rehash/rebuild/PCM audit claimed. Full FE04/#657 stays open and exact fresh-main execution remains required.","tree":{"sha":"7d125d2f7d8e984e1c11d4db2bf8bbf374fce24c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiying2007/audio-pipeline/git/trees/7d125d2f7d8e984e1c11d4db2bf8bbf374fce24c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiying2007/audio-pipeline/git/commits/8b75b95a0a3496e5df2233c223476d20eff56818","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d125d2f7d8e984e1c11d4db2bf8bbf374fce24c\nparent acc0bbd50d38e766e59dbdb156ac30a03e215f78\nauthor jiying2007 <335915