ifact11329180664 independently downloaded and reverified: 1898 manifest files, static120+steering96, native/Arm108 bitwise equal output pairs, all15 semantic negatives rejected, prior static120 outputs preserved. Steering C385705 assertions/120 configs/32000 frames/64 lifecycles per native/sanitized/Arm. Technical self-review5410676035 and live head/base/empty review threads checked.\n\nThis is engineering transition qualification, not independent speech improvement, AEC recovery, automatic DOA, a C4 shipping SDK or DUT timing. Full frontend-evolution-v1 #657 remains open. Fresh-main verification is required separately.","tree":{"sha":"723420c24b98c9c3e6fc3637610a79843caa1a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiying2007/audio-pipeline/git/trees/723420c24b98c9c3e6fc3637610a79843caa1a0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jiying2007/audio-pipeline/git/commits/c4280f111e9dd56233e3cf610704da4752eb20b9","verification":{"payload":"tree 723420c24b98c9c3e6fc3637610a79843caa1a0c\nparent 327b0e67572df5629a302dca3b474d2ce110aecf\nauthor jiying2007 <33591504+jiying2007@users.noreply.github.com> 1791181911 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791181911 +0800\n\nresearch(frontend): qualify shared-history steering and direction control (#661)\n\nExtend the existing research array with atomic continuous old/target-bank crossfades sharing one history, fixed common delay and explicit reset/mask/busy semantics. Add timestamp/confidence/anchor-coherence policy without pretending it is DOA, double-talk or speech-quality authority. Preserve installed SDK, product DSP/API/presets/version and archived acoustic criteria.\n\nPreregistered #657 comment 5988936077. Exact head db28c3e9ac3c086d1503ae544e380fb933e210ce / tree 723420c24b98c9c3e6fc3637610a79843caa1a0c. Verify 37272150275 required summary 111643226710 passed. Actual artifact11329180664 independently downloaded and reverified: 1898 manifest files, static120+steering96, native/Arm108 bitwise equal output pairs, all15 sem