158752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joao-alfagroup","id":319158752,"login":"joao-alfagroup","node_id":"U_kgDOEwX54A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/commits/33893206e8d47b22dda83ac7764bcf34b0feed4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T13:30:22Z","email":"joao.silva@alfagroup.tech","name":"joao.rodrigo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T13:30:22Z","email":"joao.silva@alfagroup.tech","name":"joao.rodrigo"},"message":"Rename project from arquitetura-mundo-real to review-patterns\n\nRenames the repo folder itself (/Volumes/Personal/arquitetura-mundo-real\n-> /Volumes/Personal/review-patterns) plus every internal identifier\nthat referenced the old name, so it''s consistent with the\nreview-patterns skill: MCP server name/description in all three\nimplementations, npm package name, Maven groupId/artifactId, the Java\npackage (com.arquiteturamundoreal.mcp -> com.reviewpatterns.mcp,\nincluding moving the source files), the .NET project file and\nnamespace (ArquiteturaMundoReal.Mcp -> ReviewPatterns.Mcp), the\nskill''s fixed knowledge-base path, and all READMEs.\n\nVerified after the rename: all three MCP servers rebuild cleanly\n(tsc, mvn package, dotnet build) and the TypeScript server was\nre-tested live over stdio - correct new server name in the startup\nlog, knowledge base resolves at the new path, get_pattern output\nunchanged (2178 chars for modelo-anemico, same as before the rename).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d5236ff54be5aa5ec532debb337ed4794c19387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/git/trees/8d5236ff54be5aa5ec532debb337ed4794c19387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/git/commits/33893206e8d47b22dda83ac7764bcf34b0feed4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/319158752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joao-alfagroup","id":319158752,"login":"joao-alfagroup","node_id":"U_kgDOEwX54A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/commit/33893206e8d47b22dda83ac7764bcf34b0feed4b","node_id":"C_kwDOUE_U3NoAKDMzODkzMjA2ZThkNDdiMjJkZGE4M2FjNzc2NGJjZjM0YjBmZWVkNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://githu