ript contract exactly,\nincluding error text for unknown slugs. Logs route to stderr so\nstdout stays clean for the MCP protocol channel.\n\nBuilt by a background agent, independently reverified here: rebuilt\nfrom source, and queried live over stdio with a real MCP client —\nlist_categories counts match the knowledge base exactly (33 entries,\nincluding the frontend-architecture fix), get_pattern matches the TS\nserver''s output byte for byte on both the found and not-found paths.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e4698d5d7a077c406ca4fba90dfbf428aed579c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/git/trees/0e4698d5d7a077c406ca4fba90dfbf428aed579c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jrodrigo887/review-patterns/git/commits/951195d42eab9b41af2752a620418659c4ceb0a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/319158752?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/joao-alfagroup","id":319158752,"login":"joao-alfagroup","node_id":"U_kgDOEwX54A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/joao-alfagroup","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jrodrigo887/