ollowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tolkamps1","id":46355612,"login":"tolkamps1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzU1NjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/commits/6e8902680540dc8546c0c595b868bef3211806db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:29:51Z","email":"46355612+tolkamps1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shaelyn Tolkamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:29:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: group favourites into folders (MAP-34, MAP-35) (#15)\n\n* feat: group favourites into folders (MAP-34, MAP-35)\n\nMembership is a single folder_id on the favourite, so a layer is in\nexactly one folder and deleting a folder never un-favourites what is\ninside it. Dragging is native HTML5, so the package still ships no drag\ndependency to its hosts. A favourite whose folder is missing renders at\nthe top level, since the two lists are separate calls and can disagree.\n\nRef MAP-34, MAP-35\n\n* fix: keep only Ungroup and report folder save errors (MAP-34, MAP-35)\n\nUngroup is the one folder action, matching MAP-35''s wording so the menu\nsays the starred layers survive. The widget copies map-api''s 50-folder\ncap to disable New folder before the API refuses it, and a moved layer\nis prepended so it lands at the top of its folder before the refetch.\n\nRef MAP-34, MAP-35","tree":{"sha":"dd9ffa7f3eeb7d94d650f22adf62ed327f29e3a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/git/trees/dd9ffa7f3eeb7d94d650f22adf62ed327f29e3a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/git/commits/6e8902680540dc8546c0c595b868bef3211806db","verification":{"payload":"tree dd9ffa7f3eeb7d94d650f22adf62ed327f29e3a8\nparent 6db619a5a9a279a1b1a052730e704729a307a88a\nauthor Shaelyn Tolkamp <46355612+tolkamps1@users.noreply.github.com> 1790022591 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790022591 -0600\n\nfeat: group favourites into folders (MAP-34, MAP-35) (#15)\n\n* feat: group favourites into folders (MAP-34, MAP-35)\n\nMembership is a single folder_id on the favourite, so a layer is in\nexactly one folder and deleting a folder never un-favourites what is\ninside it. Dragging is native HTML5, so the package still ships no drag\ndependency to its hosts. A favourite whose folder is missing renders at\nthe top level, since the two lists are separate calls and can disagree.\n\nRef MAP-34, MAP-35\n\n* fix: keep only Ungroup and report folder save errors (MAP-34, MAP-35)\n\nUngroup is the one folder action, matching MAP-35''s wording so the menu\nsays the starred layers survive. The widget copies map-api''s 50-folder\ncap to disable New folder before the API refuses it, and a moved layer\nis prepended so it lands at the top of its folder before the refetch.\n\nRef MAP-34, MAP-35","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsZO/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9YsQAEUBZOZQGx+mzwJFjXPoX/jM\nN2qXu0/Ch2WTada2qIQmttYUnhqa6oycuzvzK1ZtbFYSYjVwH7Nt+mR3HGkpesP5\npTEtrBXisN7GTkPEpYx4R4j7KBr2QY+I5IaC6wsjawWQSIvxcloBoxFYvp+6BEum\n0R41c7KBBRd4hd5gEyBTAgRR01rBDYSx6k2lxkQ+wxUdOgYZFdfkwkzY6u2qML+0\nf+zhboiL8H+s6mcmcmE+Wn233cfTYa2FW1KjRyetDcZnuOMmrot9K++tY0rX5NT8\naqxtw3iZ7IO7M9v1sGvp3vv04v6qJzx5BvY7WLfUE4Cmm4LC87blrjIsOEujWaMn\nMi94ynFutZ75lDXXePPg5JoW9KY0T9kn/8DIB6LIhy/SlcrGz1Mt6b1Xht/eKgxm\nWQdZFUdL3VBUPowkkZt6cRYG150gpBcGiSQ9bfD4pXoO3BZdvX0Pq4e3lJB