er_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcgov/EPIC.map/commit/5b7fe9a8e58d23e2a92b0f42cc29e793f094f4cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUFJBqdoAKDViN2ZlOWE4ZTU4ZDIzZTJhOTJiMGY0MmNjMjllNzkzZjA5NGY0Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcgov/EPIC.map/commit/fd472a7b8a1a23ed805c53a3f420e2b3a53d5b7f","sha":"fd472a7b8a1a23ed805c53a3f420e2b3a53d5b7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/commits/fd472a7b8a1a23ed805c53a3f420e2b3a53d5b7f"}],"sha":"5b7fe9a8e58d23e2a92b0f42cc29e793f094f4cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/commits/5b7fe9a8e58d23e2a92b0f42cc29e793f094f4cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46355612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tolkamps1","id":46355612,"login":"tolkamps1","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MzU1NjEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tolkamps1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/commits/fd472a7b8a1a23ed805c53a3f420e2b3a53d5b7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:11:48Z","email":"46355612+tolkamps1@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shaelyn Tolkamp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:11:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api): persist a user''s applied map layers (MAP-29) (#8)\n\n* feat(api): persist a user''s applied map layers (MAP-29)\n\nAdds four endpoints under /api/users/me/layers. Rows carry catalogue\nidentifiers rather than URLs, so the schema''s charset patterns are what\nkeep a value from escaping the OWS request the client builds from them.\nPOST is idempotent. Also routes marshmallow ValidationError to 400,\nwhich existing endpoints needed too.\n\nRef MAP-29\n\n* fix(api): repair lint on newly packaged schemas and utils (MAP-29)\n\n* fix(ci): drop Codecov branch override blocking fork uploads (NOBUG)\n\n* fix(api): tighten applied layer delete and package_id (MAP-29)\n\nDELETE answers 204 for any id, so a retry is not an error and the status\ncode says nothing about whose layer an id belongs to. package_id accepts\nonly a uuid: it is the CKAN package id, which survives a dataset retitle\nwhere a slug does not, and the metadata link is built from it.\n\nRef MAP-29","tree":{"sha":"9878eab977cffbf1010b8c207e6eb4b770d24ab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/git/trees/9878eab977cffbf1010b8c207e6eb4b770d24ab7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/EPIC.map/git/commits/fd472a7b8a1a23ed805c53a3f420e2b3a53d5b7f","verification":{"payload":"tree 9878eab977cffbf1010b8c207e6eb4b770d24ab7\nparent 5e03ba811a328356536b769382fa38c81535a43c\nauthor Shaelyn Tolkamp <46355612+tolkamps1@users.noreply.github.com> 1789423908 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789423908 -0600\n\nfeat(api): persist a user''s applied map layers (MAP-29) (#8)\n\n* feat(api): persist a user''s applied map layers (MAP-29)\n\nAdds four endpoints under /api/users/me/layers. Rows carry catalogue\nidentifiers rather than URLs, so the schema''s charset patterns are what\nkeep a value from escaping the OWS request the client builds from them.\nPOST is idempotent. Also routes marshmallow ValidationError to 400,\nwhich existing endpoints needed too.\n\nRef MAP-29\n\n* fix(api): repair lint on newly packaged schemas and utils (MAP-29)\n\n* fix(ci): drop Codecov branch override blocking fork uploads (NOBUG)\n\n* fix(api): tighten applied layer delete and package_id (MAP-29)\n\nDELETE answers 204 for any id, so a retry is not an error and the status\ncode says nothing about whose layer an id belongs to. package_id accepts\nonly a uuid: it is the CKAN package id, which survives a dataset retitle\nwhere a slug does not, and the metadata link is built from it.\n\nRef MAP-29","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqHEkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAP/0QAHgEiBIfKpUQI1D2tKc7q2tm\nUmbDICQriWzEfqICYuoYrb/wgowexaqTrZhY1yiahlzmkOcYaoOKoYerPIgJySog\nYF0KFjcy0fJK8+mvLuP480F1ktu/bbmVWxgLTDjpHFs2Mk1i94TQlxCqpOUSLe3M\n7FGmQqOHeceXa22Mhr2c1cTku4VqE2MVz567uYXxk4zHpDx09NIyBc0iXYRdedLR\nInBJo+IQ+ynNpMi6Zuxb5HgrO9iIrEOclT/nE7x+O9vVrYlBWaJ7wbKGjJ+Bzx9P\naroZiccuJkevqcie9xFBt5ZaLWrTNSllvUwkCarHRUg1ZgYhM+mg5LulO3wAjhat\nh1YCIbLPhtXsMjZCNaQAWiHKCO89xWUkYLExW5n0YzkYSsVCI4YMUSPNHrH1R/Bo\nAb3gzeGOAXUCRh4SpqC8+TiU3o97apTrOwfqVSzrx1hrhRPDx2ExggcTHbJu0Yb/\n/ytMnNQFO7mGXN7s/G1CuMn5kwE8+NKCOGeDV4M6VxGbrAwNgn7zH1VoRfCnBLTp\nyLA8989bX/ij+tHrDV3k3J0R7/1teNFxZQoIodpfNjpgkuB7uA48FfKLXqJQn4mc\n3Ij3EOpqnNQIpSFiEiX7cBv+5RnNFYQhwdwJdVMVRjQ6KpW6AWs2AEnbEyDMpNbO\n0I/PbWqR273bXOsEz7uB\n=zVRh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-14T22:11:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u