rce - the behaviour it already had.","tree":{"sha":"476b9c0af050247c69762abcfb71877f4baf3c52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/git/trees/476b9c0af050247c69762abcfb71877f4baf3c52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/git/commits/fd0598a50812432158f59e0206b43f415bda642c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207889?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kika","id":207889,"login":"kika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzg4OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chainstrip/mattermost/commit/fd0598a50812432158f59e0206b43f415bda642c","node_id":"C_kwDOUFRWYNoAKGZkMDU5OGE1MDgxMjQzMjE1OGY1OWUwMjA2YjQzZjQxNWJkYTY0MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chainstrip/mattermost/commit/cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5","sha":"cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/commits/cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5"}],"sha":"fd0598a50812432158f59e0206b43f415bda642c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/commits/fd0598a50812432158f59e0206b43f415bda642c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207889?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kika","id":207889,"login":"kika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzg4OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/commits/cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T06:05:50Z","email":"kika@kikap.com","name":"Kirill Pertsev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T06:05:50Z","email":"kika@kikap.com","name":"Kirill Pertsev"},"message":"sandbox: grant cove2e the platform packages its e2e suite resolves\n\nMEASURED on the 2026-09-05 baseline. The e2e suite runs with cwd\ne2e-tests/playwright, whose node_modules holds file: SYMLINKS into\nwebapp/platform/{client,types}. cove2e grants the suite child its cwd and\n<target>/node_modules, deliberately NOT the target root - so the symlink targets\nfall outside every grant, Landlock denies the read, and node reports it as\nMODULE_NOT_FOUND. The suite died in config load, captured nothing, and the\nno-evidence gate correctly stopped the run.\n\nA policy file is the seam the invariant names for exactly this: a derived policy\nis blind to everything the options do not name, and a symlink out of a sibling\nproject is not derivable from cove2e''s options.\n\nfs.rw rather than fs.ro because there is NO ADDITIVE READ CHANNEL - fs.ro\nREPLACES the derived read set, which is machine-derived from /proc/self/maps and\ncannot be restated by hand. Read access is all this needs. webapp/platform is\ninside the target and excludes the state dir by construction.","tree":{"sha":"901cdc315ba9b6138084e316e37302d35ee917fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/git/trees/901cdc315ba9b6138084e316e37302d35ee917fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/git/commits/cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207889?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kika","id":207889,"login":"kika","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzg4OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kika","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/chainstrip/mattermost/commit/cf24d23ac8be1c2af82ad2e1234d4d9be888b8c5","node_id":"C_kwDOUFRWYNoAKGNmMjRkMjNhYzhiZTFjMmFmODJhZDJlMTIzNGQ0ZDliZTg4OGI4YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/chainstrip/mattermost/commit/ebefab1fbec4f31dd73257ecb57e97dad0ef25e4","sha":"ebefab1fbec4f31dd73257ecb57e97dad0ef25e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chainstrip/mattermost/commits/ebefab1fbec4f31dd73257ecb57e97dad0ef25e4"}],"sha":"cf24d23ac8b