":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f14daef4ae3e6b8ef2c25cae2f5849ea79ae78a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:44:29Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T20:44:29Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Working clipboard: OSC 52 support, Ctrl+Shift+C/V, and plain-http fallback\n\n- Honor OSC 52 so the CLI''s \"Copied!\" reaches the OS clipboard; guard\n  against replayed history emitting stale copies after reconnect\n- Add Ctrl+Shift+C / Ctrl+Shift+V copy/paste, keeping Ctrl+C as SIGINT\n- Fall back to a textarea + execCommand when navigator.clipboard is\n  unavailable (plain-http LAN hosts)\n- Move the theme-boot snippet into an external script so script-src\n  ''self'' holds (CSP)","tree":{"sha":"caf2542c6c927929f2f81e91bf9902e26e141127","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/caf2542c6c927929f2f81e91bf9902e26e141127"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/f14daef4ae3e6b8ef2c25cae2f5849ea79ae78a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/f14daef4ae3e6b8ef2c25cae2f5849ea79ae78a6","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKGYxNGRhZWY0YWUzZTZiOGVmMmMyNWNhZTJmNTg0OWVhNzlhZTc4YTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a","sha":"f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a"}],"sha":"f14daef4ae3e6b8ef2c25cae2f5849ea79ae78a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f14daef4ae3e6b8ef2c25cae2f5849ea79ae78a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T03:07:09Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T03:07:09Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Model fetch in settings, DEC mode replay, and reconnect race fix\n\n- Settings → Models/Providers: new endpoints fetch the live model list\n  from a provider base URL and prefill name/limits/reasoning support\n  from models.dev; API keys stay request-scoped (never persisted)\n- ModeTracker remembers DEC private modes (mouse, bracketed paste,\n  alt screen, ...) from the PTY stream and replays their final state\n  before scrollback on reconnect, so client and app agree after refresh\n- AttachClient snapshots history and registers the live channel under\n  one critical section shared with emit(), making byte delivery\n  exactly-once across reconnects; covered by TestExactlyOnceAcrossReconnect\n- WebSocket sends a ''sync'' message after replay so the client refits\n  and lands the viewport on live output instead of ghost scrollback","tree":{"sha":"88df9f6451721e513db59ee2c35ec36e41bbc328","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/88df9f6451721e513db59ee2c35ec36e41bbc328"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKGY0YzkzNjYxNDRmYWMzN2QxNGM0NGNmNDEwNWEwNzU1MGM1MTBiNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084","sha":"1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084"}],"sha":"f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f4c9366144fac37d14c44cf4105a07550c510b4a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:39:27Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T02:39:27Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"install.sh: fix crash and broken prompts when piped via curl | bash\n\n- BASH_SOURCE[0] is unset for stdin scripts: guard both references with\n  :-$0 / :- defaults so set -u no longer aborts the one-liner install.\n- Detect piped runs once at top level (inside functions bash reports the\n  function name, not the file) and open a dedicated fd on /dev/tty that\n  all prompt helpers read from; stdin stays on the download pipe so the\n  parser can never eat keystrokes as script bytes.\n- Every interactive read now survives EOF/ctrl-D (menus cancel, inputs\n  fall back to defaults) instead of dying under set -e.\n- usage() is self-contained: it no longer parses $0''s comment header,\n  which is just \"bash\" under a pipe. Piped runs without a terminal now\n  print how to run non-interactively via bash -s instead of hanging.","tree":{"sha":"01ea28794be648ec34f0037594b331b6b9edf63d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/01ea28794be648ec34f0037594b331b6b9edf63d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKDFlNmVhZjQwYzIwZGE1OTk1ZGM4MGY1NTc2YWZhZmRlNTJhNmYwODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3","sha":"7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3"}],"sha":"1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/1e6eaf40c20da5995dc80f5576afafde52a6f084"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:21:37Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:21:37Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Fix release-binary detection: ''+g<sha>'' is CI metadata, not a local build\n\nReleased binaries are stamped vN+g<sha>; that must classify as the release\nchannel (up_to_date/out_of_date) rather than local. Local builds remain\ngit-describe output (''-g<sha>'', ''-dirty'') and plain ''dev''. Malformed\n''+g...'' suffixes conservatively count as local.\n\nVerified live: a build stamped v0.2+g<sha> reports channel=release,\nstatus=up_to_date against real latest v0.2.","tree":{"sha":"5e56500725797c608520e12deff3798c57d955c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/5e56500725797c608520e12deff3798c57d955c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKDdhMmI0YThmMWZjNDUwMGM1MWU3M2FjZjM4N2E1ZTVhNzk5ODBjYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711","sha":"724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711"}],"sha":"7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/7a2b4a8f1fc4500c51e73acf387a5e5a79980cb3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:17:10Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T21:17:10Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Version indicator in Settings + Grok theme integration\n\nVersion indicator (Settings panel):\n- new GET /api/settings/version reports running version vs latest GitHub\n  release (1h in-memory cache, ?refresh=1 bypass, GROK_WEBUI_UPDATE_REPO +\n  GITHUB_TOKEN overrides); /internal/version handles parse/compare/status\n- status states shown as badge in Settings -> Version: up to date (green),\n  update available (pulsing red, shows both versions), local build/ahead\n  (amber), unknown (gray); Check now button re-checks; link to releases page\n\nTheme feature (from parallel session):\n- appearance-related keys of config.toml exposed via GET /api/settings/grok/theme;\n  WebUI follows ui.theme changes and can pin a look from Settings -> Appearance\n\nAuto-release on push will pick both up.","tree":{"sha":"7c008ce09ba79c0aef53f16777f2b42cfa8c6fb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/7c008ce09ba79c0aef53f16777f2b42cfa8c6fb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKDcyNGI5ZGM5MDYyMzVhMTdiMzI2YzY2ZmMyZGNlMmQxMDg0Njk3MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f","sha":"f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f"}],"sha":"724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/724b9dc906235a17b326c66fc2dce2d108469711"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:24:14Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:24:14Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Automatic per-commit releases, GHCR images, and zero-setup curl install\n\nCI (release.yml):\n- fires on every push to main; version = v0.<run_number> (monotonic,\n  commit-based) with git tag + GitHub Release published automatically;\n  binary stamped <tag>+g<short-sha>\n- Go module/build caching via setup-go (go.sum keyed); parallel\n  amd64/arm64 matrix builds\n- publishes prebuilt image to ghcr.io/karutoil/grok-build-webui\n  (:latest + version tag) using buildx GHA layer cache\n\nInstaller:\n- standalone mode: run via ''curl ... raw/scripts/install.sh | bash''\n  without cloning; works out of ~/grok-build-webui and fetches a source\n  snapshot only when docker/--from-source needs one\n- docker mode now pulls the CI image by default and builds locally only\n  as offline fallback; systemd wrapper gained best-effort ExecStartPre pull\n- persists SVC_USER/SVC_GROUP so config/update runs don''t crash (fixes\n  id:'''') and records BINARY_SOURCE/INSTALLED_VERSION after acquisition,\n  not before","tree":{"sha":"6a93e624a781269dedb015f0ce251068963c0fce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/6a93e624a781269dedb015f0ce251068963c0fce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKGY5OGJlZjQ0OGE3MjRlOGY1MDhiMzEzNzhkMmY3OGM3ZjFmNjU2M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87","sha":"96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87"}],"sha":"f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/f98bef448a724e8f508b31378d2f78c7f1f6563f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:07:38Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:07:38Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Installer provisions the Grok CLI; fix repo links for public release\n\n- ensure_grok_cli detects grok (prefers ~/.grok/bin/grok) and, when\n  missing, offers to run the official bootstrap script\n  (curl -fsSL https://x.ai/cli/install.sh | bash); auto-installs in --yes mode\n- DEFAULT_REPO now points at karutoil/grok-build-webui so fresh clones\n  and non-git installs resolve CI release downloads without flags\n- README clone URL, Dockerfile OCI source label and .env.example REPO\n  example updated to the real repository","tree":{"sha":"a6d421e854212364aa1eb7b80c9d128055bb71bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/a6d421e854212364aa1eb7b80c9d128055bb71bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87","node_id":"C_kwDOUFULQNoAKDk2MDc2MDU1YjRjYThiZjhjNWY4MjcwOTZmYTY3MTE1NjdiZjhhODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commit/e32f5132c689d676bd50056c59fadab674283ee8","sha":"e32f5132c689d676bd50056c59fadab674283ee8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/e32f5132c689d676bd50056c59fadab674283ee8"}],"sha":"96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/96076055b4ca8bf8c5f827096fa6711567bf8a87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32721657?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/karutoil","id":32721657,"login":"karutoil","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzIxNjU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/karutoil","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/commits/e32f5132c689d676bd50056c59fadab674283ee8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:04:01Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T20:04:01Z","email":"karutoil@users.noreply.github.com","name":"karutoil"},"message":"Grok Build WebUI: browser multiplexer for Grok CLI sessions with service installer\n\nGo server that runs persistent grok PTY sessions per project in xterm.js\ntabs/splits behind auth (password + passkeys/WebAuthn).\n\nIncludes scripts/install.sh: an interactive manager that installs/updates/\nconfigures/removes the app as a systemd service — native mode (static\nbinary from CI releases, no Go needed) or docker compose mode with host\nhome mounted same-path. Tags trigger release.yml to publish checksummed\nlinux/amd64+arm64 binaries.","tree":{"sha":"7681af3c3828897165ca4cbf5dbc60939c616988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/trees/7681af3c3828897165ca4cbf5dbc60939c616988"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/karutoil/grok-build-webui/git/commits/e32f5132c689d676bd50056c59fad