users/zyj020701/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/commits/f1cd4ade9f5cdb2a7c7df2e74cdb0015a097e02e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:08:07Z","email":"2584329717@qq.com","name":"zyj020701"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T11:08:07Z","email":"2584329717@qq.com","name":"zyj020701"},"message":"fix(tickets): use solid -100/-800 chip colors to pass WCAG AA contrast\n\nThe status/priority chips on the tickets list used translucent tints\n(bg-{color}/15) with -700 text. After the color-mix token fix the info\nchip (in_progress/medium) rendered at ~4.0:1, failing Lighthouse''s\ncolor-contrast audit on /zh/tickets (a11y 0.92 < 0.95 gate).\n\nSwitch to a solid light tint (-100 bg) with a dark shade (-800 text),\nwhich also removes double-tint shifts on selected/hovered rows.\nMeasured computed-style contrast on the list page (76 chips): info 7.15,\nwarning 6.37, error 6.80, success 6.49, neutral 6.10 — all >= 4.5:1.\n\nNeutral closed/low chips were already compliant and are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"043cecd92ce50047c6a20ecb58e5962fb4b5eac2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/git/trees/043cecd92ce50047c6a20ecb58e5962fb4b5eac2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/git/commits/f1cd4ade9f5cdb2a7c7df2e74cdb0015a097e02e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/308586207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zy