://api.github.com/users/zyj020701","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/commits/2d1590be56a0b564b89258d2aa7174ab3f7ad992/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:22:45Z","email":"2584329717@qq.com","name":"zyj020701"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T07:22:45Z","email":"2584329717@qq.com","name":"zyj020701"},"message":"feat(notifications): add mock real-time feed and ticket_created notification type\n\nWithout NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL the bell never connected, so local/demo environments received no notifications. Add a framework-agnostic MockNotificationClient that shares the WebSocketClient transport contract (replays a burst then pushes periodically), a transport option in useWebSocket (mock skips tab-leader election), localized mock generator, and auto-enable mock in non-production when no WS URL is set (CI forces off; NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_MOCK overrides). Add ticket_created to NotificationType with labels and copy in all 5 locales.","tree":{"sha":"f5ec362885f9c2661d92297a45afd376315d506b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/git/trees/f5ec362885f9c2661d92297a45afd376315d506b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zyj020701/team-portal-lite2/git/commits/2d1590be56a0b564b89258d2aa7174ab3f7ad992","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/308586207?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zyj020701","id":308586207,"login":"zyj020701","node_id":"U_kgDOEmSm3w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zyj020701/orgs","received_events_u