rl":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/e81b34668acc4f012d9034cbdabea15afc0e6d3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:17:50Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:17:50Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"message":"fix(ui): keep the sidebar project filter where the user set it\n\nThe sidebar project dropdown is a session-list filter, but its\nfollow-the-host-workspace effect re-ran on every controller refresh\n(projectScope is in its dependency list) and reverted any scope the\nuser picked manually back to the host workspace. Selecting a project\nin the web companion never stuck for even one render.\n\nTrack the host workspace in a ref and only re-align the filter when\nthe host workspace actually changes; manual selections persist.","tree":{"sha":"129bbb5e8a0631476d06c219fb86cbf0c0181236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/129bbb5e8a0631476d06c219fb86cbf0c0181236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/e81b34668acc4f012d9034cbdabea15afc0e6d3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5234703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e4779","id":5234703,"login":"e4779","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/e81b34668acc4f012d9034cbdabea15afc0e6d3d","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKGU4MWIzNDY2OGFjYzRmMDEyZDkwMzRjYmRhYmVhMTVhZmMwZTZkM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692","sha":"f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692"}],"sha":"e81b34668acc4f012d9034cbdabea15afc0e6d3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/e81b34668acc4f012d9034cbdabea15afc0e6d3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5234703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e4779","id":5234703,"login":"e4779","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3c26c0877d13231c3bf16f633a74d644a6614075/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:13:32Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T07:13:32Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"message":"fix(ui): stop settings sections from shrinking under the scroll viewport\n\nsettings-scroll is a row flex container, so its child (settings-global)\nstretched to the viewport height instead of sizing to content. The\nsection wrappers kept the default flex-shrink: 1, and with content\n(~1500px) taller than the viewport the sections compressed\nproportionally: each SettingsSection card ended up shorter than its\nrows and overflow: hidden clipped them (half a Status row, a severed\nNerd Font family row). Native GPUIX gives scroll children their\nnatural height, so only the web companion clipped.\n\nalignSelf: flex-start makes the column size to content again; the\nscroll container scrolls instead of squeezing.","tree":{"sha":"28f44fdd1fb3db813f0665f3213e31523f770809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/28f44fdd1fb3db813f0665f3213e31523f770809"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/3c26c0877d13231c3bf16f633a74d644a6614075","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5234703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e4779","id":5234703,"login":"e4779","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/3c26c0877d13231c3bf16f633a74d644a6614075","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDNjMjZjMDg3N2QxMzIzMWMzYmYxNmY2MzNhNzRkNjQ0YTY2MTQwNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692","sha":"f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/f5f6fdf1dcd3279cafa422a558893a4f8b43a692"}],"sha":"3c26c0877d13231c3bf16f633a74d644a6614075","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3c26c0877d13231c3bf16f633a74d644a6614075"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5234703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e4779","id":5234703,"login":"e4779","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/4ed54c8828888407f8d5565c5ec81e9eb5217b80/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:52:32Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T06:56:50Z","email":"e4779@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Nick Ermakov"},"message":"fix(web): alias node:fs to a browser shim\n\nSettingsView renders the resolved Pi executable by calling\nresolvePiExecutable(), which probes candidate paths with\nexistsSync() from node:fs. The web aliases covered node:path but not\nnode:fs, so the import binding arrived undefined in the browser bundle\nand opening Settings threw \"TypeError: i is not a function\", blanking\nthe app.\n\nAdd a node-fs shim: existsSync reports missing so host-side resolution\ndegrades to PATH-style defaults; throwing stubs cover the mutators no\nweb surface should call.","tree":{"sha":"9b9c2629461010997561012d5c7c5c0aa0bfff2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/9b9c2629461010997561012d5c7c5c0aa0bfff2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/4ed54c8828888407f8d5565c5ec81e9eb5217b80","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5234703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e4779","id":5234703,"login":"e4779","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMzQ3MDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e4779","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykam