mits/2bfc43db98a7327d0ba6e97d652f2e5709086330/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:00:34Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T14:00:34Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"fix: keep row identity across large projections and surface bootstrap errors\n\nClearing the reuse map mid-pass dropped settled row objects once a\ntranscript exceeded the cap. Replace the map after each projection.\nA detached get_state failure now notices only if that thread is still\nopen.","tree":{"sha":"bd3252cfb62378aa25a0bc392e6d2b1101d9c7c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/bd3252cfb62378aa25a0bc392e6d2b1101d9c7c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/2bfc43db98a7327d0ba6e97d652f2e5709086330","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/2bfc43db98a7327d0ba6e97d652f2e5709086330","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDJiZmM0M2RiOThhNzMyN2QwYmE2ZTk3ZDY1MmYyZTU3MDkwODYzMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321","sha":"881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321"}],"sha":"2bfc43db98a7327d0ba6e97d652f2e5709086330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/2bfc43db98a7327d0ba6e97d652f2e5709086330"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:55:57Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T13:55:57Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"perf(linux): keep session switches interactive on Omarchy\n\nSwitching threads waited on Pi parsing the whole JSONL (5-10s on\n100 MiB sessions) because switchSession held the click lock through\nget_state. The desktop launcher cds to $HOME, so the sidebar is full\nof those threads.\n\nPaint the JSONL tail, attach the harness, mark Ready, and bootstrap\nin the background. Linux UI-thread window polls back off while\nstreaming or Opening thread so getWindowSize cannot stack 2s\ntimeouts during the remount. Session cards use an opaque sidebar\nfill for a full-tab hitbox without pointerEvents auto, which stole\nthe wheel from the list.\n\nRow identity and settled timeline reuse skip per-token rebuilds.","tree":{"sha":"34c4c25ef229465f20ec6b7019750be95820c1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/34c4c25ef229465f20ec6b7019750be95820c1bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDg4MWNmZDlhZGE0YWE4YzgyM2FmNmVmNzVhMzcwYjdlM2Y4NWQzMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5","sha":"f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5"}],"sha":"881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/881cfd9ada4aa8c823af6ef75a370b7e3f85d321"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:41:26Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:41:26Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"docs: record main lineage after PR #1 merge and the Linux perf-budget skip rationale\n\nmain is now the fork Linux baseline (fd4496d + Linux foundations, merge 67653a1); test:performance skips its 3 native-reconciler budgets on Linux because gpuix test-support is cfg-gated to macOS/Windows (wgpu image readback), so the @gpuix/react symlink is not the blocker.","tree":{"sha":"c4c6c3c842c3475372c09be6c287d2cde8dcd81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/c4c6c3c842c3475372c09be6c287d2cde8dcd81d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKGYxNzc0MmFlMDU0MGZkNzZlNmE0NjM2NzAwYTU0NmMxMWE1MTA2YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/67653a1a2bb116c41ad3f49a72f6711abf664573","sha":"67653a1a2bb116c41ad3f49a72f6711abf664573","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/67653a1a2bb116c41ad3f49a72f6711abf664573"}],"sha":"f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/f17742ae0540fd76e6a4636700a546c11a5106b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278091977?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryan-brosas","id":278091977,"login":"ryan-brosas","node_id":"U_kgDOEJNYyQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user