i.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/96835f24bc9fa0e5bdb3c141f5d6314b33f223c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:59:35Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:59:35Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"ci: retain the Linux gate and make compositor checks opt-in","tree":{"sha":"4ff04e641775ba5ac0fd9e6acb751320afbcae93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/4ff04e641775ba5ac0fd9e6acb751320afbcae93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/96835f24bc9fa0e5bdb3c141f5d6314b33f223c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/96835f24bc9fa0e5bdb3c141f5d6314b33f223c3","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDk2ODM1ZjI0YmM5ZmEwZTViZGIzYzE0MWY1ZDYzMTRiMzNmMjIzYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee","sha":"98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee"}],"sha":"96835f24bc9fa0e5bdb3c141f5d6314b33f223c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/96835f24bc9fa0e5bdb3c141f5d6314b33f223c3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:36:48Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:36:48Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"test(workspace): cover pinned diff.srcPrefix and diff.dstPrefix","tree":{"sha":"b7a4c6b59960139ba27b7109e3a487d14148525a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/b7a4c6b59960139ba27b7109e3a487d14148525a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDk4MDY3ZWQyNTgzZWNlNzVhZjEzM2FlZTNmOGNhZmZjYjcyN2M4ZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6","sha":"3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6"}],"sha":"98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/98067ed2583ece75af133aee3f8caffcb727c8ee"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:32:13Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:32:13Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"message":"Merge origin/main into fix/workspace-diff-prefix-independence\n\nPR #22 landed the same two fixes this branch carries, so the merge had to\nreconcile them by content:\n\n- scripts/install-gpuix.ts: take main''s installer. It installs the built\n  addon under its napi name, verifies the restored cache against the\n  pinned API list, and single-sources that list from REQUIRED_NATIVE_METHODS.\n  This branch''s fresh-clone guard is subsumed by it.\n- src/workspace/git-diff.ts: keep this branch''s four-key prefix pin, which\n  covers diff.srcPrefix/diff.dstPrefix in addition to main''s\n  mnemonicprefix/noprefix, and apply it to --numstat as well.\n- tests/workspace-diff.test.ts: keep the parameterized fixture and add a\n  diff.srcPrefix/diff.dstPrefix case that main''s two-key pin fails.\n- scripts/linux-compositor-smoke.sh: keep the extended compositor smoke\n  timeout.","tree":{"sha":"0ba16fb6a8353134f2c0a5114f3dfcbb79ded0bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/0ba16fb6a8353134f2c0a5114f3dfcbb79ded0bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDNmYjYzZjFhYThiZGRhNjU1NmMzZTNmM2Y5MGRkZGYyNGU4NDExYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/71295323159a49536a3f9d923ff2af694e4844bb","sha":"71295323159a49536a3f9d923ff2af694e4844bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/71295323159a49536a3f9d923ff2af694e4844bb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda","sha":"4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda"}],"sha":"3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3fb63f1aa8bdda6556c3e3f3f90dddf24e8411b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T05:37:04Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:06:13Z","email":"ryanbrosas32834@outlook.com","name":"Ryan Brosas"},"message":"fix(ci): install what the pinned runtime links against and key the cache by its producer\n\nThe gate reached a real build and failed linking:\n\n    rust-lld: error: unable to find library -lxkbcommon-x11\n\nThe Linux job installed only libwebkit2gtk-4.1-dev, libgtk-3-dev and libudev-dev,\nwhile the compositor workflow - which builds the same pinned runtime successfully -\nalso installs build-essential, clang, pkg-config, libfontconfig-dev, libssl-dev,\nlibwayland-dev, libx11-xcb-dev, libxkbcommon-x11-dev, libzstd-dev and\nwayland-protocols. Align the list.\n\nAlso fold scripts/install-gpuix.ts into the cache key: the cache holds artifacts\nthat installer produces, and the entry restored today predates the addon install,\nso it would otherwise keep restoring a runtime the API check rejects.","tree":{"sha":"b504efb623613517b6fd250d1b5f712fa837d7df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/b504efb623613517b6fd250d1b5f712fa837d7df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278091977?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryan-brosas","id":278091977,"login":"ryan-brosas","node_id":"U_kgDOEJNYyQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDRhYjVmYmY5ZmY1OGUyNWQyMDdiYTI0ZjYzZjU3Y2IwMDE0YTVlZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9","sha":"24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9"}],"sha":"4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/4ab5fbf9ff58e25d207ba24f63f57cb0014a5eda"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T05:25:56Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:06:13Z","email":"ryanbrosas32834@outlook.com","name":"Ryan Brosas"},"message":"fix(native): keep setTerminalFrame required and single-source the check\n\n16c6d3c dropped setTerminalFrame from the required runtime API to make the\ninstaller check pass. That hides the cause instead of fixing it: the app asserts\nthe same list at startup (src/main.tsx -> assertNativeRuntime) precisely to tell\nthe user to run setup:native when the pinned runtime is not installed, and\nsrc/ui/terminal-view.tsx calls setTerminalFrame. The check was failing because\nthe pinned addon was never installed, which 8df6573 fixes by installing it.\n\nThe installer now derives its check from src/native-runtime.ts, so the two\ncannot drift again.\n\nEvidence: with the pinned addon installed, the check passes on this Omarchy box;\nwith the published platform package only, it reports Missing native API:\nsetTerminalFrame.","tree":{"sha":"4f0f44527366a94b035304e11785d464aa04b74b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/4f0f44527366a94b035304e11785d464aa04b74b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278091977?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ryan-brosas","id":278091977,"login":"ryan-brosas","node_id":"U_kgDOEJNYyQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9","node_id":"C_kwDOUFluPtoAKDI0Yzg1MjNlMjNkMzBiYmUxNjA2ZWUxOWZhZDJkODBlNTdiZmNmZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary/heddlework/commit/fe62a5a787686f0ae385bf2cfd23fbd2f4fc12f0","sha":"fe62a5a787686f0ae385bf2cfd23fbd2f4fc12f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/fe62a5a787686f0ae385bf2cfd23fbd2f4fc12f0"}],"sha":"24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/24c8523e23d30bbe1606ee19fad2d80e57bfcfe9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/fe62a5a787686f0ae385bf2cfd23fbd2f4fc12f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T05:16:37Z","email":"utopia@omarchy.local","name":"utopia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T06:06:13Z","email":"ryanbrosas32834@outlook.com","name":"Ryan Brosas"},"message":"fix(ci): install the pinned native addon and verify a restored cache\n\nThe Linux gate got past the dependency guard and failed on the next step:\n\"Missing native API: setTerminalFrame\". @gpuix/react re-exports GpuixRenderer\nfrom @gpuix/native, whose loader prefers a .node in its own directory and only\nthen falls back to the published platform package, so the pinned build was never\nthe binary under test.\n\n- Install the built addon and its declarations over the package the app resolves.\n- Trust a restored cache only after it answers the API check: a stamp without its\n  artifacts, or with artifacts that no longer answer, forces a rebuild.\n\nVerified on this box by re-materializing the published packages the way a fresh\nclone does (rm -rf node_modules/@gpuix/{react,native} && bun install\n--frozen-lockfile): before, the check graded the published binary; after,\nnode_modules/@gpuix/native/gpuix-native.linux-x64-gnu.node is the pinned build.\n\nAlso rewrote the local build stamp to the format this branch''s installer writes,\nafter confirming the runtime answers; the next setup:native run only rebuilds if\nthat verification fails.","tree":{"sha":"ab00e04a235819eb72bdc0a6f43bf7c1955e05be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/ab00e04a235819eb72bdc0a6f43bf7c1955e05be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/fe62a5a787686f0ae385bf2cfd23fbd2f4fc12f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/278091977?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryan-brosas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: