b.com/users/monotykamary","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/commits/3dc151be37533ad45aaae76d2b6746d830f09ced/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:57:20Z","email":"tom81094@gmail.com","name":"Tom X Nguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T06:57:20Z","email":"tom81094@gmail.com","name":"Tom X Nguyen"},"message":"perf(terminal): accelerate OpenTUI fullscreen frames\n\nParse OpenTUI changed-cell runs directly from synchronized PTY bytes,\nincluding its hidden-cursor envelope, mixed glyphs, color modes, and\nattributes. Suspend duplicate right-terminal projection while the bottom\nterminal is fullscreen and freeze its hidden service snapshot.\n\nUpdate the high-resolution probe to match the upstream OpenTUI wire shape\nand cover parser fallback, Unicode cells, projection count, and PTY size\nownership.","tree":{"sha":"64e53519c702de3c9dcdb33c3f5e516d7513e7bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/trees/64e53519c702de3c9dcdb33c3f5e516d7513e7bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/monotykamary/heddlework/git/commits/3dc151be37533ad45aaae76d2b6746d830f09ced","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1130103?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/monotykamary","id":1130103,"login":"monotykamary","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzAxMDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/monotykamary/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo