":"2026-08-27T04:56:30Z","committedDate":"2026-08-27T04:56:30Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:23:58.391Z","repositoryId":1348061777,"sha":"36eb52130a24426407471b5b301e1af206154f14"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-27T04:55:02Z","committedDate":"2026-08-27T04:55:02Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:23:58.391Z","repositoryId":1348061777,"sha":"abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-27T00:46:26Z","committedDate":"2026-08-27T00:46:26Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:23:58.391Z","repositoryId":1348061777,"sha":"74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-26T23:49:57Z","committedDate":"2026-08-26T23:49:57Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"ovitaliw","providerType":"User"},"email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:23:58.391Z","repositoryId":1348061777,"sha":"7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:23:58.391Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:58:40Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:58:40Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(2.1d): o log da reconciliacao passa a dizer o motivo em risk e edge-bff\n\nCom o Havoc fora do ar no boot, o log de erro e a UNICA testemunha de que a\nreplica subiu sem caos nenhum — e em duas das quatro linguagens ele nao dizia\nnada util:\n\n  risk (Python)   error=\"\"                              <- string vazia\n  edge-bff (TS)   \"AbortError: This operation was aborted\"\n\nA causa e a mesma nos dois: `str(exc)` e `String(err)` nao sao fontes confiaveis\nde diagnostico. O timeout do httpx chega como ConnectTimeout, cujo str() e vazio\n(confirmado: o repr agora imprime `ConnectTimeout('''')`), e o do fetch chega como\nAbortError generico, que nao diz qual operacao, contra quem, nem por quanto tempo\nse esperou.\n\nAgora as duas linhas carregam url, target, timeout e tipo do erro — Python com\nexc_info, TS com nome e mensagem mais o timeout quando e abort. Go e C# ja estavam\ncorretos e nao foram tocados.\n\nVerificado ao vivo (havoc parado, replicas reiniciadas): as duas linhas levam a\ncausa sozinhas, e os dois servicos continuam subindo healthy com readiness intocada.\n\nCorrecao do mentor, fora da entrega 2.1d.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf77c3689a3750b1e1704f48d31fa378a9dd731a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/bf77c3689a3750b1e1704f48d31fa378a9dd731a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDgyOWUzMDA5MDdjNDRkY2Q3YmVhODExMzRiNmEwNzM4ZGRkNjRmMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221","sha":"0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221"}],"sha":"829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:55:38Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T00:55:38Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(2.1d): reconciliacao do subscriber no boot (list-then-watch)\n\nRedis pub/sub entrega para quem esta escutando e nao retem nada: uma replica que\nreiniciava com uma fault ativa nunca ficava sabendo dela, e o Havoc continuava\nreportando `active`. Medido: alternancia perfeita entre a replica reiniciada\n(0.054s) e a irma que nunca caiu (2.05s), com metade do trafego sem caos.\n\nCada subscriber agora assina o canal, busca GET /faults/snapshot?target= no Havoc\ne mescla no cache local. A ordem e o ponto: assinar-antes-de-buscar troca um risco\nde perda permanente (declaracao feita na janela entre as duas operacoes) por um\nrisco de duplicata, que o dedupe por id resolve.\n\nO snapshot inclui as `superseded` e vem em ordem de criacao, para que uma replica\nreiniciada escolha a mesma vencedora que uma que nunca caiu — inclusive depois de\numa revogacao promover a proxima sobrevivente.\n\nTTL: o Havoc devolve o RESTANTE, computado contra o relogio dele, e o subscriber\nfaz `agora + restante`. Semear com o valor cheio ressuscitaria a fault a cada\nrestart; ler o createdAt do publicador quebraria a regra de nao consultar relogio\nremoto. Um relogio so decide. Medido: fault de ttl 45s com replica reiniciada em\nT+20 expira em T+45 nas duas, nao em T+65 na reiniciada.\n\nHavoc fora do ar no boot: servico sobe, readiness intocada, erro no log, cache\nvazio. Sem retry/backoff — isso e material do aprendiz a partir de 2.4.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e59a74cc07b13fc14f9d64d90e4343ae2b212640","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/e59a74cc07b13fc14f9d64d90e4343ae2b212640"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDBmMGQwMzNiYWFmOWE5MTIxYzI5YjA2N2RkMWU5MDA5OWEyOWMyMjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270","sha":"044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270"}],"sha":"0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0f0d033baaf9a9121c29b067dd1e90099a29c221"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:57:26Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:57:26Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(2.1d): handoff da reconciliacao do subscriber no boot\n\nBuraco de escopo do briefing da 2.1, medido ao vivo: replica reiniciada perde toda fault declarada e o Havoc continua reportando active. Assinar-antes-de-buscar, dedupe por id, e TTL restante computado pelo relogio do Havoc para nao quebrar a regra de nao consultar relogio remoto.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f81e56c3c1df4c26af6ab73a31727aabaab18b74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/f81e56c3c1df4c26af6ab73a31727aabaab18b74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDA0NDg4NjYwMWJmNmRkZTU5NmZjYWJjZmEzMDEwYmMyZDNiYWEyNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/1066aa971a52b7e3bf41fdd56031590a06e40cbb","sha":"1066aa971a52b7e3bf41fdd56031590a06e40cbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1066aa971a52b7e3bf41fdd56031590a06e40cbb"}],"sha":"044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/044886601bf6dde596fcabcfa3010bc2d3baa270"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1066aa971a52b7e3bf41fdd56031590a06e40cbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:37Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T23:56:37Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(2.1c): last-write-wins entre faults do mesmo (target, op)\n\nDuas faults nao-revogadas e nao-expiradas casando o mesmo (target, op) faziam a\nmais ANTIGA vencer. Combinado com o `inert` da 2.1b, uma fault de probability 0\ndeclarada antes de uma ativa silenciava aquele ponto ate o TTL vencer — e o\nGET /faults reportava a nova como active. Medido: 0.054s com a inert presente,\n2.995s depois de revoga-la.\n\nAgora vence a ultima declarada, inteira (v0 continua sem compor faults). \"Ultima\"\ne a ordem de chegada em cada subscriber, nunca o relogio do publicador — mesma\nregra que ja vale para o calculo local do TTL.\n\nNovo status `superseded`: a unica das cinco que e propriedade do CONJUNTO e nao\nda linha, calculada por (target, op) sobre as sobreviventes. Fecha o mesmo buraco\nde vocabulario que gerou o `inert` — um estado real do sistema que nao tinha nome\nera reportado como o vizinho mais proximo, e o vizinho era `active`.\n\nRevogar a vencedora nao precisa de promocao explicita: Match reconsulta o conjunto\na cada chamada, entao a proxima sobrevivente mais recente reassume sozinha.\n\nTestes de precedencia nos cinco pacotes — nenhum existia; era propriedade emergente\nda ordem de iteracao.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a73789af5a4475ecf215965fae0f57c13652d7f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/a73789af5a4475ecf215965fae0f57c13652d7f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/1066aa971a52b7e3bf41fdd56031590a06e40cbb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/rec