3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:55:07Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:55:07Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(2.1c): handoff da precedencia entre faults do mesmo (target, op)\n\nLast-write-wins, decidido com o aprendiz. Inclui os dois cenarios medidos ao vivo e o buraco de vocabulario que os gerou: uma fault declarada, valida e sem efeito nao tem nome, entao o GET /faults a reporta como active.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13b10a5100d09142da8550701c833fa84271f732","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/13b10a5100d09142da8550701c833fa84271f732"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/c72884b4eec93e1feea91710a4a55e03ffd7ad73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/c72884b4eec93e1feea91710a4a55e03ffd7ad73","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGM3Mjg4NGI0ZWVjOTNlMWZlZWE5MTcxMGE0YTU1ZTAzZmZkN2FkNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/4eb4b4cb60bc0ffe7090d54c702c405d5a272340","sha":"4eb4b4cb60bc0ffe7090d54c702c405d5a272340","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/4eb4b4cb60bc0ffe7090d54c702c405d5a272340"}],"sha":"c72884b4eec93e1feea91710a4a55e03ffd7ad73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/c72884b4eec93e1feea91710a4a55e03ffd7ad73"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/4eb4b4cb60bc0ffe7090d54c702c405d5a272340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:54:28Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:54:28Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(2.1b): correcoes da revisao do Havoc v0\n\nprobability passa a ser obrigatorio em POST /faults (400 quando ausente — o\ncampo era float64 puro, entao ausencia e zero explicito eram indistinguiveis, e\nzero significava \"nunca dispara\" numa fault anunciada como active). Ganha o\nstatus `inert`: declarada, valida, e sem efeito — o estado que nao tinha nome.\n\nO atributo havoc.fault.* passa a ser escrito antes de qualquer espera, nas\nquatro linguagens. Em Go ele sumia do span quando o chamador desistia, que e\njustamente o cenario de toda a Fase 2.\n\nA latencia injetada deixa de respeitar cancelamento do chamador, uniformemente:\na falha simula um servidor lento, e um servidor lento nao fica rapido porque o\ncliente desligou. Sem isso o lab-04 mediria um retry storm mais brando que o real.\n\nLabs 01 e 02 param de imprimir target/op/mecanismo/magnitude na saida (regra de\nvazamento, docs/labs/TEMPLATE.md). A segmentacao small/large do lab-01 volta pelo\nop: AccountsRepository escolhe entre internal:checkCredit e internal:checkCredit.large\nconforme o valor — o Havoc continua so casando string exata.\n\nFlush do OTel sai de dentro da sequencia de shutdown do aprendiz no edge-bff e vai\npara signals.ts, espelhando cmd/transfers/main.go.\n\nTestes onde nao havia nenhum: 9 casos no servico havoc, 6 no subscriber de\nreferencia em Go (com testing/synctest), mais regressao em C#, Python e TS.\n\nMedido apos as correcoes: lab-01 small p50=14.69ms / large p50=1518.35ms.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4074410891f2661163d78fff48c1192bb79867d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/4074410891f2661163d78fff48c1192bb79867d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/4eb4b4cb60bc0ffe7090d54c702c405d5a272340","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https:/