os","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2a905105da5125c022e9e40dfebe6f59dd11667a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:06:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:06:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(2.1b): handoff das correcoes do Havoc v0; CLAUDE.md sem a assimetria da Fase 0\n\nCinco defeitos confirmados ao vivo na revisao da 2.1, com a medicao junto no handoff. Decide tambem a semantica de cancelamento da latencia injetada (nao cancelavel) e o padrao de op segmentada por dominio escolhida pelo servico, nao pelo Havoc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"75c6046f3395d90fe4c0b5287cdb0cf3e76c1a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/75c6046f3395d90fe4c0b5287cdb0cf3e76c1a5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/2a905105da5125c022e9e40dfebe6f59dd11667a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2a905105da5125c022e9e40dfebe6f59dd11667a","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDJhOTA1MTA1ZGE1MTI1YzAyMmU5ZTQwZGZlYmU2ZjU5ZGQxMTY2N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a","sha":"2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a"}],"sha":"2a905105da5125c022e9e40dfebe6f59dd11667a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2a905105da5125c022e9e40dfebe6f59dd11667a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:03:56Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T22:03:56Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(2.1): Havoc v0 — plano de controle de caos e middleware nos 4 servicos\n\nNovo servico `havoc` (Go, 8090, Postgres+Redis): POST/GET/DELETE /faults,\npersistencia duravel e publicacao no canal Redis `havoc:faults`.\n\nMiddleware de injecao nos quatro servicos, assinando o mesmo canal e aplicando\nlatency/error/exception. Op casada exatamente, em dois estilos: `http:<METODO> <rota>`\n(registrado no ponto de roteamento, para que o fault `error` possa nem chamar o handler)\ne `internal:<nome>` para pontos que nao sao borda HTTP. TTL calculado localmente por\ncada replica no momento do recebimento — sem coordenacao central de expiracao.\n\nAs injecoes ad-hoc dos labs 01 e 02 saem de dentro de AccountsRepository e viram\nfaults declarados via HTTP; AccountsOptions perde Lab01Param*/Lab02*.\n\n`risk` e `edge-bff` ganham o primeiro bootstrap de OpenTelemetry — sem tracer nao ha\ncomo verificar o criterio de pronto da entrega (fault visivel como atributo de span).\n\nNenhum padrao de resiliencia foi implementado: timeout, retry, backoff, circuit breaker\ne bulkhead seguem TODO(aprendiz) das entregas 2.4 em diante.\n\nRevisao empirica desta entrega registrou cinco defeitos, corrigidos na 2.1b.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ec285f9dcacece7102f74cd8766ffb742ab05eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/0ec285f9dcacece7102f74cd8766ffb742ab05eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDJlYzdjMWE1ZWUyNzU0ZDU3NmFjMWZlNmQwZDI0ODhmNGM1NDBhNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7","sha":"19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7"}],"sha":"2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2ec7c1a5ee2754d576ac1fe6d0d2488f4c540a6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:40:33Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:40:33Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-2): briefing da resiliencia sincrona\n\nEscrito ANTES do /compact de propósito -- ele depende das conclusoes da\nretrospectiva da Fase 1, que so existiam no historico da conversa.\n\nConceito: morto e facil, doente e que derruba. Servico lento aceita a conexao,\nsegura a requisicao e responde 200 tres segundos depois; o health check fica\nverde, o balanceador continua roteando, e o recurso preso do lado de ca e o que\nmata. A cascata se propaga por um recurso compartilhado que ninguem mapeou -- o\npool de conexoes -- e o formato reaparece com outras roupas: threads, semaforo,\nbuffer, event loop.\n\nA fase nao e lista de boas praticas, e uma sequencia causal: cada padrao existe\nporque o anterior nao bastou. Retry ingenuo PIORA o sistema, e isso e resultado\nmedido no lab-04, nao retorica.\n\nEstrutura diferente da Fase 1: cada lab e seguido imediatamente pela\nimplementacao dele, em vez de acumular seis labs antes da primeira linha. Um\nconceito por vez, dor antes do remedio. 14 entregas, seis padroes escritos pelo\naprendiz em pelo menos duas linguagens.\n\nOs handoffs dos labs 03 a 08 ficam sob demanda -- o desenho de cada um depende do\nque o anterior revelou. Todos herdam as quatro regras ja institucionalizadas:\nhonestidade da metrica, regra de vazamento, fazibilidade do TODO e runbook com\ncontexto de negocio.\n\nA 2.1 (Havoc v0) resolve duas dividas registradas: a assimetria do middleware\nentre os quatro servicos, e as injecoes ad-hoc dos labs 01 e 02 que vivem dentro\ndo AccountsRepository.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e80c917b83730d9624cc672ad1ef527b740ca87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/9e80c917b83730d9624cc672ad1ef527b740ca87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDE5ZWZkYTJmNTAyMThlYzU4ODc4MmEyMWY1NDU5OWUxM2Q4ZjlkZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54","sha":"b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54"}],"sha":"19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/19efda2f50218ec588782a21f54599e13d8f9dd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:38:15Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:38:15Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: niveis do catalogo apos a Fase 1\n\nContestacao do aprendiz aceita e mais precisa que a proposta: ler a lacuna no\nwaterfall e simples depois que se entende a estrutura dos registros; o que e\ndificil e CHEGAR no trace que tem o problema. Linha dividida em duas, com niveis\ndiferentes -- ler a lacuna fica 🎓, chegar ao trace certo fica 🔨, porque instinto\nde onde olhar e o que filtrar vem de repeticao e ele fez uma vez.\n\nCardinalidade reformulada com o enquadramento dele: e sintoma de metrica tentando\nfazer papel de trace, nao so custo.\n\nQuatro conceitos que a fase ensinou e nao estavam previstos entram no catalogo:\nler a lacuna, chegar ao trace certo, span responde onde e atributo responde por\nque, e span autodescritivo -- este ultimo formulado por ele.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"49fc35b100bfc7e845d95b0b0ee7afe82ee376d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/49fc35b100bfc7e845d95b0b0ee7afe82ee376d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGI1YWNiMWQxZTkwZTVjZDMyYzM4YzAxNmQyOTJlMDU2MmJjNjRhNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38","sha":"197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38"}],"sha":"b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b5acb1d1e90e5cd32c38c016d292e0562bc64a54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:38:15Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T16:38:15Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"chore(1.6): experimento de cardinalidade comentado, com lembrete no endpoint\n\nO contador com o id da conta como label fica comentado no codigo, com o lembrete\ndo aprendiz no endpoint de credito.\n\nNumeros medidos, duas execucoes do lab-01 em cada cenario:\n\n  sem AddMeter    Collector ~100 MB   count({__name__=~\"nimbus.*\"}) sem dados\n  com AddMeter    Collector ~145 MB   count(...) ~850 series\n\n850 series de duas rodadas de um lab num laptop -- uma serie por conta distinta,\n~53 KB por serie no Collector. Extrapolando para um milhao de contas: um milhao\nde series de UM unico contador, e isso por metrica e por replica.\n\nO detalhe que fecha o raciocinio: a explosao bate no Collector antes de bater no\nPrometheus, porque o exporter mantem uma agregacao em memoria por conjunto de\nlabels. E o Collector morre FORA do caminho da requisicao -- o servico continua\nrespondendo 201 enquanto a telemetria inteira para de chegar.\n\nEnquadramento do aprendiz, melhor que o meu: alta cardinalidade em metrica e\nSINTOMA de que a metrica esta tentando fazer papel de trace usando dado de\nnegocio. A pergunta certa nao e quanto custa, e se foi intencional ou erro de\ninstrumentacao.","tree":{"sha":"1ebb72b5e8ae1a0eea4ea7e67745dedfa825dc02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/1ebb72b5e8ae1a0eea4ea7e67745dedfa825dc02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDE5Nzc2NGQxYzYxY2Q3MmVkNWJlZTdiMTUyMTIyNDY1NjIwYjRmMzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934","sha":"855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934"}],"sha":"197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/197764d1c61cd72ed5bee7b152122465620b4f38"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:22:15Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T02:24:28Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.6): instrumentacao manual e concorrencia otimista\n\nImplementacao do aprendiz -- os dois nucleos que a Fase 1 reservava para ele.\n\nlab-01 -- instrumentacao manual em accounts\nDiagnostico feito sem abrir o editor, pelo caminho que a fase queria ensinar:\np95 contra p50 no RED do transfers (16.9ms contra 1.7s), traces no Tempo\nordenados por duracao com health/metrics filtrados, e o waterfall mostrando a\nlentidao concentrada entre a primeira e a segunda query do credit -- um intervalo\nque nenhum span cobria.\n\nA correcao usa os dois instrumentos que a lacuna exigia, e nao so um: um SPAN\n(nimbus.account.credit.checkCredit) para dar nome ao intervalo, e um ATRIBUTO\n(amount) para explicar por que so algumas requisicoes sao lentas. Span responde\nonde, atributo responde por que; um sem o outro deixa metade da pergunta aberta.\nResultado visivel no Tempo: checkCredit em 1.49s com amount=1500000 contra 3.8us\ncom amount=5000.\n\nlab-02 -- concorrencia otimista em DebitAsync\nOs DOIS casos implementados, que e onde a maioria para no meio:\n  1. o chamador ja chegou desatualizado -- account.Version != expectedVersion,\n     detectavel na leitura;\n  2. duas leituras concorrentes viram a mesma versao fresca -- so detectavel na\n     escrita, capturando DbUpdateConcurrencyException do SaveChangesAsync.\nTratar um nao cobre o outro.\n\nResultado: lab-02 em 10/10 rodadas no padrao \"1 sucesso + 1 conflito limpo (412)\",\nzero falhas nao decididas -- era 20/20 no padrao quebrado. Testes de accounts\n13/13, o vermelho intencional fechado.\n\ntransfers -- instrumentacao propagada\nSpans de negocio nos handlers, no service e no client HTTP, com RecordError +\nSetStatus nos caminhos de erro e trace_id na linha de log que fecha a ponte\ntrace<->log. O ctx foi propagado corretamente na cadeia (r.Context -> ctx ->\nCreate), que e onde o achatamento do waterfall faria mais estrago em Go.\n\nTres bugs encontrados na revisao e corrigidos: attribute.String(\"amountCents\",\nid.String()) estava gravando o id da conta no lugar do valor; em GetAccount a\nrequest era construida antes do tracer.Start, o que penduraria o span do otelhttp\nno pai em vez de no span novo; e SetStatus(Ok) era chamado antes da requisicao\nacontecer. Mais dois typos que teriam vivido para sempre no Tempo (getACcount e\num escopo de instrumentacao \"nimbus.trasnfer\").\n\nDecisao consciente do aprendiz apos discutir o trade-off: o span de negocio do\ndoAccountRequest fica separado do span de transporte do otelhttp, em vez de\nanotar o do chamador via trace.SpanFromContext.","tree":{"sha":"b4b6e52d5aae3c9f59578d152c390996abd59cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/b4b6e52d5aae3c9f59578d152c390996abd59cb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDg1NWE5NmRhNzEzYTNmZjJhOGVkMjljOGI4YjY5YzYyYTY3ODU5MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450","sha":"e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450"}],"sha":"855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/855a96da713a3ff2a8ed29c8b8b69c62a6785934"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:55:07Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T16:55:07Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-1): criterio do lab-01 passa a ser o caminho, nao o cronometro\n\nPedido do aprendiz na primeira execucao do lab, e ele tem razao: cronometro so\nmede diagnostico quando a ferramenta ja e familiar. Antes disso mede\nfamiliaridade -- era a primeira vez dele com Tempo e trace distribuido.\n\nO criterio passa a ser o percurso: p95 contra p50 (nao a media), trace ordenado\npor duracao com o ruido de health/metrics filtrado, waterfall, e a lacuna que\nnenhum span cobre. Foi exatamente o que ele fez.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48facc7bf85ea817f2ad837e0620d228d2e8a01e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/48facc7bf85ea817f2ad837e0620d228d2e8a01e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGU2ZGNjNDliMTI0MWM0ZDQ2YTE4MzE2Yzc1MjY2MWFhMDE2NDc0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3","sha":"7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3"}],"sha":"e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/e6dcc49b1241c4d46a18316c752661aa01647450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:26:20Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T13:26:20Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(1.5b): tira os vazamentos do lab-01\n\nO lab contava a resposta em quatro lugares antes do <details> de causa raiz. Saiu\no nome do metodo e a condicao da tabela de injecao, saiu o echo do run.sh que\nimprimia a injecao a cada execucao, as variaveis de ambiente ganharam nomes\nneutros, e as perguntas de diagnostico pararam de embutir a propria resposta.\n\nO mentor ajustou mais dois pontos que sobraram na mesma linha: a tabela \"O que\nobservar\" e a pergunta 3 ainda apontavam direto para o span\nPOST /accounts/{id}/credit -- e achar esse span lendo o waterfall de cima para\nbaixo E o exercicio da fase. Agora apontam para o trace inteiro.\n\nVerificado que o rename das env vars nao quebrou a injecao: large p50 1523ms\ncontra small p50 15.8ms, mesma ordem de grandeza de antes.\n\nDocumentado um ruido conhecido: em ~0.1% das requisicoes o k6 sai com codigo 99\npor uma transferencia falha. A causa e o TODO de concorrencia ainda aberto --\ndurante os 1500ms da injecao o CreditAsync segura a conta carregada, e uma\noperacao concorrente sobre a mesma conta colide. Deve zerar quando o lab-02\nfechar. O sinal do lab e a diferenca de latencia, nao a contagem de erros.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.5b-vazamento.md","tree":{"sha":"ac55b46f62bec07dc1397107761e7f41cfba86a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/ac55b46f62bec07dc1397107761e7f41cfba86a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDdhMDc0ZDY0YzhkNTViMTMwMTg2YjdlZjYzMWU3NzlmZDQ0OTdlZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e","sha":"b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e"}],"sha":"7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7a074d64c8d55b130186b7ef631e779fd4497ed3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:44:42Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:44:42Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-1): handoff 1.5b e regra de vazamento no template de labs\n\nO lab-01 conta o que o aprendiz deveria descobrir, em quatro lugares, todos antes\ndo <details> de causa raiz. Parte da culpa e do handoff da 1.5, que autorizava\ndizer onde comecar a olhar -- num lab cujo ponto e localizar algo, onde olhar e a\nresposta.\n\nRegra fixada no topo de docs/labs/TEMPLATE.md: pode nomear qual sinal consultar;\nnao pode nomear local no codigo, mecanismo, condicao de gatilho, nem o formato do\nachado; as perguntas de diagnostico nao podem conter a resposta embutida; e o\nrun.sh nao pode imprimir a injecao.\n\nA 1.5b e entrega de redacao e de nomes, nao de comportamento -- o mecanismo da\ninjecao e os numeros ficam como estao, porque o desenho esta certo e foi provado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f20ed34b62a75195279237eeaee0837bf1b29f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/f20ed34b62a75195279237eeaee0837bf1b29f4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGIwYjQ5Yzc5YzRiYTYxNWFjYmM5ZWI4NjhkMmJjMWJiNGFlMWQ0NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d","sha":"0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d"}],"sha":"b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/b0b49c79c4ba615acbc9eb868d2bc1bb4ae1d44e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:44:42Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:44:42Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.5): lab-01-trace-cego e lab-02-atualizacao-perdida\n\nDois labs, com as duas respostas de honestidade da metrica corretas -- e essa e a\nparte que mais importa.\n\nlab-01: delay inline entre a leitura e a escrita de CreditAsync, sem span proprio,\ncondicionado ao valor do credito. Provado numericamente que a instrumentacao atual\nnao diagnostica: num trace real, o span pai dura 1517,5ms e os unicos filhos somam\n3,9ms -- 0,26% de cobertura. Da para ver QUE demorou, nao O QUE demorou.\n\nO numero que muda quando o padrao e implementado e a cobertura do trace, nao a\nlatencia. Se o criterio fosse \"p99 caiu\", qualquer cache ou indice satisfaria o\nlab sem a instrumentacao ter mudado nada -- exatamente o defeito que custou tres\nentregas na Fase 0.\n\nlab-02: 20 de 20 rodadas no mesmo padrao, deterministico. E a armadilha do saldo\nfinal foi descartada explicitamente como criterio: ele ja esta correto hoje, antes\nde qualquer correcao, porque o CHECK do banco garante nos dois casos. Usar isso\ncomo prova mediria algo que nao muda.\n\nAchado ao vivo na calibragem da carga: com um pool de 20 contas, transferencias\ngrandes concorrentes colidiam no mesmo destino durante a janela alargada e\nreproduziam sem querer o bug do lab-02, dando 14% de erro. Corrigido com destino\nexclusivo por transferencia grande e pool de 200 contas na origem.\n\nDEFEITO CONHECIDO, aberto para a 1.5b: o lab-01 entrega a propria resposta em\nquatro lugares, todos antes do <details> de causa raiz -- a linha \"Injecao\" da\ntabela nomeia AccountsRepository.CreditAsync e a condicao; o run.sh imprime a\ninjecao no terminal a cada execucao; a tabela \"O que observar\" descreve o achado\nem vez do lugar; e a pergunta 3 do diagnostico contem a propria resposta.\n\nParte disso e culpa do handoff da 1.5, que dizia \"o README diz o sintoma e onde\ncomecar a olhar\" -- num lab cujo ponto e localizar algo, onde olhar e a resposta.\nA regra corrigida virou uma secao propria no topo de docs/labs/TEMPLATE.md.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.5-labs.md","tree":{"sha":"eee235954029c326f59d907f315e6b47ff1131fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/eee235954029c326f59d907f315e6b47ff1131fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDA1NTJiNmFlZTkzMjBiOTlkODJkODM5NjlhNjQ5NTUzYjBkZmUzM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8","sha":"809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8"}],"sha":"0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0552b6aee9320b99d82d83969a649553b0dfe33d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T04:43:48Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T04:43:48Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(1.4b): restaura o codigo do aprendiz e nomeia os spans de transfers com a rota\n\nTres correcoes da revisao da 1.4.\n\n1. shutdown.go voltou byte a byte ao que o aprendiz escreveu: o campo OTelShutdown\n   saiu da struct Sequence e a agregacao de erros dele foi restaurada. O flush do\n   OTel passou para cmd/transfers/main.go, depois de seq.Run retornar e sempre --\n   inclusive quando seq.Run falha, para que os spans da propria sequencia de\n   shutdown ainda sejam exportados.\n\n2. Os spans servidor de transfers passam a carregar a rota. A causa era sutil e o\n   agente documentou: otelhttp.NewHandler cria um *http.Request proprio via\n   r.WithContext antes de chamar o handler interno, entao o r.Pattern que o\n   http.ServeMux preenche mais abaixo nunca volta ao ponteiro que o otelhttp\n   guardou -- a checagem interna de rename dele sempre ve string vazia. A correcao\n   le req.Pattern do ponteiro que o mux de fato muta, depois do ServeHTTP retornar.\n\n   Verificado: a busca { name=\"POST /transfers\" } acha o trace, raiz nomeada com a\n   rota, 17 spans atravessando os dois servicos.\n\n3. A afirmacao falsa sobre k6 nao existir no repo ganhou errata na secao 5 da 1.4,\n   com o texto original preservado, e a verificacao de carga foi refeita com k6 de\n   verdade contra POST /transfers via Traefik.\n\nBuild e testes verdes. O TODO de concorrencia otimista em accounts continua aberto,\ncomo deve.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.4b-correcoes-instrumentacao.md","tree":{"sha":"faf1fb4b1d5c00aa8aa609738cf3ee29aaa54fa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/faf1fb4b1d5c00aa8aa609738cf3ee29aaa54fa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDgwOWFmNDcyZTA3ZDRlMjA2OTI1NWE3YTBmNjU3ZDU1MmNhZTY1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d","sha":"227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d"}],"sha":"809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/809af472e07d4e2069255a7a0f657d552cae65f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T00:56:28Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T00:56:28Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-1): handoff 1.4b -- correcoes da instrumentacao\n\nTres itens, todos verificados na revisao:\n\n1. A 1.4 mexeu em shutdown.go, que e a implementacao do TODO do aprendiz. Inseriu\n   o flush do OTel dentro da sequencia dele e reescreveu a agregacao de erros.\n   O flush dentro da sequencia e decisao de ORDEM de dependencia, que e o\n   raciocinio que o exercicio ensina -- foi tomada por um agente. Restaurar o\n   codigo dele e mover o flush para main.go depois de seq.Run retornar.\n\n2. Os spans servidor de transfers perderam a rota (raiz chamada POST, nao\n   POST /transfers). Descartado como nice-to-have porque a API do otelhttp mudou.\n   Nao e: na revisao a busca por nome no Tempo nao funcionou, todos os endpoints\n   colapsam no mesmo nome, e a assimetria com accounts vai atrapalhar o lab-01.\n\n3. O relatorio afirma que k6 nao existe no repo. Existe. A verificacao de carga\n   usou curl com base numa premissa falsa e precisa ser refeita.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15182732e0a67638008fd13ab17492bb188d8892","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/15182732e0a67638008fd13ab17492bb188d8892"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDIyN2Y2Mjk5NGE4NDI3ZjZjZWU4MzUzYzdhNGE0ZDZkMTA0Y2EwN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165","sha":"712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165"}],"sha":"227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/227f62994a8427f6cee8353c7a4a4d6d104ca07d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T00:55:46Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T00:55:46Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.4): OpenTelemetry ponta a ponta em accounts e transfers\n\nUm POST /transfers produz UM trace com 17 spans atravessando os dois servicos.\nVerificado no Tempo: raiz POST em transfers, 4 chamadas HTTP cliente, 4 spans\nservidor em accounts, 6 spans de Postgres, o INSERT do proprio transfers e o\npool.acquire.\n\nO numero surpreende e e o argumento da fase inteira: ninguem preve 17. As duas\nleituras de validacao que a 1.3 adicionou e o fato de um debito ser read+write\n(duas queries, nao uma) sao o que estoura a conta.\n\nMetricas RED passam a vir do SDK do OTel via Collector, como a ADR 0007 ja\ndefinia. Logs seguem por stdout+Promtail, enriquecidos com trace_id/span_id -- o\npipeline OTLP-logs do Collector fica montado e sem receiver, e a pergunta de\nmigrar ou remover fica registrada para uma fase futura.\n\nAchado que vale guardar: honor_labels: true no scrape job do Collector. Sem ela o\nalvo aparece up, o scrape funciona, e os dashboards ficam silenciosamente vazios\n-- job/instance do scrape sobrescrevem os labels reais do servico. So aparece\ntestando.\n\nFronteira de dominio respeitada: nenhum span manual de negocio, nenhum atributo\nde conta ou transferencia. O que falta enxergar continua sendo o que o aprendiz\nvai instrumentar no lab-01.\n\nDOIS DEFEITOS CONHECIDOS, abertos para a 1.4b:\n\n1. O agente modificou services/transfers/internal/shutdown/shutdown.go, que e a\n   implementacao do aprendiz. Inseriu o flush do OTel dentro da sequencia dele e\n   reescreveu a agregacao de erros para errors.Join. O flush dentro da sequencia\n   e uma decisao de ORDEM de dependencia -- exatamente o tipo de raciocinio que o\n   exercicio existe para ensinar -- e a reescrita do errors.Join nao era exigida\n   por nada. A secao 4 do relatorio afirma \"fronteira respeitada\" e nao menciona.\n\n2. O relatorio afirma que k6 nao existe neste repo. Existe:\n   labs/lab-00-morte-subita/load.js, rodado por task lab. A verificacao de carga\n   usou um loop de curl com base numa premissa falsa.\n\nE uma lacuna de qualidade demonstrada na revisao: os spans servidor de transfers\nperderam a rota (a raiz se chama POST, nao POST /transfers), porque o agente\ndescartou o route tagging como nice-to-have. accounts tem a rota. Na revisao eu\nnao consegui achar o trace por nome e precisei contornar -- o custo e real e\nassimetrico entre os dois servicos.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.4-otel.md","tree":{"sha":"d73634fef02ac7b326e09a0d69b7871f1ab6d99a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/d73634fef02ac7b326e09a0d69b7871f1ab6d99a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDcxMjE4MGY4ZTVhZDllYTllNWZjMmE2OTBkYWRkM2YzNWJjMWMxNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88","sha":"81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88"}],"sha":"712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/712180f8e5ad9ea9e5fc2a690dadd3f35bc1c165"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:36Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:36Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: Idempotency-Key passa a valer a partir da Fase 3\n\nTensao levantada pelo agente da 1.3: o CLAUDE.md exige o header em todo endpoint\nque muda estado, mas o escopo da entrega listava idempotencia explicitamente\nentre o que fica de fora. Ele nao implementou e trouxe a decisao, corretamente.\n\nMesma regra ja aplicada ao middleware do Havoc na Fase 0: mecanismo nao entra\nantes da dor que ele resolve. E aqui tem um agravante -- aceitar o header sem a\ndeduplicacao por tras anuncia uma garantia que nao existe, e quem chama passa a\nconfiar nela. Meio padrao e pior que padrao nenhum.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e42287674df081286228544f69b94b9708b6ac12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/e42287674df081286228544f69b94b9708b6ac12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDgxOTU1YjVlMjRiYWI0Y2QyN2VlYTliZjRkYmVkNzFhNmExMDliODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68","sha":"6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68"}],"sha":"81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/81955b5e24bab4cd27eea9bf4dbed71a6a109b88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.3): transfers chamando accounts -- o fluxo deliberadamente ingenuo\n\nPOST /transfers le origem e destino, debita a origem com If-Match, credita o\ndestino, grava o resultado. Sem hold, sem saga, sem idempotencia, sem retry, sem\ncircuit breaker -- e para ficar assim: e este fluxo que as fases 2, 3 e 4 vao\nquebrar.\n\nCliente HTTP para accounts com timeout explicito (2000 ms default), tipando o\nerro em NotFound / InsufficientFunds / VersionConflict / PreconditionRequired /\nUnavailable, espelhando o DebitOutcomeKind do lado C#. Falha parcial (debito\nconfirmado, credito falhou) mapeia para um type proprio e log com marcador\nbuscavel, em vez de 500 generico.\n\nMigrations em Go via golang-migrate com SQL embutido, rodando como job one-off\ntransfers-migrate -- mesma forma de accounts-migrate, pelo mesmo motivo: duas\nreplicas nao coordenam quem aplica o schema sem lock distribuido, que e nucleo de\npadrao e pertence ao aprendiz.\n\nDecisao confirmada com o aprendiz: transfers valida que as duas contas existem\nantes de mexer em saldo. Nao e resiliencia, e validacao de entrada -- e mantem a\nfragilidade real do fluxo para o lab de saga da Fase 4 em vez de fabrica-la a\npartir de validacao sloppy.\n\nO agente registrou a tentacao do 412 no relatorio, como o handoff pedia: ao ver\nErrKindVersionConflict a primeira ideia foi reler a conta e tentar de novo com o\nETag novo. Nao fez. E o assunto da Fase 2.\n\nVerificado ponta a ponta: transferencia de 2500 moveu 998900 -> 996400 e\n51100 -> 53600. Build e 42 testes verdes.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.3-fluxo-ingenuo.md","tree":{"sha":"a8b1e8972a6df54f88abb31440bf4060da8c7920","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/a8b1e8972a6df54f88abb31440bf4060da8c7920"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDZjYTkyZTk0OGFmMWVmYTRmMDk5OTZlZDU2OWZlMzcwMGJjMGRkNjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2","sha":"37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2"}],"sha":"6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6ca92e948af1efa4f09996ed569fe3700bc0dd68"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T23:56:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(1.2b): concorrencia otimista que alcanca o conceito, e If-Match/ETag\n\nCorrige os tres problemas que a revisao da 1.2 encontrou.\n\nVersion passa a ser mapeada como IsConcurrencyToken: o EF inclui version no\nWHERE de todo UPDATE e lanca DbUpdateConcurrencyException quando zero linhas sao\nafetadas. A garantia passa a estar na escrita, que era o que faltava. Usar a\nprimitiva do framework nao e entregar o exercicio -- mesma regra ja aplicada ao\nuvicorn.Server na Fase 0.\n\nAchado importante do agente, nao previsto no escopo: o mapeamento MUDA a natureza\ndo bug observavel. Antes, as duas escritas venciam em silencio e o saldo refletia\num debito com dois sucessos reportados -- lost update classico. Agora a segunda\nSaveChangesAsync lanca, e o sintoma vira uma chamada legitima recebendo crash\nonde deveria receber 412. Mesma classe de bug, sintoma diferente; as descricoes\ndo lab foram reescritas para nao prometer um sintoma que nao acontece mais.\n\nO TODO reescrito descreve os DOIS casos que precisam virar VersionConflict: o\nchamador que ja sabia estar desatualizado (detectavel na leitura) e duas leituras\nconcorrentes que viram a mesma versao fresca (so detectavel na escrita). Tratar\num nao cobre o outro.\n\nTeste determinizado com um Barrier de duas partes, garantindo que as duas\nleituras terminem antes de qualquer escrita. Verificado: 4 de 4 execucoes com a\nmensagem identica, contra 2 sucessos numa e 1 serializado noutra antes. A\nassercao morta (saldo >= 0, que este schema nunca deixa falhar) deu lugar a saldo\nfinal == inicial - sucessos * valor.\n\nIf-Match/ETag conforme ADR 0012: expectedVersion sai do corpo, respostas de\nrecurso unico emitem ETag, debito sem If-Match responde 428, precondicao violada\nresponde 412. Verificado por curl: 428 e 422 corretos, e o 412 responde 200\nporque a comparacao e o TODO -- o estado vermelho agora e visivel de fora, nao so\nno teste.\n\nlab-02-saldo-negativo renomeado para lab-02-atualizacao-perdida nas mencoes vivas.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.2b-concorrencia.md","tree":{"sha":"83807f961c1f79d25043be89e04b5f154089354e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/83807f961c1f79d25043be89e04b5f154089354e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDM3YTYzMGI1ZGJmOTY2ZjM4MDAxY2NhYjY0MGQ1MGI5MTRlZGJiZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6","sha":"1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6"}],"sha":"37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/37a630b5dbf966f38001ccab640d50b914edbbf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:47:10Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:47:19Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: ADR 0012 -- If-Match/ETag para concorrencia otimista sobre HTTP\n\nDecisao do aprendiz. A 1.2 tinha implementado expectedVersion no corpo e deixado\na escolha em aberto; a questao se repetiria em transfers e no ledger, entao vira\nconvencao de todo servico do Nimbus.\n\nRespostas que carregam uma conta emitem ETag com a versao; operacoes que mudam\nestado a partir de uma versao lida exigem If-Match; precondicao nao satisfeita\nresponde 412 Precondition Failed, nao 409 -- 412 e especificamente a condicao que\nvoce impos nao valer mais. If-Match ausente responde 428.\n\nDescartadas: versao no corpo (inventa convencao onde o HTTP ja tem uma) e\nIf-Unmodified-Since (baseada em timestamp, traz skew de relogio de volta como\nfonte de bug, justamente o que a Fase 5 ensina a desconfiar).\n\nO ganho pedagogico que decidiu: a mesma familia de cabecalhos volta na Fase 2\npara validacao de cache (ETag + If-None-Match + 304). Um mecanismo, dois usos, e\na chance de ver que concorrencia e cache sao a mesma pergunta -- o que eu tenho\nainda vale?\n\nEscopo da 1.2b e da 1.3 atualizados. A 1.3 ganhou instrucao explicita de NAO\ntratar o 412 com retry: parece a coisa obvia e e exatamente o assunto da Fase 2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"83b72f7dc26a17875eb40d18810bd3af3f4e44bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/83b72f7dc26a17875eb40d18810bd3af3f4e44bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDExMjBmZWYxYjhkM2ZlMDRjYTc3ZGU3N2NiMTQ2ZTAxZDdhZWUwYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547","sha":"5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547"}],"sha":"1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1120fef1b8d3fe04ca77de77cb146e01d7aee0c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:43:56Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:43:56Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-1): handoff 1.2b -- o exercicio de concorrencia nao alcanca o conceito\n\nTres problemas encadeados na 1.2, verificados ao vivo:\n\n1. O TODO manda comparar expectedVersion com account.Version em memoria, entre a\n   leitura e o SaveChanges -- check-then-act. Medido: os dois debitos leem\n   version=0, os dois comparam 0 com 0, os dois passam. A garantia precisa estar\n   no WHERE do UPDATE, nao na leitura.\n2. O teste vermelho e nao-deterministico: isolado deu 2 sucessos em duas de tres\n   execucoes; na suite completa deu 1 sucesso com o segundo debito serializando.\n3. O saldo negativo do nome do lab nao acontece: as duas escritas gravam 4000 a\n   partir da mesma leitura suja, o CHECK nunca dispara, e a primeira assercao do\n   teste e codigo morto. O bug real e lost update.\n\nA 1.2 evitou IsConcurrencyToken argumentando que seria implementar o padrao por\nconfiguracao. Mesmo erro da 0.6c ao esconder o uvicorn.Server: usar a primitiva do\nframework nao e entregar o exercicio -- o exercicio e entender que a garantia tem\nque estar na escrita e decidir o que fazer quando ela falha.\n\nO CHECK constraint fica. Ele ensina algo melhor que o saldo negativo: uma\nrestricao de banco impediu o sintoma e nao impediu o bug.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"787ee54e55999bed02e99819213f8919c417b402","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/787ee54e55999bed02e99819213f8919c417b402"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDVjZjBhMTU3NDgwOGNmYTgzYmQzMjUwMjE5Yjc3YTI0MWEyNDc1NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6","sha":"2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6"}],"sha":"5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5cf0a1574808cfa83bd3250219b77a241a247547"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:42:49Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:42:49Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.2): dominio de contas em accounts, com migrations e Testcontainers\n\nTabela accounts (EF Core), cinco endpoints, erro de negocio distinto de erro de\ninfraestrutura via RFC 7807, seed fixo para os labs, e testes de integracao com\nPostgres real.\n\nDecisao boa e nao obvia: as migrations rodam num job one-off (Accounts.Migrator,\nservico accounts-migrate com service_completed_successfully) em vez de dentro do\nprocesso. Com duas replicas subindo em paralelo, migrar no boot exigiria lock\ndistribuido -- que e nucleo de padrao e pertence ao aprendiz, nao ao agente. O\njob resolve sem escrever nenhum.\n\nValores monetarios em long de centavos, nunca ponto flutuante (ADR 0002).\n\nDEFEITO CONHECIDO, aberto: o exercicio de concorrencia otimista, como esta posto,\nnao alcanca o conceito. Tres problemas encadeados, verificados pelo mentor:\n\n1. O TODO manda comparar expectedVersion com account.Version em memoria, entre a\n   leitura e o SaveChanges. Isso e check-then-act: no teste, os dois debitos leem\n   version=0, os dois comparam 0 com 0, os dois passam. Concorrencia otimista so\n   funciona com a versao no WHERE do UPDATE e checagem de linhas afetadas. O\n   comentario aponta para o mecanismo que nao resolve.\n2. O teste vermelho e nao-deterministico: isolado deu 2 sucessos e 0 conflitos em\n   duas de tres execucoes; na suite completa deu 1 sucesso e 0 conflitos, com o\n   segundo debito serializando e vendo saldo insuficiente. Mesmo codigo.\n3. O saldo negativo que da nome ao lab-02 nao acontece: as duas escritas calculam\n   10000-6000 a partir da mesma leitura suja e gravam 4000, positivo. O CHECK\n   available_balance_cents >= 0 nunca dispara e a primeira asserticao do teste\n   nunca pode falhar. O bug real e lost update -- 12000 debitados, a conta mostra\n   4000 em vez de -2000.\n\nCorrigir e a entrega 1.2b.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.2-dominio-accounts.md","tree":{"sha":"3b52ec899384a6767a8f0791fc2819832a37af9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/3b52ec899384a6767a8f0791fc2819832a37af9e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDJlMzhkZTRiMmUxYjBlZTYyNTQ4ZWQ0MTRjZmFkZWVhMDY5NzgzZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf","sha":"0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf"}],"sha":"2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2e38de4b2e1b0ee62548ed414cfadeea069783e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:42:49Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T18:42:49Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(1.1): perfil obs -- Collector, Prometheus, Tempo, Loki, Promtail, Grafana\n\nStack de observabilidade montada e vazia, esperando a instrumentacao da 1.4.\n`task obs` sobe core+obs, 17 unidades saudaveis, ~291 MiB medidos com docker\nstats (a estimativa antiga de 1.5 GB era de antes de qualquer coisa existir).\n\nCollector como ponto unico (OTLP grpc 4317 / http 4318) com tres pipelines\ncomentados. Prometheus por Docker SD com relabeling por label, nenhuma lista fixa\nde alvos -- provado dinamico quando a entrega 1.2, rodando em paralelo, recriou\nos containers de accounts e os alvos sumiram e voltaram sozinhos. Grafana\nprovisionado por arquivo, com Tempo->Loki e Loki->Tempo ja correlacionados.\n\nDois achados ao vivo:\n- prom/prometheus roda como nobody e nao consegue ler o docker.sock (660, grupo\n  docker); o Traefik nunca teve o problema porque roda como root. Resolvido com\n  user: root e comentario explicando, ja que fixar o GID do grupo docker no\n  compose versionado quebraria em outra maquina.\n- Promtail le os logs pela API do Docker em vez de bind mount de\n  /var/lib/docker/containers: sob Docker Desktop com WSL2 esse diretorio no host\n  nao e o filesystem real dos containers, e o mount viria vazio.\n\ntransfers nao expoe metrica HTTP nenhuma -- so os coletores default do\nclient_golang. O agente nao instrumentou, corretamente: isso e 1.4. O dashboard\nRED dele fica com os paineis vazios e uma nota, em vez de PromQL que nao resolve.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/1.1-observabilidade.md","tree":{"sha":"de23333991cf0021817cd5ac66fc9ecad457f403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/de23333991cf0021817cd5ac66fc9ecad457f403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDBmY2FlZTM0YmY2NjEwMjJmYWEwNmIxYTgwYWJhZTY2ZTVjOWFiY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/e61ef2642ad10b25d5464fbb0ee2f25ef29b4be3","sha":"e61ef2642ad10b25d5464fbb0ee2f25ef29b4be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/e61ef2642ad10b25d5464fbb0ee2f25ef29b4be3"}],"sha":"0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0fcaee34bf661022faa06b1a80abae66e5c9abcf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events