1NzZkZWIzY2QxZjdjYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/36796d5cd0c28678d0c4bc6ad1f3ef3fddb8143a","sha":"36796d5cd0c28678d0c4bc6ad1f3ef3fddb8143a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/36796d5cd0c28678d0c4bc6ad1f3ef3fddb8143a"}],"sha":"5301183a84c21a2dd45db356a576deb3cd1f7cbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5301183a84c21a2dd45db356a576deb3cd1f7cbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/36796d5cd0c28678d0c4bc6ad1f3ef3fddb8143a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:27:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T04:27:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-1): briefing do primeiro par sincrono e do trace distribuido\n\nSeis entregas (1.1 a 1.6), 1.1 e 1.2 paralelizaveis, com os prompts de handoff\nprontos.\n\nO exercicio da fase nao e ligar o OTel -- e rodar um lab que a instrumentacao\nautomatica NAO consegue diagnosticar e melhorar a instrumentacao ate conseguir.\nE o principio no 2 da carta virando tarefa: se a unica forma de achar a causa e\nler o fonte, a instrumentacao esta errada, e conserta-la e o exercicio. Por isso\no handoff da 1.4 proibe spans de dominio e atributos de negocio: se o agente\nentregar isso, o lab-01 fica sem exercicio.\n\nDuas licoes da Fase 0 viram regra permanente nos handoffs:\n- todo lab responde que numero muda quando o padrao e implementado e que numero\n  muda por outro motivo qualquer; se forem o mesmo, o lab nao serve;\n- todo TODO(aprendiz) e conferido como fazivel de onde esta antes de entregar.\n\nTODO do aprendiz: concorrencia otimista no debito, e decidir o que instrumentar.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d4bf8c074624bfd3d33cbc5b3d523ffd319ee82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/2d4bf8c074624bfd3d33cbc5b3d523ffd319ee82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/36796d5cd0c28678d0c4bc6ad1f3ef3fddb8143a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.