rlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: retrospectiva e quiz viram uma coisa so -- debate\n\nO acordo de trabalho listava retrospectiva com 7 itens e depois um quiz de 5\nperguntas: a mesma coisa duas vezes, e justamente a cerimonia que o metodo novo\nexiste para evitar. O aprendiz apontou a inconsistencia durante a propria\nretrospectiva da Fase 0.\n\nAgora e um debate so, com criterios de como o mentor prepara as perguntas\n(especificas do que ele fez, uma que mexa num parametro e peca o que quebra, uma\nsobre o que ele escreveu empurrada um passo, uma que separe fato tecnico de\nresposta operacional, uma que aponte para a fase seguinte) e a obrigacao\nexplicita de o mentor conceder quando for contestado com razao.\n\nOs niveis do catalogo passam a ser propostos pelo mentor e corrigidos pelo\naprendiz, em vez de autoavaliacao em branco.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6cf38cbb1cc2546ad4e771b46a16767f9619ade3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/6cf38cbb1cc2546ad4e771b46a16767f9619ade3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/769ac3853eb7841e260458790e34eb0aee5dd988","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/769ac3853eb7841e260458790e34eb0aee5dd988","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDc2OWFjMzg1M2ViNzg0MWUyNjA0NTg3OTBlMzRlYjBhZWU1ZGQ5ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358","sha":"5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358"}],"sha":"769ac3853eb7841e260458790e34eb0aee5dd988","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/769ac3853eb7841e260458790e34eb0aee5dd988"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T01:44:38Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T01:44:38Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: metodo passa a ser debate; runbook exige contexto de negocio\n\nDois ajustes pedidos pelo aprendiz, com o motivo registrado.\n\n1. O metodo assumia que escrever faz parte de aprender, e o LEARNING-LOG tinha\nsete cabecalhos por lab. Para ele isso e transcricao: tira da cabeca e poe no\narquivo, sem ganho de retencao -- e se daqui a seis meses precisar do documento\npara entender, entao decorou, nao aprendeu. Ele retem por pratica e gatilho\nmental, e o mecanismo que funciona e pergunta -> resposta -> contestacao ->\nrefino.\n\nO principio 5 da carta deixa de ser \"escrever e parte de aprender\" e passa a ser\n\"explicar e parte de aprender -- mas explicar nao e escrever\". O criterio de\nsucesso nao muda: continua sendo desenhar no quadro branco sem olhar o codigo.\nMuda o mecanismo. O LEARNING-LOG guarda so o que sobrou do debate, sem template\ne sem cobranca de volume -- registrado tambem na regra no 3 do CLAUDE.md.\n\n2. A pergunta do runbook era generica: \"se isso acontecesse em producao as 3h da\nmanha, o que voce faria?\". Para morte subita de aplicacao a resposta varia de\nvolto a dormir a acordo o time inteiro, e o que decide isso e SLA, criticidade,\ncobertura 24/7, janela batch -- nao a falha em si. Sem contexto nao ha resposta\ncerta, e a pergunta nao ensina nada.\n\nTemplate de lab e lab-00 passam a exigir a mesma falha em tres contextos de\nnegocio distintos, terminando na pergunta que importa: o que, nos tres, e a mesma\ndecisao tecnica apesar das respostas operacionais diferentes -- separar o fato\ntecnico da resposta operacional.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"007d7b99745760c7f59910777e86b87b38b76a33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/007d7b99745760c7f59910777e86b87b38b76a33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDVjN2I0MDBlODkxZjMwYzU2ZjBlMWFjYzJlZTFjNzQ0MjRiNjkzNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec","sha":"f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec"}],"sha":"5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5c7b400e891f30c56f0e1acc2ee1c74424b69358"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:46:50Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:49:38Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(0.7): risk encerra corretamente nas duas imagens\n\nFecha o defeito conhecido registrado no commit anterior: a imagem do estagio dev\npendurava no SIGTERM.\n\nA causa era quem dirige o encerramento. install_signal_handlers substitui, via\nloop.add_signal_handler, o handle_exit que o uvicorn instala dentro de\nserver.capture_signals() -- entao ninguem mais marca server.should_exit. Com\n`python -m risk` isso e inofensivo, porque o proprio __main__ assume o volante e\ndevolve depois; com `uvicorn --factory` nao existia ninguem do outro lado.\n\nA solucao usa a presenca do shutdown_event como o sinal de quem esta dirigindo:\nse ele existe, alguem prometeu aguarda-lo e basta liberar o evento; se e None,\nnao ha ninguem esperando e o processo se mata com os._exit(0) -- nao sys.exit,\nque dentro de uma Task do asyncio so encerraria a Task.\n\nCom isso caiu tambem o fallback de singleton dentro do create_app, que fazia o\ncaminho --factory receber um evento que ninguem aguardava, e junto foram embora o\ncampo shutdown_requested e o `await shutdown_event.wait()` sem prazo no pos-yield\ndo lifespan, que era uma espera sem teto no caminho de desligamento.\n\nVerificado nas duas imagens, sob a mesma condicao:\n  runtime (python -m risk)      saiu em 2.56s, codigo 0\n  dev (uvicorn --factory)       saiu em 2.47s, codigo 0\n  pytest                        8 passed\n  lab-00                        3001 requisicoes, 0 perdidas, janela 0s\n\nTambem: ordenacao de imports, marcadores de rascunho e espacos em branco\nremovidos, e o comentario da renomeacao com o nome do arquivo correto.","tree":{"sha":"5be269e50fda2e58338b19fdb51a3761e8b0a31e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/5be269e50fda2e58338b19fdb51a3761e8b0a31e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGYxMGQ2ZGMyNWQ3MjcxMTY4ZTk5N2ZmZTRiNmQ2ZjdkOGJiMzA5ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae","sha":"6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae"}],"sha":"f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/f10d6dc25d7271168e997ffe4b6d6f7d8bb309ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:03:12Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T20:03:12Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.7): shutdown gracioso em risk -- quarto e ultimo servico\n\nImplementacao do aprendiz. Dos quatro, e o de melhor desenho: cada passo da\nsequencia fica com quem o faz melhor.\n\n  1-2  marcar not-ready e esperar o LB  -> shutdown.py (aprendiz)\n  3-4  parar de aceitar e drenar        -> uvicorn, com timeout_graceful_shutdown=6\n  5    fechar Postgres e Redis          -> pos-yield do lifespan\n\nPara isso o uvicorn.run() foi trocado por uvicorn.Server explicito, e o\nos._exit(0) do signals.py deu lugar a um asyncio.Event: o handler de sinal sinaliza,\no __main__ acorda, marca should_exit e o uvicorn conduz drenagem e lifespan. Mais\ncorreto que o os._exit (permite limpeza de verdade), e menos robusto (a saida\ndeixou de ser garantida por construcao) -- a mesma troca feita no edge-bff ao\nremover forceCloseConnections.\n\nVerificado sob carga: sai em 2.86s com codigo 0, sequencia completa visivel nos\nlogs.\n\nCorrecoes da revisao anterior nesta rodada: uv removido das dependencias de\nruntime (tinha ido parar no venv da imagem final), settings de volta como primeiro\nparametro de create_app (a ordem anterior fazia create_app(settings) passar o\nSettings como loop, com fallback silencioso para load_settings), parametro loop\nredundante removido, e limpeza de codigo morto comentado.\n\nDEFEITO CONHECIDO, ainda aberto: a imagem do estagio `dev` pendura no SIGTERM.\nEla sobe via `uvicorn risk.main:create_app --factory`, e install_signal_handlers\nsubstitui o handler de SIGTERM que o uvicorn instala -- mas nesse caminho nao\nexiste ninguem executando `await shutdown_event.wait()` para marcar should_exit.\nReproduzido: o processo loga \"Closing to new connections\" e nao sai. O caminho de\nproducao (python -m risk) nao e afetado, e nem os testes nem o lab exercitam o\nestagio dev. A Fase 0 nao fecha antes disso ser resolvido.","tree":{"sha":"0738dc69b3fe308749949818dd1a030d0895fa16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/0738dc69b3fe308749949818dd1a030d0895fa16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDZhMGZlMmZkZmUyN2IwYjRlZGU4N2RjYTM2MjcxMzBmMDdmMzZkYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098","sha":"67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098"}],"sha":"6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6a0fe2fdfe27b0b4ede87dca3627130f07f36dae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:57:17Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:07:13Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"wqrefactor(0.7): tipagem, comentarios e simplificacao do shutdown do edge-bff\n\nAjustes do aprendiz apos a revisao:\n\n- as duas regras de eslint que tinham sido relaxadas para acomodar um any voltaram\n  a valer; httpServer agora e tipado como o Server de node:http, com um cast unico\n  no ponto de chamada. Lint sem nenhum warning.\n- removido o await de httpServer.close(), que nao aguardava nada -- server.close()\n  do Node devolve o proprio servidor, nao uma promise.\n- optional chaining removido de pgPool e redisClient: sao dependencias injetadas\n  que sempre existem, e se fossem undefined seria bug de wiring a ser visto, nao\n  silenciado.\n- comentarios da 0.6c restaurados no signals.ts, com uma nota nova explicando por\n  que forceCloseConnections deixou de ser necessario depois do padrao implementado.\n\nTambem removida a espera de 4s que havia entre o close do servidor e o fechamento\ndas dependencias. Tempo total do shutdown caiu de 6.38s para 2.47s, medido sob\ncarga com keep-alive, sem erro nos logs.","tree":{"sha":"f1e45de781dbd5565bbfa1ae6ba477b4b66863fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/f1e45de781dbd5565bbfa1ae6ba477b4b66863fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDY3YTdhMWU0ZDM0MTVkNDdmMjkzYzdhZjE0MTNlNjJmNmRmMWMwOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0","sha":"6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0"}],"sha":"67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/67a7a1e4d3415d47f293c7af1413e62f6df1c098"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:29:24Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T05:29:24Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.7): shutdown gracioso em edge-bff\n\nImplementacao do aprendiz. Terceiro dos quatro servicos; falta risk.\n\nSequencia: shuttingDown = true, espera de 2s cobrindo a deteccao do healthcheck\ndo Traefik, httpServer.close() para parar de aceitar conexoes novas, 4s de\ndrenagem, e fechamento de Postgres e Redis.\n\nforceCloseConnections: true foi REMOVIDO do NestFactory.create. Ele tinha sido\nadicionado na 0.6c como correcao dos 44s de indisponibilidade -- mas aquele\ntravamento existia porque o stub vazio nao tirava a replica da rotacao: o k6\ncontinuava martelando pelas conexoes keep-alive, que nunca ficavam ociosas, e o\nclose() do Node esperava indefinidamente. Com o passo 1 implementado, o Traefik\npara de rotear, as conexoes ficam ociosas e o close() completa sozinho.\n\nVerificado pelo mentor sob carga (k6, 20 VUs, keep-alive): o processo sai em\n6.38s apos o SIGTERM, sem travar. lab-00 reporta 0 perdidas. Importante notar que\no lab sozinho NAO detectaria um travamento aqui -- com duas replicas, a\nsobrevivente cobre tudo e o numero fica zero de qualquer jeito; por isso a medida\nfoi tempo-ate-sair, nao requisicoes perdidas.\n\nTeste ficou mais forte: mocka node:timers/promises para a espera nunca resolver,\nchama shutdown() sem await e verifica 503 -- provando que o passo 1 acontece\nANTES da espera, nao so ao fim da sequencia.\n\nPendencias registradas na revisao, nao bloqueantes: as duas regras de eslint\nrelaxadas para acomodar o parametro any, o comentario de 0.6c removido do\nsignals.ts, e o await em httpServer.close() que nao aguarda nada.","tree":{"sha":"b4ea1d5579242facdf1270372f70231b294f21e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/b4ea1d5579242facdf1270372f70231b294f21e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDY1NjA3MjhkOTQ0YWUwZTZiMzlhMzUxNzBlNGRlMjE2MzBlYzExYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5","sha":"a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5"}],"sha":"6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/6560728d944ae0e6b39a35170e4de21630ec11c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:34:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T02:34:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.7): shutdown gracioso em transfers e accounts\n\nImplementacao do aprendiz -- o nucleo de padrao que a regra no 1 do CLAUDE.md\nreserva para ele. lab-00 reporta 0 requisicoes perdidas nos dois, de forma\nreproduzivel: transfers 4 execucoes seguidas, accounts 17 -> 18 -> 8 execucoes\nseguidas em zero.\n\ntransfers (Go): MarkNotReady, espera de 3s cobrindo a janela de deteccao do\nhealthcheck do Traefik (interval 1s + timeout 500ms), HTTPServer.Shutdown com\ndeadline de 5s, e fechamento na ordem de dependencia -- Redis antes do pool do\nPostgres. Total no pior caso 8s, dentro do stop_grace_period de 10s.\n\naccounts (C#): a parte dificil foi descobrir ONDE o passo 1 pode acontecer. O\ngeneric host para os hosted services em ordem reversa de registro, entao marcar\nnot-ready dentro de StopAsync corria contra o Kestrel. A solucao usa\nIHostApplicationLifetime.ApplicationStopping, que dispara antes de qualquer\nStopAsync, com Thread.Sleep e nao Task.Delay -- CancellationTokenSource.Cancel\ninvoca os callbacks sincronamente e um async void retornaria no primeiro await,\ndeixando o Kestrel fechar cedo. Meio dia de trabalho, boa parte perdida numa\nsuposicao errada de um agente sobre o comportamento do framework.\n\nTestes fortalecidos, nao enfraquecidos:\n- accounts passou a disparar via lifetime.StopApplication(), o gatilho real de\n  producao, em vez de chamar StopAsync na mao.\n- transfers passou a rodar dentro de uma bolha testing/synctest para o sleep de\n  3s nao custar 3s reais, com httptest.NewRecorder no lugar de NewServer: dentro\n  da bolha o relogio so avanca com todas as goroutines durably blocked, e um\n  listener TCP fica em IO wait, que o synctest nunca considera duravel.\n\nTambem: AccessLogMiddleware em accounts, espelhando o WithAccessLog de transfers,\npara diagnosticar shutdown por log em vez de suposicao.\n\nFaltam risk e edge-bff.","tree":{"sha":"e7dbd0fd9e9f44addfeec7a6c0b18884ab579c48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/e7dbd0fd9e9f44addfeec7a6c0b18884ab579c48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGEyOWQ3NjFjMjgxYzVhOTlhZmYxYjc4ZGFmMzc0NWQ3MGI3NzdiYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2","sha":"9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2"}],"sha":"a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/a29d761c281c5a99aff1b78daf3745d70b777bb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:16:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:16:04Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): handoff 0.6e -- auditoria do encanamento do shutdown\n\nLevantamento feito na revisao da 0.6c e nao comunicado na epoca: em tres dos\nquatro servicos os passos 3-4 da sequencia sao estruturalmente impossiveis no\nlugar onde o TODO esta. Em accounts isso custou meio dia ao aprendiz, que\nresolveu mudando assinatura. risk e edge-bff seguem no mesmo estado.\n\nCriterio da entrega: para cada um dos 6 passos, ou o aprendiz consegue executar\nde dentro do TODO com as alcas que recebe, ou o encanamento e dono do passo e o\ncomentario diz isso. Nenhum passo pode ficar silenciosamente impossivel.\n\nEsclarecimento registrado no handoff: entregar a primitiva de shutdown gracioso\ndo proprio framework NAO e entregar o exercicio -- em Go o aprendiz usa\nhttp.Server.Shutdown da stdlib, e uvicorn.Server/o servidor HTTP do Nest sao o\nequivalente. O exercicio e a sequencia e a ordem, nao escrever drenagem do zero.\nIsso revoga a decisao 2.1 do handoff 0.6c, que rejeitou expor o uvicorn.Server.\n\nEntrega sob demanda: o aprendiz roda so se travar em risk ou edge-bff.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e7818bc00d1bf58e769e52bfb9575702830078c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/e7818bc00d1bf58e769e52bfb9575702830078c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDliN2ZlYWEwZjBlYjk2NWFlOWMyY2ZhOTAyZTQ1ODVjYTZjNjgyYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae","sha":"303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae"}],"sha":"9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/9b7feaa0f0eb965ae9c2cfa902e4585ca6c682c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:14:59Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T22:14:59Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: escada de ajuda substitui a proibicao absoluta de entregar codigo\n\nPedido explicito do aprendiz, com o motivo registrado, pela porta que a propria\nclausula previa: travado horas na 0.7, com o agente de apoio seguindo a regra\ncorretamente e produzindo mais enigmas do que progresso.\n\nA clausula antiga mandava o agente ser socratico, e um agente socratico diante de\nalguem ja travado so consegue produzir mais perguntas. Faltava degrau entre\n\"explico o conceito de novo\" e \"nao posso te ajudar\".\n\nAgora: escada de 5 niveis controlada pelo aprendiz. O nivel 3 (nomear a API sem\nmostrar o uso) e o degrau que faltava. Nivel 5 e implementacao completa e e\nlegitimo. Contrapartidas: dizer o que quebra sem cada parte, qual era a pista,\noferecer re-derivacao, registrar a escalada no handoff, e oferecer a escalada\nproativamente. E, antes de tudo, verificar se o exercicio e fazivel -- plumbing\nquebrado nunca foi protegido pela regra no 1.\n\nADR 0011 registra a decisao e altera parcialmente a ADR 0009.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b11d04586b56ed9b22f482b4504928080b04c320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/b11d04586b56ed9b22f482b4504928080b04c320"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDMwM2FiZDBjYzgwY2M1MDU4ZTk4MGM0MGIzNzgzNDE5NTQ0MWUxYWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee","sha":"2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee"}],"sha":"303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/303abd0cc80cc5058e980c40b37834195441e1ae"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:15:13Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:15:13Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.6d): Traefik e duas replicas -- lab-00 passa a medir shutdown\n\nO lab media tempo de restart de container: as perdas eram taxa x janela, quase\ntudo connection refused depois do processo ja ter morrido. E o passo 2 do 1.2\n(esperar porque a saida do balanceador e eventualmente consistente) nao tinha\ncomo ser demonstrado, porque nao havia balanceador nenhum.\n\nAgora: Traefik no perfil core (provider Docker, descoberta por label), os quatro\nservicos com 2 replicas e sem porta publicada, healthcheck do proxy em\n/health/ready a cada 1s, e o run.sh mata UMA replica por container id. A replica\nsobrevivente cobre a saida da primeira.\n\nEfeito medido em transfers, mesma carga:\n  container unico:      75-78 falhas, rajada de 3.4s  (o restart)\n  2 replicas + Traefik:  2-6  falhas, rajada de 1.5s  (deteccao do healthcheck)\nSempre uma unica rajada, no instante do kill -- o que sobra e exatamente o que o\npasso 2 elimina, entao zero passou a ser alcancavel.\n\nSem middleware de retry, de proposito e verificado: com retry o proxy reenviaria\na requisicao falha para a replica saudavel e o lab reportaria zero sempre, com ou\nsem shutdown gracioso, matando o exercicio.\n\nDois achados do agente fora do escopo, ambos corretos:\n- traefik:v3.1 nao funciona neste ambiente -- o client Docker embutido fixa a API\n  em v1.24 e o daemon (engine 29.7.2, minimo v1.40) responde 400. v3.6 negocia.\n- threshold do k6 trocado de taxa (rate<0.01) para contador absoluto (count<1):\n  com duas replicas a perda caiu para 0.06-0.43%, sempre abaixo de 1%, entao o\n  threshold nunca mais estouraria e o lab passaria com os TODOs vazios.\n\nNenhum TODO(aprendiz) tocado; os quatro testes vermelhos continuam vermelhos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"168c67d48efd2bf06acdd27516156c50baa18bba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/168c67d48efd2bf06acdd27516156c50baa18bba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDJkYjVmODFiMTYxZWNiNDc1MDgxOGY2ZDdiNTBkMmI4ZTQ5MWQxZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f","sha":"72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f"}],"sha":"2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/2db5f81b161ecb4750818f6d7b50d2b8e491d1ee"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T00:26:36Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T00:26:36Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): lab-00 passa a medir shutdown, nao restart (handoff 0.6d)\n\nFalha de desenho do briefing, nao das entregas: as perdas do lab-00 sao\nexatamente taxa x janela de indisponibilidade (78/1.57s, 104/2.26s, 129/2.50s),\nou seja quase tudo e connection refused com o container reiniciando -- nao\nrequisicao em voo derrubada pelo SIGTERM. Um shutdown perfeito mudaria 78 para\n~75, e o aprendiz concluiria que falhou.\n\nPior: o passo 2 do 1.2 (esperar porque a saida do balanceador e eventualmente\nconsistente) nao tem como ser demonstrado, porque nao existe balanceador -- o k6\nbate direto na porta do container e a readiness nao tem leitor.\n\n0.6d coloca duas replicas de cada servico atras do Traefik com health check em\n/health/ready, e o lab mata uma so. Nessa topologia a readiness passa a ter\nefeito, a espera vira mensuravel e zero requisicoes perdidas vira alcancavel.\n\nAdicionado 1.2.1 com essa justificativa, criterio de saida ajustado, e a secao\n9d com o handoff -- incluindo o aviso de nao habilitar o middleware retry do\nTraefik, que mascararia o exercicio inteiro.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"44d2088ec7991fde694ca98142618993fa6f6f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/44d2088ec7991fde694ca98142618993fa6f6f75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDcyZTk3Y2E1ZjI4YjhkYmFlMjljN2VlMTE2NjBjNTgzYjk1NzcxN2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25","sha":"5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25"}],"sha":"72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/72e97ca5f28b8dbae29c7ee11660c583b957717f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T00:11:52Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T00:11:52Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(0.6c): causa raiz dos 44s do edge-bff, e robustez do lab-00\n\nedge-bff: nao era cold start. http.Server.close() (que app.close() do Nest chama\npor baixo) so para de aceitar conexoes NOVAS -- keep-alive abertas seguem servidas\nindefinidamente, e o callback so dispara quando todas se encerram sozinhas. Como o\nk6 mantem keep-alive com trafego constante, o servidor ficava pendurado esperando\no cliente desistir. Corrigido com forceCloseConnections: true no NestFactory.\nEvidencia: sem a correcao o container nao recuperou em 70s e so terminou ~14s\ndepois de o processo de carga ser morto do lado do cliente.\n\nResultado: 44s -> 2.3s, na mesma ordem de grandeza dos outros tres.\n\nrisk/signals.py: try/except BaseException/finally ao redor de await shutdown(ctx),\npara que os._exit(0) rode mesmo se a implementacao do aprendiz levantar -- senao a\nexcecao fica presa na Task e o processo trava, o mesmo sintoma que a 0.6b corrigiu.\n\nrun.sh: checagem de docker/k6/node no topo (antes de aplicar carga, nao depois), e\na analise envolvida em set +e com aviso de onde esta o arquivo bruto e o comando\npara reanalisar.\n\nNenhum TODO(aprendiz) tocado; os quatro testes vermelhos continuam vermelhos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"10ff320dae27b5997252eba8a4ee4ba50e6fee9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/10ff320dae27b5997252eba8a4ee4ba50e6fee9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDUzMTRmOWE1NjdjMmNiNDIwZDJkNzUyMjQ0NTMxN2IwZDcwODZjMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825","sha":"c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825"}],"sha":"5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/5314f9a567c2cb420d2d7522445317b0d7086c25"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T23:28:44Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T23:28:44Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): revisao da 0.6b e handoff 0.6c (confiabilidade da medicao)\n\n0.6b aprovada: as duas correcoes estao certas e a fronteira dura foi respeitada.\n\nUma explicacao do relatorio foi descartada na revisao. O handoff 0.6b atribui os\n44s de indisponibilidade do edge-bff a \"cold start do Nest\". Medido: isolado ele\nvolta em 2.8s (transfers: 2.1s). Sob carga, sonda independente a cada 0.25s\nconfirma 44.81s reais -- o numero esta certo, a causa nao. Numa execucao o\nedge-bff nao voltou nem com up -d --wait --wait-timeout 60.\n\nImporta porque ~44s dos 60s vem da recuperacao, nao do shutdown: implementar o\npadrao corretamente mudaria quase nada no numero do edge-bff, e o aprendiz\nconcluiria que sua implementacao falhou quando funcionou.\n\nMais dois achados na revisao:\n- run.sh morre com \"node: command not found\" na linha 93 DEPOIS de rodar o k6, e\n  nenhum numero e gravado -- mesma classe de falha que a 0.6 dizia ter resolvido.\n- risk volta a travar se o shutdown() do aprendiz lancar excecao: o os._exit(0)\n  nunca roda e a excecao fica presa na Task.\n\nSecao 9c criada com o handoff 0.6c, que roda EM PARALELO com a 0.7 -- transfers,\naccounts e risk ja medem bem, entao o aprendiz nao fica bloqueado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26c35e8d8edc74074d098f006360628bb0e901aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/26c35e8d8edc74074d098f006360628bb0e901aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGMzNmEwM2VkMzY1MjZjYzcyZmQyNGU1ODAxZmE3YjhhYTkxYmI4MjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128","sha":"ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128"}],"sha":"c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/c36a03ed36526cc72fd24e5801fa7b8aa91bb825"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T23:28:44Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T23:28:44Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"fix(0.6b): risk termina no SIGTERM e accounts ganha krb5-libs\n\nOs dois bloqueadores que impediam metade dos servicos de demonstrar o lab-00,\nambos fora do TODO(aprendiz):\n\n- risk/lifecycle/signals.py: o handler agendava shutdown(ctx) e nada mais\n  acontecia -- nosso handler substitui o do uvicorn, entao ninguem encerrava o\n  processo. Agora aguarda o stub retornar e chama os._exit(0). Nao e sys.exit\n  porque SystemExit dentro de uma Task do asyncio so encerra a Task.\n- accounts/Dockerfile: krb5-libs no estagio runtime. O handoff 0.6 suspeitava de\n  libgssapi-krb5-2/libkrb5-3 (nomes Debian); no Alpine o pacote e krb5-libs,\n  confirmado por apk info -L na imagem base.\n\nTambem: doctor.sh checa as portas de risk e edge-bff, e o doc do lab volta a\ntratar os quatro servicos como equivalentes.\n\nVerificado: os quatro perdem requisicoes de forma reproduzivel; os quatro testes\nvermelhos continuam vermelhos; nenhum TODO(aprendiz) foi tocado.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"32a84e60b1523390883c160bc4693a87a3aa2040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/32a84e60b1523390883c160bc4693a87a3aa2040"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGVjNGIwYmUwZTYyYTczMDE3NTE5ZjI3ZGFiODEwMmUxZDdlOTAxMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140","sha":"8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140"}],"sha":"ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/ec4b0be0e62a73017519f27dab8102e1d7e90128"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): revisao das entregas 0.3-0.6 e handoff de correcao 0.6b\n\nDois bloqueadores confirmados ao vivo, ambos fora do TODO(aprendiz):\n- risk ignora SIGTERM (nenhum caminho de termino no processo) -- o lab-00\n  reporta ZERO perdas contra ele, ensinando o oposto do pretendido;\n- accounts sem krb5-libs na imagem runtime (Npgsql/GSSAPI).\n\nUm falso alarme descartado: o handoff 0.6 atribui a ausencia de log no shutdown\ndo edge-bff a falta de enableShutdownHooks. Nao e -- installSignalHandlers e\nchamado em main.ts e faz shutdown -> app.close -> exit(0). Nao ha log porque o\nstub esta vazio, que e o comportamento correto.\n\nDecisoes de mentor registradas:\n- assimetria do middleware Havoc entre os 4 servicos e conhecida e aceita;\n  nivelar os quatro vira item explicito da Fase 2, quando o Havoc v0 nascer.\n  A obrigacao no CLAUDE.md passa a valer a partir dali -- antes disso nao ha\n  canal para assinar, e a regra no 2 proibe mecanismo antes da dor.\n- risk no perfil core (correcao da 0.5) esta certa e fica.\n- fnm vs nvm: indiferente, texto da fase ajustado.\n\nAdicionada a secao 9b com o prompt de handoff 0.6b, com fronteira dura explicita\npara que a correcao nao encoste nos passos 1-5 da sequencia.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"024c17e6bea2ecc39ae3b3367666079812ee4ad9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/024c17e6bea2ecc39ae3b3367666079812ee4ad9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDhiYzBmOTBhMjU0NGU5NWUwMzczZGFmMTYwYmU1MTRhY2I0YmYxNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2","sha":"25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2"}],"sha":"8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/8bc0f90a2544e95e0373daf160be514acb4bf140"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.6): k6 e lab-00-morte-subita\n\nTask lab, carga k6 constant-arrival-rate a ~50 req/s em /ping, injecao de SIGTERM\nvia docker compose kill, e analise em Node puro que grava requisicoes perdidas,\ntaxa de erro e janela de indisponibilidade em k6-results/history.ndjson para\ncomparacao antes/depois.\n\nNumeros reais contra transfers: 3000 requisicoes, 80 perdidas, 2.67% de erro,\n1.62s de indisponibilidade -- reprodutivel entre execucoes.\n\nTres bugs pegos rodando o lab de verdade: glob do bash em vez de ls sob pipefail;\nespera do container sair de fato antes do up --wait (kill retorna quando o sinal\ne enviado, nao quando o processo morre); e a religacao do servico nunca pode\nderrubar o script antes do analyze.js gravar os numeros.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/0.6-lab-00.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca6c0d7aa0b8f0f5ef929e066e66c442a0b8c248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/ca6c0d7aa0b8f0f5ef929e066e66c442a0b8c248"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDI1ZjFjNWZjYzQ5MWRkNTkyMDgxYWMxNmUwZjdmMTVmMjU1MTFjZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f","sha":"0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f"}],"sha":"25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/25f1c5fcc491dd592081ac16e0f7f15f25511cd2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.5): templates de servico risk (Python/FastAPI) e edge-bff (TypeScript/NestJS)\n\nMesmo contrato dos servicos da 0.4. Nest v12 com pino e prom-client diretos (os\nwrappers do ecossistema Nest ainda nao tem release compativel com v12); Zod para\nvalidacao de env; uv e pydantic-settings do lado Python.\n\nTODO(aprendiz): o shutdown gracioso em lifecycle/shutdown.py e\nlifecycle/shutdown.service.ts, nas mesmas condicoes da 0.4. Deliberadamente sem\nteste de timing: o passo 10 da fundacao pede que o aprendiz erre sem a pausa,\nmeca, e so depois adicione -- um teste de timing anteciparia o experimento.\n\nBug pego ao validar: APP_ENV=development como default quebrava a imagem runtime\nno boot, porque pino-pretty e dependencia de dev e sai no npm prune.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/0.5-templates-python-typescript.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"84e2877ecec6fa2c95674a6672a06e530be0fe2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/84e2877ecec6fa2c95674a6672a06e530be0fe2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDBhNTJkYjI4MDgxY2I0NmMzZmNiZDViY2ZkZDk0ZmRhZmM0MWI2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313","sha":"1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313"}],"sha":"0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/0a52db28081cb46c3fcbd5bcfdd94fdafc41b68f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.4): templates de servico accounts (C#/.NET) e transfers (Go)\n\nDois esqueletos completos: config validada em boot com fail-fast, logging\nestruturado JSON, /health/{live,ready,startup}, /metrics Prometheus, /ping com\natraso configuravel, Dockerfile multi-stage com usuario nao-root, e entrada no\nperfil core com stop_grace_period.\n\nTODO(aprendiz): o shutdown gracioso em Shutdown/GracefulShutdownService.cs e\ninternal/shutdown/shutdown.go -- corpo vazio, gancho de sinal funcional, teste\nvermelho verificando o contrato HTTP (/health/ready -> 503), que prova so o passo\n1 da sequencia sem vazar os passos 2-6.\n\nBug pego ao validar: o healthcheck usava wget --spider, que manda HEAD; Minimal\nAPI so responde GET, entao todo healthcheck dava 405 e o container ficava\nunhealthy com o servico saudavel.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/0.4-templates-csharp-go.md\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3825feeba9bd6f85a1b07568396922ea7dd8bc58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/3825feeba9bd6f85a1b07568396922ea7dd8bc58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDEwOTRjOWU3MGY3N2FkOWE3MGQ0MTk2ZmRmNjdiYjQ5YzE5MDUzMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/11c2cbe0a8526a6d3b090a349aa7ff2e061899ff","sha":"11c2cbe0a8526a6d3b090a349aa7ff2e061899ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/11c2cbe0a8526a6d3b090a349aa7ff2e061899ff"}],"sha":"1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/1094c9e70f77ad9a70d4196fdf67bb49c1905313"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/11c2cbe0a8526a6d3b090a349aa7ff2e061899ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:50:16Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"feat(0.3): monorepo, Taskfile e Compose base do perfil core\n\nEstrutura de diretorios, Taskfile como interface unica (up/down/reset/doctor/\nlint/fmt), docker-compose.yml com os 7 perfis declarados (so core com conteudo:\nPostgreSQL + Redis), healthchecks reais, init dos bancos logicos por servico,\n.env.example e tools/doctor.sh.\n\nBugs reais pegos ao validar ao vivo, nao hipoteticos: docker compose down/ps/logs\nsem --profile nao enxergam servicos com profile (task down reportava sucesso sem\nparar nada); e o init-databases.sh precisa de --dbname explicito, senao psql tenta\num banco com o nome do usuario e o container fica unhealthy.\n\nRelatorio: docs/handoffs/0.3-monorepo.md\n\nNOTA DE HISTORICO: as entregas 0.3 a 0.6 foram desenvolvidas sem commit\nintermediario e commitadas retroativamente na revisao de fase. Os arquivos\ncompartilhados (docker-compose.yml, Taskfile.yml, .env.example, doctor.sh,\ndocs/01-architecture.md) entram aqui ja no estado final das quatro entregas --\npor isso este commit isolado nao sobe (referencia servicos que so chegam nos\ncommits seguintes).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09206b281737da4bb4f916b275e8e9c6b97383b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/09206b281737da4bb4f916b275e8e9c6b97383b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/11c2cbe0a8526a6d3b090a349aa7ff2e061899ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi