pi.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T04:55:02Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T04:55:02Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): detalhar a migracao para o WSL na entrega 0.2\n\nO clone preserva o historico (mesmos SHAs), mas nao carrega tres coisas que\nmordem em silencio: mudancas nao commitadas, o user.name/user.email locais\n(vivem em .git/config, que nao e clonado) e o origin.\n\nRegistrado tambem o motivo colateral de sair de /mnt/f: o bit de execucao nao\ngruda por padrao, entao chmod +x num .sh nao sobrevive -- vira permission denied\nno meio do lab-00.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c970429e71e5826b3495514e7875f551b2611d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/5c970429e71e5826b3495514e7875f551b2611d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKGFiYjdjZGQzZGIwMjQ5NGU1MTRhZTM2NWZlNjk5ZTEwZWY4OTVjYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645","sha":"74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645"}],"sha":"abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/abb7cdd3db02494e514ae365fe699e10ef895cbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T00:46:26Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T00:46:26Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs(fase-0): briefing da fundacao + lab-00-morte-subita\n\nFase 0 detalhada em 7 entregas (0.1 a 0.7), com os prompts de handoff prontos\npara colar em sessoes de agente. 0.4 e 0.5 sao paralelizaveis.\n\nO conceito da fase nao e \"setup\": e que um processo NAO morre instantaneamente.\nO shutdown gracioso e a unica coisa que o aprendiz escreve a mao aqui -- quatro\nvezes, uma por linguagem -- porque ele e readiness + drenagem + deadline + ordem\nde dependencia disfarcados de tarefa de infraestrutura.\n\n- lab-00-morte-subita: 50 req/s + SIGTERM = requisicoes perdidas, medidas.\n  A fase so fecha quando o mesmo lab reporta zero.\n- Registrada a valvula de escape escolhida pelo aprendiz (CLAUDE.md): ao travar,\n  ele recorre a IA sem acesso ao repo ou a forum. Agentes deste repo reexplicam o\n  conceito e apontam onde olhar, mas nao colam a solucao -- nem sob frustracao.\n- Registrado o ritmo irregular (docs/04): entregas fatiadas em blocos de ~2h,\n  sempre terminando em estado commitavel, com \"onde paramos\" em todo handoff.\n- Decidida a migracao do repo para o filesystem nativo do WSL na entrega 0.2.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ce36569b707f5fb84ef07b88e0247eb0120a3140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/ce36569b707f5fb84ef07b88e0247eb0120a3140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDc0YTQ2MTNmZGUxODk4M2I1NDc3Yjk0NzA1Nzg2MDI3MzQ0MDA2NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163","sha":"7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163"}],"sha":"74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/74a4613fde18983b5477b9470578602734400645"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T23:49:57Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T23:49:57Z","email":"orlando_vw@hotmail.com","name":"oVitali"},"message":"docs: plano macro do laboratorio de sistemas distribuidos (Nimbus & Havoc)\n\nFundacao documental do projeto de estudo. Nenhum codigo ainda -- por design:\na Fase 0 comeca pelo metodo, nao pelo scaffold.\n\nContexto:\n- Nimbus: carteira digital ficticia, deliberadamente distribuida (7 servicos,\n  4 linguagens, 4 bancos, 2 brokers).\n- Havoc: plano de controle de caos que quebra o Nimbus sob demanda e mede o\n  antes/depois de cada padrao.\n\nRegras que governam o repo (CLAUDE.md):\n1. Esqueleto + TODOs -- agentes entregam o entorno e param nos nucleos de\n   padrao; o aprendiz escreve circuit breaker, idempotencia, outbox, saga,\n   deadline, bulkhead, DLQ e cache.\n2. Nada entra antes da dor -- todo padrao e precedido por um lab que demonstra\n   a falha que ele resolve, diagnosticada pela observabilidade e nao pelo fonte.\n\nConteudo:\n- docs/00-charter.md ......... principios, criterio de sucesso, papeis\n- docs/01-architecture.md .... servicos, dados, mensageria, portas, RAM\n- docs/02-roadmap.md ......... 12 fases, 34 labs, criterios de saida\n- docs/03-learning-catalog.md  ~90 conceitos indexados com niveis de dominio\n- docs/04-working-agreement.md templates de handoff e de review\n- docs/adr/0001..0010 ........ decisoes com alternativas descartadas\n- docs/labs, docs/phases ..... templates\n- .gitattributes ............. LF normalizado (o repo vai rodar em WSL2/containers)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d198272fa4d1bafb84204ac50cc7b6c1612f0bc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/trees/d198272fa4d1bafb84204ac50cc7b6c1612f0bc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/git/commits/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9432682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw","id":9432682,"login":"ovitaliw","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0MzI2ODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovitaliw","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commit/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163","node_id":"C_kwDOUFnKUdoAKDczOTJlMjBjMjFkZTU0YTQzOTMyMGNlOWM3NzY2YWZlYWI4NTcxNjM","parents":[],"sha":"7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits/7392e20c21de54a439320ce9c7766afeab857163"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovitaliw/nimbus-havoc/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=829e300907c44dcd7bea81134b6a0738ddd64f35&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A19%3A35.221Z"}');
