ithub.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"chore: merge M6 — platform batteries (i18n, error tracking, feature flags)\n\nShips three platform packages and wires each into the reference apps:\n\n  @sentra/i18n           vue-i18n seam, en + id, typed catalogues\n  @sentra/plugin-errors  allowlist-only error reporting seam\n  @sentra/flags          deterministic bucketing, DEV-gated local overrides\n\nAdds one CI gate (scripts/check-catalogues.mjs, translation-catalogue parity),\nbringing the total to seven, and moves the corresponding entries out of the\nproposal''s ''what you must still build'' list.\n\nAlso in this range: apps/console gains the .env.example it was missing, so all\nthree apps now state their own environment contract.","tree":{"sha":"bd748179f8094e0a660737bfe268dc15e5525cfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/bd748179f8094e0a660737bfe268dc15e5525cfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/0106a094741947a23250cbc4cb81d49429810322","verification":{"payload":"tree bd748179f8094e0a660737bfe268dc15e5525cfc\nparent 08d0569e99e6ebf494017b22a162df71d1b1d763\nparent f39a4176f81efc00c05985f1a0e0ca405941344f\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788220647 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788220647 +0700\n\nchore: merge M6 — platform batteries (i18n, error tracking, feature flags)\n\nShips three platform packages and wires each into the reference apps:\n\n  @sentra/i18n           vue-i18n seam, en + id, typed catalogues\n  @sentra/plugin-errors  allowlist-only error reporting seam\n  @sentra/flags          deterministic bucketing, DEV-gated local overrides\n\nAdds one CI gate (scripts/check-catalogues.mjs, translation-catalogue parity),\nbringing the total to seven, and moves the corresponding entries out of the\nproposal''s ''what you must still build'' list.\n\nAlso in this range: apps/console gains the .env.example it was missing, so all\nthree app