.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T08:48:44Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"i18n(ui): translate remaining Combobox strings\n\nThe design spec''s inventory missed two hardcoded strings in Combobox.vue\n(no-matches and load-failure). Route both through useI18n(), matching the\npattern already used for the loading state, and add en/id catalogue entries.","tree":{"sha":"a982b71cc95361ddf25509096e3062472802b17d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/a982b71cc95361ddf25509096e3062472802b17d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/4bef0e71fb0bc32f4919e0d512fea0b2560d0cec","verification":{"payload":"tree a982b71cc95361ddf25509096e3062472802b17d\nparent a68b8afc398328a5a2bc76840c994da55e079fd7\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788166124 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788166124 +0700\n\ni18n(ui): translate remaining Combobox strings\n\nThe design spec''s inventory missed two hardcoded strings in Combobox.vue\n(no-matches and load-failure). Route both through useI18n(), matching the\npattern already used for the loading state, and add en/id catalogue entries.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapU/7RsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmJzkQEAlZs7um/b+AZaYeQTEoRj\npCAT/vOmy6qJymnFiBIPrH0A/24+pvKQi0RSTH27H4APN0nXH2EfV4ERB7oKuHho\nfT4K\n=ksT4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-01T00:03:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gis