since each sentence already\nenumerates what follows. Adds an entry to the proposal''s gate-limitations\nsection stating plainly that the no-numbers-in-prose rule is judged by hand\nagainst a noisy grep sweep and is not enforced by any CI gate.","tree":{"sha":"f53a97f4e80ca4cdb324de61b930d8122e7cb0cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/f53a97f4e80ca4cdb324de61b930d8122e7cb0cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/b9e730df79724e9391030015169f0c2bab945e85","verification":{"payload":"tree f53a97f4e80ca4cdb324de61b930d8122e7cb0cb\nparent 70bd0811a1ea03518da13473ffcbe40040477fcd\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788093598 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788093598 +0700\n\ndocs: drop three inventory counts, document the no-counts sweep''s enforcement gap\n\nRewrites \"six jobs\", \"Five scenarios:\", and \"Two routes:\" to drop counts that\ngo stale the moment a CI job or route is added, since each sentence already\nenumerates what follows. Adds an entry to the proposal''s gate-limitations\nsection stating plainly that the no-numbers-in-prose rule is judged by hand\nagainst a noisy grep sweep and is not enforced by any CI gate.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapQknhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmKhcwD/WvC4XVpfdPqcaohQu054\nNTxtglKSuVRO4kJ3rpU8SWoA/jEMWOVycr/lGx6pSGXUHr21/ORMncdOLRL69DqK\nPukN\n=+imi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"