8''s INTEGRITY_PATTERN by symbol, not line number\n\nThe Verification section cited `manifest.ts:112` for INTEGRITY_PATTERN''s\ndeclaration. Line 112 is the JSDoc comment carrying the \"see ADR 0008\"\ncitation; the `const` is on 113.\n\nFixed by dropping the line number rather than incrementing it. This\nsentence addresses a symbol, and a symbol''s durable address is its name --\na line number here is a second fact to keep in sync with no runner to\ncheck it. The surrounding citation list keeps its line numbers because\nthere the numbers are the recorded output of the grep, not a way of\npointing at code.\n\nThird instance of citation drift in one task, which is the argument.","tree":{"sha":"568530705ee89ad53af32d1d83a7580bd8c5e3f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/568530705ee89ad53af32d1d83a7580bd8c5e3f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/7a75be67ad0f8c5b98dc36ebc3eeb16c15cd3c2d","verification":{"payload":"tree 568530705ee89ad53af32d1d83a7580bd8c5e3f5\nparent 512d7995ef73e12569f9c34985f712b4127801a2\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788089781 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788089781 +0700\n\ndocs: address ADR 0008''s INTEGRITY_PATTERN by symbol, not line number\n\nThe Verification section cited `manifest.ts:112` for INTEGRITY_PATTERN''s\ndeclaration. Line 112 is the JSDoc comment carrying the \"see ADR 0008\"\ncitation; the `const` is on 113.\n\nFixed by dropping the line number rather than incrementing it. This\nsentence addresses a symbol, and a symbol''s durable address is its name --\na line number here is a second fact to keep in sync with no runner to\ncheck it. The surrounding citation list keeps its line numbers because\nthere the numbers are the recorded output of the grep, not a way of\npointing at code.\n\nThird instance of citation drift in one task, which is the argument.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNAT