 here are purely\nprettier line-wrapping -- no semantic change to any assertion, budget,\nor script behaviour.\n\nSurfaced by Task 9''s implementer, which correctly declined to fold these\ninto its own commit.","tree":{"sha":"6b02cef99d43ac3869222bb76d09295b2fc10d02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/6b02cef99d43ac3869222bb76d09295b2fc10d02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/23f03eb3a5a52824474957d22a7ca61404085325","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b02cef99d43ac3869222bb76d09295b2fc10d02\nparent ed732201f2ab4c8533bb165f2e63bb7e4f01b3f1\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788086005 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788086005 +0700\n\nstyle(gates): reformat Lighthouse budget files to satisfy format:check\n\nTask 8''s commits (04ffdc3, fa35bfe) landed these four files unformatted.\nCI runs `pnpm format:check` in the verify job (.github/workflows/ci.yml:36),\nso those commits would have failed the gate. Changes here are purely\nprettier line-wrapping -- no semantic change to any assertion, budget,\nor script behaviour.\n\nSurfaced by Task 9''s implementer, which correctly declined to fold these\ninto its own commit.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapQG9RsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmJ3ZwEA4A1lr7OHNn0R8WQhXQep\n0npzc5a5zo/VTtDx+zSBVIIBAJ+XllX7CKWjTA+z97GFf+3iSuSzgrQMHov2k8hx\nGMkP\n=J/57\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur