ithub.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(gates): re-derive Lighthouse budgets from correctly-rendering pages\n\nFix round 2, per an independent artifact audit: all three URLs measured in\nfix round 1 were the wrong page (shell RemoteUnavailable, a storefront home\npage with 20 failed image requests, and a blank /collections/all).\n\n- Fix apps/storefront''s dead /collections/all route (no such route exists;\n  swapped for a real product-detail URL in lighthouserc.reference.json).\n- Add an MSW image handler + fixture PNG so product images resolve instead\n  of 404ing against the real network; re-derive every storefront budget\n  from the corrected measurement and correct the image:size rationale to\n  the real cause (Service Worker responses never populate transferSize).\n- Re-verify the storefront accessibility 0.98 pin against the corrected\n  page: confirmed heading-order, and only heading-order, via the audit''s\n  own auditRefs -- kept, not removed.\n- Document the shell''s two legitimate RemoteUnavailable measurements\n  (full-tree failure path vs. stripped clean path) and which is binding.\n- Add scripts/check-lighthouse-dom-floor.mjs: a dom-size lower bound lhci\n  0.15.1 cannot express natively, wired into both verify:lighthouse\n  scripts, with a passing falsification test against the old broken route.\n- Force VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true in platform-only''s build step so its\n  Lighthouse run measures the same artifact shape every other calibration\n  point uses (apps/shell/src/mocks/enabled.ts tree-shakes on this flag).","tree":{"sha":"d1f395c762d6eeaa24354099f59ecb41214a5040","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/d1f395c762d6eeaa24354099f59ecb41214a5040"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/04ffdc3c5f80fccf0445516bed1a7eaaa8f5af4b","verification":{"payload":"tree d1f395c762d6eeaa24354099f59ecb41214a5040\nparent a8efe15ddf8a7492615f2b1b44d81d28324dabcf\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788083665 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788083665 +0700\n\nfix(gates): re-derive Lighthouse budgets from correctly-rendering pages\n\nFix round 2, per an independent artifact audit: all three URLs measured in\nfix round 1 were the wrong page (shell RemoteUnavailable, a storefront home\npage with 20 failed image requests, and a blank /collections/all).\n\n- Fix apps/storefront''s dead /collections/all route (no such route exists;\n  swapped for a real product-detail URL in lighthouserc.reference.json).\n- Add an MSW image handler + fixture PNG so product images resolve instead\n  of 404ing against the real network; re-derive every storefront budget\n  from the corrected measurement and correct the image:size rationale to\n  the real cause (Service Worker responses never populate transferSize).\n- Re-verify the storefront accessibility 0.98 pin against the corrected\n  page: confirmed heading-order, and only heading-order, via the audit''s\n  own auditRefs -- kept, not removed.\n- Document the shell''s two legitimate RemoteUnavailable measurements\n  (full-tree failure path vs. stripped clean path) and which is binding.\n- Add scripts/check-lighthouse-dom-floor.mjs: a dom-size lower bound lhci\n  0.15.1 cannot express natively, wired into both verify:lighthouse\n  scripts, with a passing falsification test against the old broken route.\n- Force VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true in platform-only''s build step so its\n  Lighthouse run measures the same artifact shape every other calibration\n  point uses (apps/shell/src/mocks/enabled.ts tree-shakes on this flag).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapP90RsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmI/CAEAjWvlap+yYd4i1Gf6+urV\nY2d7j5qMLzYRoyGzWJlHJPgBANc9KvDIRTFHP0455tpTOPOrKg6zgD9Q1mID96Da\nkhkB\n=wpEM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":