=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/a8efe15ddf8a7492615f2b1b44d81d28324dabcf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:07:12Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T09:07:12Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(ci): close bundle-size and platform-gate composition gaps in Lighthouse CI\n\nThe lighthouse job measured a VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true build that the verify\njob''s bundle-size check never touched (different turbo cache key, different\ndist tree), so the resource-floor gap was not actually closed as previously\nclaimed. Add a Check bundle sizes step to the lighthouse job against its own\nbuild, and add verify:lighthouse to platform-only so the platform budget runs\ncontinuously against every stripped-tree CI run instead of only in a\nthrowaway clone. Correct both lighthouserc $comment fields to describe the\ncomposition that actually holds, and document the MSW image:size placeholder\nand the tolerated accessibility pin as known, tracked properties.","tree":{"sha":"c7f645360379d790f53e057cb4d2eccbf8fba78e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/c7f645360379d790f53e057cb4d2eccbf8fba78e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/a8efe15ddf8a7492615f2b1b44d81d28324dabcf","verification":{"payload":"tree c7f645360379d790f53e057cb4d2eccbf8fba78e\nparent 42414c9e23f33834ce7c5041fa6e689d790fd9d7\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788080832 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788080832 +0700\n\nfix(ci): close bundle-size and platform-gate composition gaps in Lighthouse CI\n\nThe lighthouse job measured a VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true build that the verify\njob''s bundle-size check never touched (different turbo cache key, different\ndist tree), so the resource-floor gap was not actually closed as previously\nclaimed. Add a Check bundle sizes step to the lighthouse job against its own\nbuild, and add verify:lighthouse to platform-only so the platform budget runs\ncontinuously against every stripped-tree CI run instead of only in a\nthrowaway clone. Correct both lighthouserc $comment fields to describe the\ncomposition that actually holds, and document the MSW image:size placeholder\nand the tolerated accessibility pin as known, tracked properties.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPywBsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmJEcwEA+b7/vJOFToOkTTZx1S5L\nskzE9WBf7eK/5rp14GdkqfABALX9ItNqcDkHz9um7SQwwZ0L+VI7DDAAvaa3XsdV\n/dEP\n=5r7a\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"ht