t_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:42:43Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"ci: add the lighthouse job\n\nBuilds mocked, runs verify:lighthouse against the shell unconditionally,\nand verify:lighthouse:reference against the storefront only when\nlighthouserc.reference.json still exists (pnpm''s --filter on an unmatched\npackage exits 0 silently, so a file guard is required, not an exit-code\nguard). Reports are uploaded regardless of pass/fail for inspection.","tree":{"sha":"14569f31d37edda5025913773641b4e2c49bd37d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/14569f31d37edda5025913773641b4e2c49bd37d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/42414c9e23f33834ce7c5041fa6e689d790fd9d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 14569f31d37edda5025913773641b4e2c49bd37d\nparent ca322fdbef9fdce2cd483e107593687bb67b2c07\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788079363 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788079363 +0700\n\nci: add the lighthouse job\n\nBuilds mocked, runs verify:lighthouse against the shell unconditionally,\nand verify:lighthouse:reference against the storefront only when\nlighthouserc.reference.json still exists (pnpm''s --filter on an unmatched\npackage exits 0 silently, so a file guard is required, not an exit-code\nguard). Reports are uploaded regardless of pass/fail for inspection.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPtAxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmLsgwEA8Ya4zSiiSSzKn0aQ9FEW\nl7q4BJcLpkdsc4adz9pF6KIBALcErNUAZgAF50m2ybUzwgeUTyXVP73vEFg+rESg\n1RYB\n=zyUO\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://