ps://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/ca322fdbef9fdce2cd483e107593687bb67b2c07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:41:33Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:41:33Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"feat(gates): replace placeholder Lighthouse budgets with measured values\n\nShell (platform): script/stylesheet/image/total/third-party budgets set\nfrom a real mocked build (287967/4809/0/293881/0 bytes). image:size and\ntotal:size are re-derived (0, and sum-of-per-type) so neither is\naccidentally vacuous or a looser ceiling than its own components; LCP\ntightened to measured+15%; TBT/CLS given a small explicit non-zero\ntolerance instead of a literal zero to avoid warning on CI runner jitter.\n\nStorefront (reference): same treatment with its own measurements across\nboth audited URLs. third-party:count is investigated, not raised blind:\nall 22 flagged requests are MSW-intercepted calls to\ndemo-shop.myshopify.com/cdn.shopify.com (transferSize 0 each) because the\nmock fixtures use realistic external hostnames, not same-origin paths.\nimage:size stays an explicitly labelled placeholder because MSW forces\nevery product-image byte count to 0, so the mocked build cannot measure\nreal image weight. accessibility minScore is set to the measured 0.98\n(not 1): the storefront home page has a real heading-order violation,\ndocumented as a follow-up rather than masked by loosening the gate.\n\nBoth configs pass verify:lighthouse / verify:lighthouse:reference against\nthese numbers.","tree":{"sha":"9b3f1a61c51cc83a9ddc556bd16b689080d92afb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/9b3f1a61c51cc83a9ddc556bd16b689080d92afb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/ca322fdbef9fdce2cd483e107593687bb67b2c07","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b3f1a61c51cc83a9ddc556bd16b689080d92afb\nparent 74d43ec950a4525184658a36a5c05f0ac5513389\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788079293 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788079293 +0700\n\nfeat(gates): replace placeholder Lighthouse budgets with measured values\n\nShell (platform): script/stylesheet/image/total/third-party budgets set\nfrom a real mocked build (287967/4809/0/293881/0 bytes). image:size and\ntotal:size are re-derived (0, and sum-of-per-type) so neither is\naccidentally vacuous or a looser ceiling than its own components; LCP\ntightened to measured+15%; TBT/CLS given a small explicit non-zero\ntolerance instead of a literal zero to avoid warning on CI runner jitter.\n\nStorefront (reference): same treatment with its own measurements across\nboth audited URLs. third-party:count is investigated, not raised blind:\nall 22 flagged requests are MSW-intercepted calls to\ndemo-shop.myshopify.com/cdn.shopify.com (transferSize 0 each) because the\nmock fixtures use realistic external hostnames, not same-origin paths.\nimage:size stays an explicitly labelled placeholder because MSW forces\nevery product-image byte count to 0, so the mocked build cannot measure\nreal image weight. accessibility minScore is set to the measured 0.98\n(not 1): the storefront home page has a real heading-order violation,\ndocumented as a follow-up rather than masked by loosening the gate.\n\nBoth configs pass verify:lighthouse / verify:lighthouse:reference against\nthese numbers.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPsvRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2o