efront\n\nlighthouserc.json audits the platform-owned shell and survives\nscripts/strip-reference.mjs; lighthouserc.reference.json audits\napps/storefront and is deleted by the strip via a new\nsentra.referenceConfigs manifest key, following readReferenceDocs''s\nestablished shape (absent/malformed key deletes nothing).\n\nBoth startServerCommands bind explicitly to --host 127.0.0.1: vite\npreview''s default \"localhost\" bind resolved IPv6-only on this machine,\nwhich the http://127.0.0.1 URLs in both configs could not reach.\n\nBudget numbers here are placeholders from the brief, not measurements;\nthey get replaced with real numbers in the next commit.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPioRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmIKJAD+IM4ZWK9X6SuZTc8IR94n\nN91t+FIicuDFTCPKs3GLvvMBAKnt4dYOSlv5CVv6Nl1tq1jquMIdSaiGWoeInzeP\nMzgC\n=pjJ+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ba