clare VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS, so a mocked and\nnon-mocked build were indistinguishable to the cache. Verified FULL TURBO on a\nplain replay and a real (uncached) build once VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true differs\nfrom what produced the cache entry.","tree":{"sha":"2b7670cd4e6d94ec96166f1c14dd7b419142e081","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/2b7670cd4e6d94ec96166f1c14dd7b419142e081"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/3836dd709ac25d54c50e092afb5249d8b77563b0","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b7670cd4e6d94ec96166f1c14dd7b419142e081\nparent 6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788076403 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788076403 +0700\n\nbuild: pin @lhci/cli 0.15.1 and close the turbo cache hole on VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS\n\nturbo.json''s build task did not declare VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS, so a mocked and\nnon-mocked build were indistinguishable to the cache. Verified FULL TURBO on a\nplain replay and a real (uncached) build once VITE_SENTRA_MOCKS=true differs\nfrom what produced the cache entry.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPhcxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmK9cQEAgZm77FpLp4drmejOzqRM\n1E/DO9tQrtKmT86qthDcB1QBAMD5WdR8RZtxrO+aNV1V20Vsq+LC6qMtfoNSQTwv\npaMO\n=3FLi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/3836dd709ac25d54c50e092afb5249d8b77563b0","node_id":"C_kwDOUF6bmdoAKDM4MzZkZDcwOWFjMjVkNTRjNTBlMDkyYWZiNTI0OWQ4Yjc3NTYzYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136","sha":"6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136"}],"sha":"3836dd709ac25d54c50e092afb5249d8b77563b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/3836dd709ac25d54c50e092afb5249d8b77563b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:49:42Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:49:42Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(build): cover hash-remotes.mjs in turbo''s global cache key\n\nscripts/hash-remotes.mjs was not in turbo.json''s globalDependencies,\nso a content change to the script did not invalidate any task''s\ncache: a plain pnpm build could replay a cached dist/remotes.json\nstamped by pre-change logic while reporting FULL TURBO success. Same\ndefect class as B6-1 in the CSP gate, recurring on a different\nbuild-time script that lives outside apps/shell. Add it alongside the\nexisting CSP entries in globalDependencies; nothing else the script\nreads lives outside the tasks turbo already tracks.\n\nReproduced with a visible marker in sriHash()''s output: before the\nfix, a plain `pnpm build` reported \"6 cached, 6 total >>> FULL TURBO\"\nand the on-disk manifest kept its pre-marker digests; after the fix,\nthe same build reported \"0 cached, 6 total\" and the manifest carried\nthe marker. Reverting the marker and rebuilding restored the correct\ndigests.","tree":{"sha":"8cfe10ed72e97d871c91e9f125be1398d27090e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/8cfe10ed72e97d871c91e9f125be1398d27090e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136","verification":{"payload":"tree 8cfe10ed72e97d871c91e9f125be1398d27090e1\nparent da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788076182 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788076182 +0700\n\nfix(build): cover hash-remotes.mjs in turbo''s global cache key\n\nscripts/hash-remotes.mjs was not in turbo.json''s globalDependencies,\nso a content change to the script did not invalidate any task''s\ncache: a plain pnpm build could replay a cached dist/remotes.json\nstamped by pre-change logic while reporting FULL TURBO success. Same\ndefect class as B6-1 in the CSP gate, recurring on a different\nbuild-time script that lives outside apps/shell. Add it alongside the\nexisting CSP entries in globalDependencies; nothing else the script\nreads lives outside the tasks turbo already tracks.\n\nReproduced with a visible marker in sriHash()''s output: before the\nfix, a plain `pnpm build` reported \"6 cached, 6 total >>> FULL TURBO\"\nand the on-disk manifest kept its pre-marker digests; after the fix,\nthe same build reported \"0 cached, 6 total\" and the manifest carried\nthe marker. Reverting the marker and rebuilding restored the correct\ndigests.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPglhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmLWkAD+KuIAtJ58Wo/X8xks3ZVj\n/ms5cGy1acO270NR0LdtfA8A/ieNMVrrWa/odFbfp18r6lqtjTaMEs/Nn44+H6LR\ne+IB\n=on0K\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136","node_id":"C_kwDOUF6bmdoAKDZiODIyM2I0NTFjODYxZmFhMDBjNmQxYmVjNmFmNTMxNGY1YWIxMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf","sha":"da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf"}],"sha":"6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/6b8223b451c861faa00c6d1bec6af5314f5ab136"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:38:31Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T07:38:31Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(shell): hash remote manifest on the ordinary build path\n\nTurbo already orders @sentra/console and @sentra/storefront builds\nahead of @sentra/shell''s (confirmed via --dry=json and a real clean\nbuild — optionalDependencies still count as task-graph edges), so an\nadopter''s plain `pnpm build` was one wiring step away from producing a\ncorrectly hashed manifest. Chain hash-remotes.mjs into the shell''s\nbuild script, mirroring the generate-csp.mjs precedent, so a fresh\nclone''s first deploy hashes its remotes instead of failing closed with\nno visible cause. The E2E webServer command''s separate hashing step is\nnow redundant and removed.","tree":{"sha":"5a98a07e98dc0edc102da50b892879bef6e62301","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/5a98a07e98dc0edc102da50b892879bef6e62301"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/da98a33ab09307f334d4cacd7967b240b2d7caaf","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a98a07e98dc0edc102da50b892879bef6e62301\nparent 5f18bfa3602102b3da9f751f3e92a67af20e8147\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788075511 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788075511 +0700\n\nfix(shell): hash remote manifest on the ordinary build path\n\nTurbo already orders @sentra/console and @sentra/storefront builds\nahead of @sentra/shell''s (confirmed via --dry=json and a real clean\nbuild — optionalDependencies still count as task-graph edges), so an\nadopter''s plain `pnpm build` was one wiring step away from producing a\ncorrectly hashed manifest. Chain hash-remotes.mjs into the shell''s\nbuild script, mirroring the generate-csp.mjs precedent, so a fresh\nclone''s first deploy hashes its remotes instead of failing closed with\nno visible cause. The E2E webServer command''s separate hashing step is\nnow redundant and removed.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT