\n- csp.mjs: validateSourceOwners now rejects a non-widenable directive\n  (e.g. script-src) directly, instead of relying on validateExtraSources to\n  catch it later at build time.\n- generate-csp.mjs: inject the CSP meta after an existing meta charset\n  rather than before it, so a long policy cannot push charset past the\n  browser''s 1024-byte detection window.","tree":{"sha":"1960ba5273c1b02987867ae69a7e3192a58816c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/1960ba5273c1b02987867ae69a7e3192a58816c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/d74b492d89c5b2b4f0a106db5c55882fc9473f95","verification":{"payload":"tree 1960ba5273c1b02987867ae69a7e3192a58816c0\nparent 64b7fb9f658fa33a612d21305e240c3c7e856ec2\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788071903 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788071903 +0700\n\nfix(gates): invalidate the CSP build cache, tighten owner validation, and inject the CSP after charset\n\n- turbo.json: add security/csp-sources.json, scripts/csp.mjs, and\n  scripts/generate-csp.mjs to globalDependencies so an edit to any of them\n  invalidates the shell''s build cache instead of replaying a stale dist/.\n- csp.mjs: validateSourceOwners now rejects a non-widenable directive\n  (e.g. script-src) directly, instead of relying on validateExtraSources to\n  catch it later at build time.\n- generate-csp.mjs: inject the CSP meta after an existing meta charset\n  rather than before it, so a long policy cannot push charset past the\n  browser''s 1024-byte detection window.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapPP3xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmIrHAD/RM7eeyz39FN3uyKujyuQ\non3R8PwmBRRCjou7Z3IRKMoBAPGrjknBDjATn6HRXYBb+1BCpQGSK1cOQ0cjpltB\n38oL\n=P2hB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"