Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:12:55Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(gates): fail on a budget value that is not a positive number\n\nA budget whose value is not a number -- a quoted \"5632\", a null left\nby a merge conflict, a negative, zero, or Infinity -- compares as NaN\nagainst every real measurement, and NaN comparisons are always false,\nso the budget silently never fails while the file still reads as full\ncoverage. invalidBudgetValueFailures rejects anything that is not a\nfinite number greater than zero, for glob keys and $total: keys alike,\nwithout coercing numeric-looking strings. It runs in the same pass and\nat the same point as the existing unknown-key check, so a malformed\nvalue is caught before the classify skip -- even for an app that is\nabsent or unbuilt.","tree":{"sha":"926828dbdb96eb97e5ef37bc41feeb2818b35729","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/926828dbdb96eb97e5ef37bc41feeb2818b35729"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/ff5774244baec81c00fd151ac6462df7ee42d944","verification":{"payload":"tree 926828dbdb96eb97e5ef37bc41feeb2818b35729\nparent 678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788066775 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788066775 +0700\n\nfix(gates): fail on a budget value that is not a positive number\n\nA budget whose value is not a number -- a quoted \"5632\", a null left\nby a merge conflict, a negative, zero, or Infinity -- compares as NaN\nagainst every real measurement, and NaN comparisons are always false,\nso the budget silently never fails while the file still reads as full\ncoverage. invalidBudgetValueFailures rejects anything that is not a\nfinite number greater than zero, for glob keys and $total: keys alike,\nwithout coercing numeric-looking strings. It runs in the same pass and\nat the same point as the existing unknown-key check, so a malformed\nvalue is caught before the classify skip -- even for an app that is\nabsent or unbuilt.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapO71xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmK54wD/Y2C9SPCBJTBYKU6UJPvm\n5IRCp4VxhPntWUpTsh0ex6YA/2ehjGRH3Pw8G70oHn59ar6wjnmOvvAK+ByNAD/s\nHlsN\n=jKIp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/ff5774244baec81c00fd151ac6462df7ee42d944","node_id":"C_kwDOUF6bmdoAKGZmNTc3NDI0NGJhZWM4MWMwMGZkMTUxYWM2NDYyZGY3ZWU0MmQ5NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda/sentra/commit/678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518","sha":"678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518"}],"sha":"ff5774244baec81c00fd151ac6462df7ee42d944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/ff5774244baec81c00fd151ac6462df7ee42d944"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/barayuda","id":520463,"login":"barayuda","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMDQ2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:02:21Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T05:02:21Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(gates): fail loudly on an unrecognised $-prefixed budget key\n\nAn unknown $ key (a typo like $total:jss, or a not-yet-wired-up total)\nmatched no glob, tripped no vacuity guard, and was compared against\nnothing -- it read as coverage in the budgets file while checking\nnothing at all. TOTAL_KEYS is now the single source of truth for which\n$ keys are recognised, derived from TOTAL_BUDGETS so the two can never\ndrift, and any other $-prefixed key is a hard failure naming the key\nand the permitted set. This check runs before the classify-driven skip\nso a typo surfaces even when the app is absent or unbuilt, not only\nwhen it is present and measured.","tree":{"sha":"591bc577dd8bf1fe6969b80e864b6489cf67aa0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/591bc577dd8bf1fe6969b80e864b6489cf67aa0e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/678d8269c04010ea313b55e6df114ad47b0bd518","verification":{"payload":"tree 591bc577dd8bf1fe6969b80e864b6489cf67aa0e\nparent 61cd8ec3219fa4f1ead7fe9a06e95aef3e99813a\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788066141 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788066141 +0700\n\nfix(gates): fail loudly on an unrecognised $-prefixed budget key\n\nAn unknown $ key (a typo like $total:jss, or a not-yet-wired-up total)\nmatched no glob, tripped no vacuity guard, and was compared against\nnothing -- it read as coverage in the budgets file while checking\nnothing at all. TOTAL_KEYS is now the single source of truth for which\n$ keys are recognised, derived from TOTAL_BUDGETS so the two can never\ndrift, and any other $-prefixed key is a hard failure naming the key\nand the permitted set. This check runs before the classify-driven skip\nso a typo surfaces even when the app is absent or unbuilt, not only\nwhen it is present and measured.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapO5XRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmIYNwEAm13daVn+V1//uRjFUarJ\nMswYumz6CZKVP2yLqzNOLNAA/RPzAV360HFsZogiiW1S8FROqcCpJaZBM59dH5HR\nC5kE\n=02M0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"