":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/commits/61cd8ec3219fa4f1ead7fe9a06e95aef3e99813a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T04:41:49Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T04:41:49Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"fix(gates): add rename-proof total budgets to the bundle-size gate\n\nPer-file glob budgets covered ~1.5% of shipped JS; the rest lives in\nbundler-generated chunk names no glob can name stably. Add $total:js\nand $total:css aggregate budgets per app, exclude source maps from\nevery measurement (they are verified separately), and extend the\nmatched-no-file vacuity guard to cover an aggregate over zero files.","tree":{"sha":"24ae3e4a48149103e4dddbe4a97413a07d7f3cf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/24ae3e4a48149103e4dddbe4a97413a07d7f3cf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/61cd8ec3219fa4f1ead7fe9a06e95aef3e99813a","verification":{"payload":"tree 24ae3e4a48149103e4dddbe4a97413a07d7f3cf9\nparent 1d882dd896c9a4373ec11ced821c7bce24b770e2\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788064909 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788064909 +0700\n\nfix(gates): add rename-proof total budgets to the bundle-size gate\n\nPer-file glob budgets covered ~1.5% of shipped JS; the rest lives in\nbundler-generated chunk names no glob can name stably. Add $total:js\nand $total:css aggregate budgets per app, exclude source maps from\nevery measurement (they are verified separately), and extend the\nmatched-no-file vacuity guard to cover an aggregate over zero files.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapO0jRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDM