"name":"Bara Yuda"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T23:13:57Z","email":"520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Bara Yuda"},"message":"chore: ignore Playwright MCP page snapshots\n\nThe MCP server writes page-*.yml snapshots into .playwright-mcp/ during\nbrowser debugging. Five were sitting untracked in the working tree and\nfailed the merged branch''s format:check — tool output, not source.\n\nIgnored in both files for the same reason .superpowers/ is: gitignored\nscratch should never reach the formatter either.","tree":{"sha":"b074013f6bbe6eea775860dc51d34e518df844ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/trees/b074013f6bbe6eea775860dc51d34e518df844ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/barayuda/sentra/git/commits/c47a9687f967f50d568ac72a2efee09468ca96db","verification":{"payload":"tree b074013f6bbe6eea775860dc51d34e518df844ba\nparent 0cf1b96731a932f40c3cf124473772b3ebc49a0c\nauthor Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788045237 +0700\ncommitter Bara Yuda <520463+barayuda@users.noreply.github.com> 1788045237 +0700\n\nchore: ignore Playwright MCP page snapshots\n\nThe MCP server writes page-*.yml snapshots into .playwright-mcp/ during\nbrowser debugging. Five were sitting untracked in the working tree and\nfailed the merged branch''s format:check — tool output, not source.\n\nIgnored in both files for the same reason .superpowers/ is: gitignored\nscratch should never reach the formatter either.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQT5aaSSLDPHgHvQqUbi3Urahf46YgUCapNntRsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQ4t1K2oX+OmKDZgEAti6fPu1EErLHhw9A7bKx\n51p8FQi63dEitS1HX1Nwh4oA/1zesl35qMvS4arGLmL25rUjeCtsG3PYV6Qzq8t2\nz2YN\n=I5Xy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T14:46:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/520463?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/barayuda/events{/privacy}","follo