com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t-jcabral/mboa-power/commits/c5b883e1618edfeb47c3341c028108a0082a0311/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:25:49Z","email":"veehkcorporation@gmail.com","name":"jpcabral"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T05:25:49Z","email":"veehkcorporation@gmail.com","name":"jpcabral"},"message":"feat:MBOA-25:update, remove, self-update and self-uninstall commands\n\nupdate [names...] refreshes the @mboa packages in the current repo from\nthe local store (all linked by default) — the command to run after a\ncore/host-layer change. remove <name> is the inverse of add: strips the\nimport, ParamList route and Stack.Screen, then unlinks. self-update\nreinstalls the CLI from GitHub; self-uninstall removes it. Import and\nscreen matching is quote-agnostic and bounded so it can never swallow\nneighbouring imports. v0.10.2.","tree":{"sha":"39a9121c38946cab2171544e87113ac9d5f31322","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t-jcabral/mboa-power/git/trees/39a9121c38946cab2171544e87113ac9d5f31322"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/t-jcabral/mboa-power/git/commits/c5b883e1618edfeb47c3341c028108a0082a0311","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333564152?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporation-debug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veehkcorporat