d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/13982db0c94519ddbe125486b443a83444f3e593/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:24:14Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T12:24:14Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"Update the pinned GitHub Actions to their current commits\n\nFour pins moved, resolved from origin with git ls-remote rather than copied from a PR body: actions/checkout v7.0.0 to v7.0.1 (3d3c42e5), actions/upload-artifact v4.6.2 to v7.0.1 (043fb46d), golangci/golangci-lint-action to ba0d7d2e and aquasecurity/trivy-action to ed142fd0. The last two are NOT version changes - both are annotated tags, and the pin was the tag object rather than the commit it points at; same v9.3.0 and v0.36.0 as before. Every other pinned action was already on its latest release and on the right object.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"28ffa4f9374a6cc651ebdcf483118ec1b6c65a67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/28ffa4f9374a6cc651ebdcf483118ec1b6c65a67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/13982db0c94519ddbe125486b443a83444f3e593","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users