MDc0OWI2ZGE2YThhNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5","sha":"80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5"}],"sha":"cf1d23c44b876d7171150669790749b6da6a8a66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/cf1d23c44b876d7171150669790749b6da6a8a66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:52:29Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T14:52:29Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"A signer slot''s identity code is stored in one spelling, and a bare code is refused by name\n\nAn invitation and the login that answers it are written by different systems, so a slot invited as PNOLV-XXXXXX-XXXXX and a caller arriving as PNOLV-XXXXXXXXXXX were two people and the invited person was never offered their own slot. Both sides are now reduced to the one stored spelling on both write paths - create-with-slots and add-slot - because a rule enforced on one of two paths is not enforced. A bare national code is refused 422 naming the field: this service is nowhere near the person and has no country to resolve it with, so a bare code arriving here means the resolution that should have happened upstream did not. No refusal repeats the code back - it is personal data, and a rejected request''s error text is the least controlled place it could end up.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"622905d736e0e4b8609218b99d02991731318c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/622905d736e0e4b8609218b99d02991731318c8c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKDgwZmI4YTQ5YmUyMzYxMjAwNmY3MjIzZDBlMTdkZDQ3ZDdmOTQ5YjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c","sha":"503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c"}],"sha":"80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/80fb8a49be23612006f7223d0e17dd47d7f949b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:23:35Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:23:35Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"Bump go-authbyte to v0.22.0\n\nThe library''s identitycode.Display no longer drops the country and the identity type: it returned the bare national identifier for every code except a Latvian personal number, so a person, a foreign namesake holding the same digits and an organisation''s register number all rendered as one identical string.\n\nNothing in this service renders differently as a result — none of them calls Display — so this carries the corrected function to every service against the day one does. Only go.mod and go.sum move; no other module version changed. Build, vet and test green in each.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"453910300f61a5937227d3894c3ebae471c016f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/453910300f61a5937227d3894c3ebae471c016f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKDUwMzgxOGMyNzgzMjgxNTRhM2NmNDRlYjI2ZDU2YWI1MTA4ZDEyMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69","sha":"2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69"}],"sha":"503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/503818c278328154a3cf44eb26d56ab5108d121c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:41:23Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:41:23Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"Changelog: the metrics endpoint no longer offers OpenMetrics\n\nThe entry this service owed its operators. A scraper asking for application/openmetrics-text is now answered in the Prometheus text format with no # EOF terminator; metric names, labels and values are unchanged, and the endpoint is otherwise as it was. It arrives from the web framework, carried in with the shared-library move, so the changelog says where it comes from and which two scrape setups need their expectation relaxed.\n\nWhere the release-workflow fix of 2026-09-01 was still unreleased, its section records it too: a version tag used to point at a rewrapped manifest whose digest the signature does not cover, so verifying a signature on a version tag failed, and a tag published before the fix needs one release re-publish. The platform changelog has carried that since 2026-09-02; the services themselves had not.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c518d6049d7f2261f488fc00346367bc05b06b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/2c518d6049d7f2261f488fc00346367bc05b06b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKDJkODRhOWU5YzA0NDc0NzhiNzNiYjBmN2M3YTA5N2IwZWFmOWFkNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786","sha":"3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786"}],"sha":"2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/2d84a9e9c0447478b73bb0f7c7a097b0eaf9ad69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:12:25Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T12:12:25Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"Move onto go-authbyte v0.21.0 and go-platform-kit v1.11.2\n\nThe shared libraries at their current releases, which brings the web framework, the HTTP stack and the JOSE library up with them. No source change was needed in any service.\n\nThe move clears two published advisories in golang.org/x/crypto, GO-2026-6354 and GO-2026-6355, by carrying it from v0.55.0 to v0.57.0. GO-2026-5932 remains and has no published fix, but it was present before the move as well. govulncheck reports no vulnerability this service''s own code can reach.\n\nOne upstream change is visible to whoever scrapes this service rather than to its code: from this framework release the metrics endpoint no longer negotiates OpenMetrics and always answers text/plain; version=0.0.4 without the # EOF terminator. Metric names, labels and values are unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"59c027b1a526066e06663944bd7a58f4d715cd19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/59c027b1a526066e06663944bd7a58f4d715cd19"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKDNlOWFlM2ZlMjE1MzIxNTczMDFmNDk5ODkxMTY3MTk0NWZlZmE3ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04","sha":"abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04"}],"sha":"3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/3e9ae3fe21532157301f4998911671945fefa786"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:43:10Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T16:43:10Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"Envelope: accept an origin and per-signer return addresses, return them on read\n\nA document system that prepares an envelope for its own user can name itself (origin.name), say where the signer''s browser is offered to return (origin.returnUrl, with a per-slot returnUrl override) and carry its own reference (origin.ref). GET returns envelope.origin (absent when none) and slots[].returnUrl. A return address is admitted only as an absolute https URL without credentials or a fragment; anything else is refused with 422 before it is stored. Needs the envelope schema at V7 or later.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd90623d63490880bf350f9230f4fb647cd5692e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/bd90623d63490880bf350f9230f4fb647cd5692e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKGFiZDUzYTE2NWJlZmEyNmRjMzA4M2Q1MjE1NDE0NGQxMjIyOWNkMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea","sha":"c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea"}],"sha":"abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/abd53a165befa26dc3083d52154144d12229cd04"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:56:25Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T20:56:25Z","email":"l22exc@gmail.com","name":"GatisB"},"message":"release: wait for the branch build, then retag without rewrapping the manifest\n\nTwo fixes measured on the first release runs. A release published right after a merge races the branch build, so the job now waits for ci to publish the image (up to 20 minutes) before tagging. And the retag is a plain pull/tag/push: imagetools create wraps a single manifest into a new manifest list, which gives the version tag a different, unsigned digest — re-pushing the same manifest keeps the digest, so the cosign signature keeps matching. Existing version tags need one release re-publish each to be re-pointed at the signed digest.\n\nSigned-off-by: GatisB <l22exc@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c89c2207da3391e77a4b6ff0622e6121d87d96a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/trees/6c89c2207da3391e77a4b6ff0622e6121d87d96a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/git/commits/c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111489184?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/unknovs","id":111489184,"login":"unknovs","node_id":"U_kgDOBqUwoA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/unknovs","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea","node_id":"C_kwDOUGKv89oAKGM0ZDRhZDI1NmE2MTFkYjVmMDkzNmQzOTg2NjZlYjQ5ZWYzYTQ3ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/signbyte/envelope/commit/a9f95e46d07c357274c588f33b9d0320d3eaf6df","sha":"a9f95e46d07c357274c588f33b9d0320d3eaf6df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/signbyte/envelope/commits/a9f95e46d07c357274c588f33b9d0320d3eaf6df"}],"sha":"c4d4ad256a611db5f0936d398666eb49ef3a47ea","ur