vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cherireal7/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cherireal7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cherireal7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Cherireal7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cherireal7/atelier/commits/beef236ed30802d7344b0d7ca32486dc0616648e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-27T21:12:31Z","email":"cheridemeke7@gmail.com","name":"cherireal7"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-27T21:12:31Z","email":"cheridemeke7@gmail.com","name":"cherireal7"},"message":"feat(ui): add @atelier/ui with Button, Input, Card + tests\n\nStep 3 — shared component primitives shipped as source (TSX). Every\nconsuming app transpiles them as part of its own build; no build step\nin this package.\n\nComponents:\n  Button   - CVA variants (primary/secondary/ghost/outline) x\n             sizes (sm/md/lg), Radix Slot for asChild composition\n  Input    - Auto-generated htmlFor via useId, label + hint + error,\n             aria-describedby wiring, aria-invalid on error,\n             role=''alert'' on the error message\n  Card     - Composable Card + Header/Title/Description/Body/Footer,\n             subtle vs lift shadow via ''elevated'' prop, polymorphic\n             ''as'' prop for article/section semantics\n\nUtilities:\n  cn()     - clsx + tailwind-merge; standard shadcn pattern\n\nTesting:\n  Vitest + jsdom + @testing-library/react + user-event.\n  17 tests: render, variants, keyboard/click, a11y wiring.\n\npnpm-workspace.yaml now allows esbuild''s postinstall (Vitest dep).","tree":{"sha":"a4fe190b55ad1a569c35e4b33ea8ce78f01d93e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cherireal7/atelier/git/trees/a4fe190b55ad1a569c35e4b33ea8ce78f01d93e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Cherireal7/atelier/git/commits/beef236ed30802d7344b0d7ca32486dc0616648e","verification":{"payload