","email":"phknezev@phknezev-thinkpadp1gen7.rmtuspa.csb","name":"Phillip Knezevich"},"message":"Add SkyLink Aviation demo — multi-API with live traffic\n\nA flight-data-themed demo that deploys 4 API products across 2 gateways\nwith real nginx backends and a traffic generator (~15-20 req/s). Exercises\nevery major console view: overview, topology, policies, API products,\nAPI keys, DNS, TLS, and cost monitoring.","tree":{"sha":"7c320c9a624871691639ad4701fed5511d1d4725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/americas-launch/demo-skylink/git/trees/7c320c9a624871691639ad4701fed5511d1d4725"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/americas-launch/demo-skylink/git/commits/c4da1ed067cc2e85150c90d3239dc6e67bd00375","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/americas-launch/demo-skylink/commit/c4da1ed067cc2e85150c90d3239dc6e67bd00375","node_id":"C_kwDOUGcx69oAKGM0ZGExZWQwNjdjYzJlODUxNTBjOTBkMzIzOWRjNmU2N2JkMDAzNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/americas-launch/demo-skylink/commit/b8cc241544eb99a848ba94ad4b920751b978ca87","sha":"b8cc241544eb99a848ba94ad4b920751b978ca87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/americas-launch/demo-skylink/commits/b8cc241544eb99a848ba94ad4b920751b978ca87"}],"sha":"c4da1ed067cc2e85150c90d3239dc6e67bd00375","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/americas-launch/demo-skylink/commits/c4da1ed067cc2e85150c90d3239dc6e67bd00375"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252998?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hodrigohamalho/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hodrigohamalho","id":252998,"login":"hodrigohamalho","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Mjk5OA==","orga