santana@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Veiga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T22:23:49Z","email":"vinicius.veigasantana@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Veiga"},"message":"Adiciona integração com Mock Server do Apidog e gera pedidos aleatórios na Function\n\n- getPedidos (Azure Function) agora gera pedidos aleatórios a cada\n  chamada em vez de retornar sempre o mesmo array fixo.\n- Novo endpoint GET /veiculos e POST /entregas/{id}/concluir via Apidog,\n  consumidos em services/api.js com fallback para mock local quando\n  VITE_APIDOG_BASE_URL não está configurada.\n- Botão \"Concluir entrega\" na tela de Pedidos por entrega.\n- Workflow do GitHub Actions repassa VITE_APIDOG_BASE_URL para o build\n  do Vite (variável precisa ser configurada em Settings → Variables).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1108814af93d490c459cd69b056d99c6027c5a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniciusVeiga2002/pjbl_arq_cloud/git/trees/1108814af93d490c459cd69b056d99c6027c5a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniciusVeiga2002/pjbl_arq_cloud/git/commits/d295c93ae9a664b2e9c99b6478858f7a55a4e892","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177274701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniciusVeiga2002","id":177274701,"login":"ViniciusVeiga2002","node_id":"U_kgDOCpD_TQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Vinic