public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniciusVeiga2002/pjbl_arq_cloud/commits/76ecb086d08a945f03c506545f888f9e185afb6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T22:11:53Z","email":"vinicius.veigasantana@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Veiga"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T22:11:53Z","email":"vinicius.veigasantana@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Veiga"},"message":"Corrige E401 no build da Function: fixa registry público e remove devDependency pesada\n\nO build do Oryx falhava com \"npm error E401 Unable to authenticate\" ao\ninstalar devDependencies. Adiciona .npmrc fixando o registry público do\nnpm (evita resolução contra um registry interno com token inválido) e\nremove azure-functions-core-tools do package.json — não é necessário\npara o deploy (o Azure já hospeda o runtime das Functions), só serve\npara rodar `func start` localmente, e deve ser instalado globalmente.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e80c3780cbf45444b2c874a9c715d6c4af151b4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniciusVeiga2002/pjbl_arq_cloud/git/trees/e80c3780cbf45444b2c874a9c715d6c4af151b4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ViniciusVeiga2002/pjbl_arq_cloud/git/commits/76ecb086d08a945f03c506545f888f9e185afb6d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/177274701?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViniciusVeiga2002","id":177274701,"login":"ViniciusVeiga2002","node_id":"U_kgDOCpD_TQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViniciusVeiga2002/orgs","r