events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commits/da7dc5d1bff37f95f14576e466ecb9fdd1e14602/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T02:57:12Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T02:57:12Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"message":"feat: generación de PDF del certificado de cumplido y componentes genéricos reutilizables\n\n- PDF: integra pdfmake 0.3.x con fuente Roboto; genera certificado de cumplido\n  con logos institucionales (UD + SIGUD), evidencias, novedades y datos del contrato;\n  visor previo in-page con descarga\n- Shared: extrae DataTableComponent (tabla desktop + tarjetas mobile, skeleton,\n  ordenamiento), SearchInputComponent, TabBarComponent, EmptyStateComponent y\n  EstadoChipComponent a src/app/shared/; layout constants (MAIN_WIDE/NARROW,\n  HDR_WIDE/NARROW) como única fuente de verdad para ancho de contenedor\n- Refactor: las cuatro pantallas del contratista (contratos, solicitudes,\n  detalle-soporte, informe) consumen los nuevos componentes genéricos sin cambio\n  de comportamiento ni apariencia","tree":{"sha":"fda71ed1cd823392007fc855f7122f0cda1997a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/trees/fda71ed1cd823392007fc855f7122f0cda1997a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/commits/da7dc5d1bff37f95f14576e466ecb9fdd1e14602","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_u