,"html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111","id":136873001,"login":"Blade100111","node_id":"U_kgDOCCiEKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commits/fbc001b1cbb9da4807ea24516fe2da90b9ae9850/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:46:19Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:46:19Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"message":"fix: corregir TypeError al cargar ruta /informe por import incorrecto de pdfmake\n\nCausa: `import { createPdf, addFonts } from ''pdfmake''` extrae los métodos\nsin bindear `this`. addFonts() y createPdf() son métodos de instancia que\nusan `this` internamente; al destructurarlos del módulo CJS, `this` es\nundefined. La llamada de addFonts() en el top-level del módulo lanzaba\nTypeError en el momento en que el chunk lazy se evaluaba, abortando la\nactivación de la ruta /gestion-contratista/informe/:pagoMensualId.\n\nFix:\n- Cambiar a import default (`import pdfMake from ''pdfmake''`) para preservar\n  el binding de `this` al llamar pdfMake.addFonts() y pdfMake.createPdf()\n- Mover addFonts() dentro de generarCertificadoPDF() (no en module top-level)\n- Añadir allowSyntheticDefaultImports:true al tsconfig para que TypeScript\n  acepte el default import de un módulo CJS sin default declarado en @types","tree":{"sha":"1d6b51a5ad85493341532546262bee73f7a5d8b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/trees/1d6b51a5ad85493341532546262bee73f7a5d8b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/commits/fbc001b1cbb9da4807ea24516fe2da90b9ae9850","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136873001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111","id":136873001,"login":"Blade100111","node_id":"U_kgDOCCiEKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commit/fbc001b1cbb9da4807ea24516fe2da90b9ae9850","node_id":"C_kwDOUGpBstoAKGZiYzAwMWIxY2JiOWRhNDgwN2VhMjQ1MTZmZTJkYTkwYjlhZTk4NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commit/bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418","sha":"bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commits/bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418"}],"sha":"fbc001b1cbb9da4807ea24516fe2da90b9ae9850","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commits/fbc001b1cbb9da4807ea24516fe2da90b9ae9850"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136873001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111","id":136873001,"login":"Blade100111","node_id":"U_kgDOCCiEKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commits/bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:30:29Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T13:30:29Z","email":"jonathan100111a@gmail.com","name":"blade100111"},"message":"feat: implementar generación de PDF del certificado de cumplido\n\nInstala pdfmake 0.3.11 (oficial) y genera el PDF desde la pantalla\nde Informe al pulsar \"Generar certificado\".\n\nEstructura del documento reproduce PEI-PR-003-FR-009 del legacy\n(cumplidos_cliente / pdfmakeoas@0.0.2):\n- Página FOLIO landscape, márgenes 10pt\n- Encabezado institucional con 3 filas (rowSpan)\n- Tabla contractual: nombre contratista, proceso, dependencia, sede,\n  períodos CDP/RP (placeholder en sandbox)\n- Objeto del contrato\n- Tabla de actividades con rowSpan por grupo (No./Actividad/Avance)\n  y bullet list de evidencias (texto e hipervínculos)\n- Sección de certificación con datos financieros (placeholder)\n- Firmas: contratista y supervisor (cross-referenciado desde MOCK_DETALLES)\n- Fuente Helvetica (Type1 estándar PDF, sin VFS)\n\nCambios de código:\n- InformeData, ActividadItem y variantes ahora son exports públicos\n- MOCK_DETALLES exportado de detalle-soporte para lookup de supervisor\n- angular.json: pdfmake en allowedCommonJsDependencies (suprimir warning CJS)\n- Logos y datos de sesión/financieros marcados con placeholder explícito","tree":{"sha":"51e7d86ccf10ea7fa1394c9a2fd5238624978a04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/trees/51e7d86ccf10ea7fa1394c9a2fd5238624978a04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/git/commits/bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136873001?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111","id":136873001,"login":"Blade100111","node_id":"U_kgDOCCiEKQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blade100111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blade100111/propuestas-interfaz/commit/bfac66f69b97afc8c739f3afc95619fd48e12418","node_id":"C_kwDOUGpBstoAKGJmYWM2NmY2OWI5N2FmYzhjNzM5ZjNhZmM5NTYxOWZkNDhlMTI0MTg","parents":[{"html_u