,"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"47fecd03ef83a702ed579b9f594adeec86fc5bb1"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-03T02:44:09Z","committedDate":"2026-09-03T02:44:09Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"2fa3b5d3d968d1ea2ffd76e2056666afc7cf5d2c"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-01T09:52:23Z","committedDate":"2026-09-01T09:52:23Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-01T07:49:48Z","committedDate":"2026-09-01T07:49:48Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-28T08:48:57Z","committedDate":"2026-08-28T08:48:57Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"1ba649241f9cd6a39ec23363752e05edc31910a8"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-28T08:05:41Z","committedDate":"2026-08-28T08:05:41Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"34010d59d825d98d30ec86f332f238eed0f169a4"},{"author":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"authoredDate":"2026-08-28T07:36:06Z","committedDate":"2026-08-28T07:36:06Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","repositoryId":1349327299,"sha":"a0940bb265975b3c00827d9c0ede2fedaa5922f3"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:25:16.312Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/63270d1869e8ee299faa24fc22991885e741b27d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:25:16Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:25:16Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"message":"feat: 创意分组三端同题（4 页面 × React/Vue/Angular）\n\n新增 4 个创意页面，三端路由完全一致：\n- /creative  创意实验室（粒子星轨/打字机/聚光卡片/3D 翻转/涟漪/磁性按钮；\n  Vue 与 Angular 另含 ⌘K 命令面板）\n- /data-viz  可视化实验室（力导向图/螺旋词云/热力矩阵，纯算法无图表库）\n- /orbit     星际轨道（八大行星按真实轨道要素运行，数据由 Python 产出）\n- /playground 创意 Playground（32 个算法 demo，分 6 组）\n\n架构：\n- src/creative/demos.js 为唯一真相，纯 canvas 零框架 API\n- scripts/sync-creative-demos.mjs 同步到 vue-app/angular-app（带自动生成横幅）\n- 三端薄壳对照同一契约：React useRef+useEffect / Vue 普通变量+watch /\n  Angular 私有字段+effect；逐帧数据不进框架状态，HUD 500ms 写 DOM 一次\n\n配套：\n- data/orbital-elements.json 轨道要素 + scripts/orbit-data.py 生成脚本\n- design-system-workbench/ 设计系统工作台独立页\n- tests/unit/creative-demos.test.mjs（90 项，含 sync 一致性断言防漂移）\n- README 三端各补「页内导航条两段式布局」与创意分组文档\n- changelog/releases.js + 对应单测同步更新\n- scripts/ssr-smoke.mjs 适配新页面（8 页 76 断言全过）\n\n校验：npm test 280/280 · npm run test:ssr 8/8 · npx eslint . 零报错","tree":{"sha":"59bd00b240c7b1002632a8387bf23bef8d4d9e8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/trees/59bd00b240c7b1002632a8387bf23bef8d4d9e8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/commits/63270d1869e8ee299faa24fc22991885e741b27d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/63270d1869e8ee299faa24fc22991885e741b27d","node_id":"C_kwDOUG0Zw9oAKDYzMjcwZDE4NjllOGVlMjk5ZmFhMjRmYzIyOTkxODg1ZTc0MWIyN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c","sha":"b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c"}],"sha":"63270d1869e8ee299faa24fc22991885e741b27d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/63270d1869e8ee299faa24fc22991885e741b27d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:01:42Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:01:42Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"message":"feat(micro): qiankun 微前端重构 + 子应用页内导航反馈强化\n\n## 一、三项目拆分与运行时融合\n- Vue 3 / Angular 22 不再挂在 React 桥里，下沉为 `micro-apps/{vue-app,angular-app}` 两个独立工程\n- 主应用新增 `/micro-vue`、`/micro-angular` 独立宿主页（一页只加载一个子应用）与 `/micro-frontend` 串行演示页\n- 竞态根因：vite-plugin-qiankun 在 dev 下把生命周期挂在全局单例，同页并发加载两子应用互相覆写导致\n  bootstrap 超时 → 架构上用「一个宿主页一个子应用」消灭\n- 主应用侧新增 `src/micros/{config,qiankunHost,useSubAppLoader}.js`、`src/contexts/SubAppContext.jsx`、\n  `src/pages/{SubAppPage,MicroFrontendDemo}`；侧边栏新增「子应用」菜单组（框架色点 + 当前页定位）\n- 删除旧的挂载桥与旧页面：`mountVueBridge` / `mountAngularBridge` / `VueMenu` / `VueComponents` /\n  `StyleShowcase.vue` / `AngularComponents.ts`\n\n## 二、两个子应用的能力补全\n- Vue：58 个 utils + 21 个 composables + 14 个零依赖组件 + 8 个自定义指令 + 4 个 store + 10 个新页面\n- Angular：对应 utils + 6 个 DI 服务 + 8 个管道 + 7 个指令 + 10 个自有组件 + 10 个视图 + core 能力层\n- 路由补全（两端）：history 双模式（独立 Web / 融合 Memory、hash）、嵌套路由与动态段、\n  鉴权闭环（beforeEach / canActivate 改道 /login?redirect=… → 登录 → 回跳）、resolve 预取、404 兜底\n- 子应用内导航条改为**常驻显示**：qiankun 融合时主应用侧边栏在宿主页之外且异步注册，\n  子应用内部原本一个路由入口都看不到\n\n## 三、页内导航「当前页」反馈强化（本次核心）\n问题：22 条 / 14 条链接密集换行成 3 行 / 2 行，同尺寸的小色块混在里面根本抓不住眼睛。\n做法是四层信号叠加（类名统一：菜单 `is-active`、命中分组 `is-current`）：\n- 框架色渐变实心胶囊 + 白字 700；彩色光晕外圈；`::before` 6×6 前置圆点；`navPop`/`ngTabPop` 弹入动画\n- 命中分组染色 + 「当前页 · 标题」徽标（徽标用浅底彩字，避免两个实心胶囊抢重心）\n- `:active` 态 scale(.95) 给出按下反馈；Vue 侧另加 `<router-view v-slot>` + `<transition>` 换页淡入\n\n## 四、顺带修掉的真 bug\n- Angular `routerLinkActiveOptions` 用 `{ exact: true }` 简写等价于 queryParams 精确匹配，\n  守卫改道到 `/login?redirect=…` 后「登录」反而不高亮 → 改显式 `{paths:''exact'', queryParams:''ignored'', …}`\n- Angular `main.ts` 的 `hostProps = props` 触发 TS2559（QiankunProps 与全可选的 HostProps 无共同属性）→ 只挑字段收编\n- Angular 兜底页（`**` 404）徽标退化成「当前页 页面」→ 增加沿 routerState 取最深一层 `data.title` 的兜底\n- Vue `store/index.js` 导成对象常量导致 `useThemeStore is not a function` → 改用 `singleton()` 包装导出工厂函数\n- Angular 模板 `(click)=\"selected.set(new Set())\"` / `@for (p of officialPairs; …)` 漏 `()` 两处模板运行时报错\n\n## 五、校验\n- `npx eslint .` 零报错；`npm test` 190/190；主应用构建 ✅；`npm run test:qiankun` ✅\n- vue-app 构建 ✅ 3.08s；angular-app `tsc --noEmit` ✅ + 构建 ✅ 12.74s\n- 全视图诊断 36/36 路由零 console error（Vue 22 + Angular 14）\n- 新脚本 `scripts/{qiankun-smoke,qiankun-diag,subapp-views-diag,page-diag}.mjs`；\n  `subapp-views-diag` 升级为双重断言：无 console error + 被点的那条真的拿到 `is-active`\n  （并把打印文本剔除页内导航条，否则 22 条导航文案会挤掉真实页面内容导致\"看起来都通过\"）","tree":{"sha":"5bc840cf82dde7e44268e853fd3c68205b8da254","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/trees/5bc840cf82dde7e44268e853fd3c68205b8da254"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/commits/b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c","node_id":"C_kwDOUG0Zw9oAKGIwOTk1YWY2NzY3M2IwOTI5NTM4NjM2ZDRhNTY2MjA1YzMyM2I3OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/dd9ff0dd64a8f25d9e68593f1d572273a28716b6","sha":"dd9ff0dd64a8f25d9e68593f1d572273a28716b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/dd9ff0dd64a8f25d9e68593f1d572273a28716b6"}],"sha":"b0995af67673b0929538636d4a566205c323b78c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/v