，点击即可恢复，避免隐藏后找不到入口\n- 跳转延迟：App 路由改为具名 loader，requestIdleCallback 空闲时预热全部\n  路由 chunk，消除首次进入页面的 Suspense 加载等待\n\n功能补全（此前未提交）：\n- 语音助手封装为 VoiceAssistantPanel 弹窗组件，任意页面可调用（与 AI Agent 一致）\n- 可拖动快捷助手键 QuickAssistant：开关 AI Agent / 语音助手、页面快捷跳转、\n  回到顶部、隐藏/恢复；位置与状态持久化\n- AssistantProvider + 命令式 API（openAssistant / window 事件），支持 React/Vue/原生 JS 唤起\n- /voice 页面复用 VoiceAssistantPanel（embedded 模式）；新增 /assistant-demo 演示页\n- GlobalAgent 受控模式；UniversalPageAgent 支持 pendingTask 回填","tree":{"sha":"24310d66ed66314634620c795e726ca099a4bbbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/trees/24310d66ed66314634620c795e726ca099a4bbbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/commits/2fa3b5d3d968d1ea2ffd76e2056666afc7cf5d2c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/2fa3b5d3d968d1ea2ffd76e2056666afc7cf5d2c","node_id":"C_kwDOUG0Zw9oAKDJmYTNiNWQzZDk2OGQxZWEyZmZkNzZlMjA1NjY2NmFmYzdjZjVkMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45","sha":"fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45"}],"sha":"2fa3b5d3d968d1ea2ffd76e2056666afc7cf5d2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/2fa3b5d3d968d1ea2ffd76e2056666afc7cf5d2c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:52:23Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T09:52:23Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"message":"docs: 补全 5 个 Vue 包 README 并交叉引用，修正根 README 包数量\n\n- 新增 5 个此前缺失的 Vue 包 README（vue-core-composables /\n  vue-media-tools / vue-svg-charts / vue-ui-basic / vue-admin-shell），\n  含安装、用法、完整导出表与 peerDependencies 说明\n- 6 个 React 包 README 顶部增加「Vue 3 版本」交叉引用链接\n- 根 README 修正：npm 包数量 6 → 12（6 React + 6 Vue），\n  独立 npm 包段落同步更新，v3.1.0 版本历史补充 Vue 包发布说明","tree":{"sha":"fe09f9dc7cb16b315284d0815e3361ce40d15c00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/trees/fe09f9dc7cb16b315284d0815e3361ce40d15c00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/commits/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45","node_id":"C_kwDOUG0Zw9oAKGZlYzNhNDM5ZTA4ZDc1Mjk5Y2Q5OGQ3NzQ3N2NlOTZiNzhhNWZiNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27","sha":"0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27"}],"sha":"fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/fec3a439e08d75299cd98d77477ce96b78a5fb45"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:49:48Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T07:49:48Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"message":"feat: 完成 6 个 React 包的 Vue 3 移植，支持 Vue 引入\n\n- 新增 6 个 @myorg/vue-* 包，与 React 包一一对应：\n  vue-styles-reset / vue-core-composables / vue-ui-basic /\n  vue-media-tools / vue-svg-charts / vue-admin-shell\n- vue-admin-shell 三模块全量移植：AdminLayout / GlobalAgent /\n  UniversalPageAgent / TestCenter；NLP 页面操作内核抽为\n  框架无关的 agentEngine.js，React/Vue 共用\n- React 包抽取框架无关内核（AuthProvider/useAuth、Theme/Notification\n  context、QrScannerOverlay 等），支撑 Vue/React 双端复用\n- 新增 Vue 接入示例页面（VueComponents / StyleShowcase /\n  Compare 对照、AntdDemo、EChartsDemo 等）与 README 文档","tree":{"sha":"738ad5bfad064a5b654d34a3d9e226c9b3cd020b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/trees/738ad5bfad064a5b654d34a3d9e226c9b3cd020b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/git/commits/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27","node_id":"C_kwDOUG0Zw9oAKDBhYWI2NTlkYTc1ZGVkY2Y4MTc1ZWE3ZTUwOTBlZmNkZWU0MGViMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commit/1ba649241f9cd6a39ec23363752e05edc31910a8","sha":"1ba649241f9cd6a39ec23363752e05edc31910a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/1ba649241f9cd6a39ec23363752e05edc31910a8"}],"sha":"0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/0aab659da75dedcf8175ea7e5090efcdee40eb27"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jimGJW/vite-react-demo/commits/1ba649241f9cd6a39ec23363752e05edc31910a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:48:57Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-28T08:48:57Z","email":"jim_gjw@163.com","name":"顾佳炜"},"message":"chore: publish 5 new npm packages + update README usage docs\n\n- packages/@myorg/react-styles-reset: design tokens + global reset (0 deps)\n- packages/@myorg/react-core-hooks: AuthProvider + useWebQrScanner + useWhisperRecorder (@huggingface external, 1.3MB dist)\n- packages/@myorg/react-ui-basic: Theme / Notification / CommandPalette / DataTable / StarArray 365-star array (pure react+scss)\n- packages/@myorg/react-media-tools: QrScanBtn + VoiceInput (web-speech + local whisper)\n- packages/@myorg/react-admin-shell: AdminLayout / Glo