8e4616684df1c1cbcf2679e1370f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/f8aee555fde8e4616684df1c1cbcf2679e1370f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/815eca0991d8553d0bb99cdcca5e9e9e21c02ee5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:09:59Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:09:59Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"fix(system): 收敛 el-table 行类型为领域类型，修复 9 处 vue-tsc 类型错误\n\nCI 第一步就是 npm run type-check，这 9 处错误让前端 CI 卡在最前面必红（roles/users/menus/dict 四个系统管理页）。根因：el-table 插槽解构出的 row 被推断为 element-plus 的 DefaultRow（索引签名对象），无法赋给要求 SystemRoleItem/SystemUserItem/SystemMenuNode/DictTypeItem/DictItemItem 的处理函数。修法：各页加一个 asXxx(row: unknown) 收敛函数，模板调用处包一层——保持处理函数签名严格，也不依赖模板中的 TS 断言；dict 的 current-change 另加 onTypeCurrentChange 包装以对齐回调签名。修复后 vue-tsc 0 错误、vitest 389、gate:screen PASS、eslint 0 error。","tree":{"sha":"58d4ac8b402349742ff45f16a91b5418ba664982","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/58d4ac8b402349742ff45f16a91b5418ba664982"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/815eca0991d8553d0bb99cdcca5e9e9e21c02ee5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/815eca0991d8553d0bb99cdcca5e9e9e21c02ee5","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDgxNWVjYTA5OTFkODU1M2QwYmI5OWNkY2NhNWU5ZTllMjFjMDJlZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a","sha":"31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a"}],"sha":"815eca0991d8553d0bb99cdcca5e9e9e21c02ee5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/815eca0991d8553d0bb99cdcca5e9e9e21c02ee5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:51Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:51Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"chore(lint): 修掉 3 处 lint error，并为 scripts 下 mjs 放开 ban-ts-comment\n\nnpm run lint 此前实测 3 error 且 CI 从不调用，等于 lint 形同虚设。修复：删 build-subapps.mjs 未使用的 readFileSync 导入；scripts/**/*.mjs 是纯 Node 脚本、不参与 vue-tsc（tsconfig 只覆盖 src），其顶部 @ts-nocheck 属有意为之，在 eslint 中对该目录关闭 ban-ts-comment。修复后 eslint 0 error（剩 18 warning 不阻塞）。","tree":{"sha":"08258343fe8b83d499241cc1ab5d07460fa5f01c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/08258343fe8b83d499241cc1ab5d07460fa5f01c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDMxZDYzODI0YTY1MmZhMDY5NmZlODhjODZjMTc4MmU5MmM5YWNjMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e","sha":"167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e"}],"sha":"31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/31d63824a652fa0696fe88c86c1782e92c9acc1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:39Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:39Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"fix(services): 修复告警去重导致的单测隔离失败，前端测试恢复 389 全绿\n\n此前 vitest 基线实为 379 passed / 10 failed（前端 CI 因此必红），而各处记要长期写作 389 全绿，问题被掩盖。根因：48d7189 引入的 notifyBackendOffline 按 domain:endpoint 去重是对的，但 backendStatus.unavailableDomains 是模块级单例、跨用例共享，前一个用例登记过的键会让后一个用例不再 console.warn，导致所有断言失败要告警的用例集体失败。修法落在测试侧（保留生产去重语义）：导出 resetBackendOfflineNoticesForTest()，在 5 个受影响 spec 的 beforeEach 重置。修复后 62 文件 389 全通过。","tree":{"sha":"9c32a9ee7c177a0b82bc4e2471322d6b2d796a82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/9c32a9ee7c177a0b82bc4e2471322d6b2d796a82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDE2N2Y1NjY0YmZiYTQxYTE1YWQyMWQ0ODQ0NjEyYTc0ZGZjNmRlMWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7","sha":"6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7"}],"sha":"167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/167f5664bfba41a15ad21d4844612a74dfc6de1e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:24Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T16:03:24Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"perf(services): GET 请求并发去重，避免大屏重复拉取与响应竞态\n\n大屏 7x24 常驻，组件重挂载或多面板同时初始化会对同一端点并发发起相同 GET，既浪费带宽，也可能因响应先后不一出现数据闪回旧值。让飞行中的相同 GET 共享同一 Promise。安全边界（刻意设计）：仅 GET 参与；带 signal 或显式 dedupe:false 不参与——写操作去重会丢请求，一个调用方取消会连带影响共享同一 Promise 的其他调用方。请求 settle 后无论成败都清理键，避免失败请求永久占位。","tree":{"sha":"c1b3aae9bed916b1e2763151b308fe392a32cf40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/trees/c1b3aae9bed916b1e2763151b308fe392a32cf40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/git/commits/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7","node_id":"C_kwDOUG1J2doAKDZmY2EzZjk3ZjgwYjUwOGVlYWYzMzM0YmNiZjY2YTJlMWM2NmFlYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commit/75182b931dc6d8affa9aae08810e0ddd544bd384","sha":"75182b931dc6d8affa9aae08810e0ddd544bd384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/75182b931dc6d8affa9aae08810e0ddd544bd384"}],"sha":"6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/6fca3f97f80b508eeaf3334bcbf66a2e1c66aeb7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/7777even/mm-security-platform-scaffold/commits/75182b931dc6d8affa9aae08810e0ddd544bd384/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:40:21Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T15:40:21Z","email":"scaffold@local","name":"scaffold-bot"},"message":"chore(types): 同步 unplugin-vue-components 自动生成的组件